<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Guyeiti</para>
  <para style="toc1">GALA Sɛʋɛi Ma Wuyeiti</para>
  <para style="toc2">Guyeiti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Guy</para>
  <para style="mt1">GALA Sɛʋɛi Ma Wuyeiti</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛʋɛi nii ɠa ga guye zɛʋɛi ta GALA maanɛɛnɛ zɛʋɛi. Eɓulu wooi zu, daaseigi ɠa ga «Maamusɛ wuyeiti». Tama guye mɔinmɔin ka su, niiti ti GALA maamusɛzu ti zu, kɛlɛ guyei ma zii ɠiligaa ta su ɓalaa. Tanigaa ta ga GALA falii, GALA ná-kpɔbai maaloli fai zu, tanigaa ma ti ga gɔlɔ wooiti niiti ti ziiɓɔlɔ wolai ɠulazu kɛlɛma. Guyei tanigaa ta Izilayɛle masagi maamusɛzu, tanigaa ti ɗa nuiti kala ga ɠimalai ta GALA ziimai, naa ʋɛɛ faa ɠiligaa ʋa. Nu mɔinmɔin ka é guye zɛʋɛi nii zɛʋɛai, gaalɛba vai kona un mɔinmɔin seɠeʋɛ. Guyei tanigaa ta guye wɔlɔma wɔlɔmagiti niiti ti zɛʋɛai masagi Davide ná-yeeɠɛɠalai zu. Tama GALA daawooi ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛ Davide ma guyei ma mɔinmɔin sɛʋɛʋɛ. Tanigaa zɛʋɛʋɛ siɛgi zu Zuifuiti ti ɠaleni la ma, ti ɠula duɔlai zu Ɓaɓilɔne. Faaɠwɛ nu wolaiti ti ɠɛ guye zɛʋɛi zeelini kwɛgi ma kona unnaanigɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta unfelegɔi (400-200), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ. Kɛʋele ɠaaɓelagi naa zu guye ungila puulɔɔlugɔi (150) naati gaaɠwɛʋɛ su ga guye zɛʋɛ ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛ dɔɔlugɔ. É ɠɛni ga guye ɓaa GALA falii, ti pɛ ti zɛʋɛʋɛ kidafaawui ɠɛʋelei zu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Guye zɛʋɛi nii ɠa sɛʋɛi naati saama, niiti ti wola ɠwɛɛgai ta ti lɔɠɔ wola ɠulaai GALA Daawoo Zɛʋɛi zu. Ti ɠɛni sɛʋɛi nii wola ɠalasu gaalɛbaiti su, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu Zeluzalɛme. Guyeiti ta ade ɠalasu ga ʋelei nu a GALA fali ɠɛɛ la, ta é GALA maamusɛ. Guyei puufelegɔ maazu saʋagɔi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 23">23</ref></char>) nu mɔinmɔin iɲɔdɔa, niiti saa loai ti ma. Guyei puulɔɔlugɔ maazu ɠilagi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 51">51</ref></char>) ɓɔga ma mɔinmɔin ba, ti lo zoga ga ta-ɠotoiti GALA gaazu. Guyei ungila puugɔi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110">110</ref></char>) ɠa iɲɔdɔɔi ta kitogi veezu é lo Mesi ʋaa vai ʋa, nii é ɠɛɛzu ga masagi ta zalaɠa ɠula nui.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sɛʋɛ mɔungi zu wuyeiti ta ga 1 é li 41.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Sɛʋɛi velesiɛi zu wuyeiti ta ga 42 é li 72.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Sɛʋɛi zaʋasiɛi zu wuyeiti ta ga 73 é li 89.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Sɛʋɛi naanisiɛi zu wuyeiti ta ga 90 é li 106.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Sɛʋɛi lɔɔlusiɛi zu wuyeiti ta ga 107 é li 150.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 1-41">Guyeiti 1—41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Undaanɛ ɠitei</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naa, nii é la ziɛzu ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-lɛnɛ gooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">é la ziɛzu ga kotoba nuiti siɛ ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">é la zeizu ɲɛɛɠulasu nuiti ta-ɓɔkpɔgi ma.<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>Kɛlɛ ziima vai ɠa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">é ɗa ɠizɛ ná-tɔgi zu, folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ gului nii siingai ziɛlaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">é gwaai wosu ga gwaa yeeɠɛɠalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">gaalaagi la ʋooloa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">nii kpein é kɛɛzu, ta ɗa zoloo.<verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>É la ɠana ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">ti ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ molo ɠalai fiilɛi liizu la.<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>Naa ɠa é ba, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti la losu zɔlɔɔga tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">Kotoba nuiti ɓalaa, ti la zeizu zɔlɔɔga telebo nuiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu ɠa telebo nuiti ta-ʋelei ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">Kɛlɛ kotoba nuiti ta-ʋelei ɠa liizu ga tiye undaaʋiligi zu.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s">Masagi zei vai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>Leeni vaa zu zii ɠiligiti ti ɠɛɛzu unga wuulee?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">Leeni vaa zu ziiti pɛ ti kisiɛ ɲakaiti bosu?<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Zou masagiti ta kɔɔi ɓɛtɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">kundiɠiiti ti ɗa yaavai ɓɛtɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">ta ná-zunui nii é gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma.<verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>Ti ɠɛ ma: «Ade galui vie ɓɔɠɔ ma, nii de ɠiliai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">de ta-yɔlɔɠɔiti pili ya, maaɠooza de ʋa!»<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>Kɛlɛ Maliɠii GALA ka zeini ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">é ɗa ɲɛɛi wo, é ɗa ɲɛɛɠula ti zu.<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>Toɠa ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ, ná-ziiɠaawanai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">é ti maalua ná-ziiɠulagi zu, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>«Nà ɠa gè nà-masagi zeiɗai Siyɔn, nà-gize ɲadegai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">gè gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛ ma.»<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>Nà devei naa lɛ adaʋɛ pɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">É ɠɛni mà: «Ɗa ga dòun zunui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">za, gè è ɠɛa ga dòin.<verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>Zii ɠiligiti fali mà, nà ti ve è ya ga ɗɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">ɗa zooi zɔlɔɔ ga ɗɔnɔ, é li zou ɓela ga,<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>ɗa ti maaɠolo ga kɔlu lukpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">ɗa ti wolowolo eɠɛ pɔlɔ liɠii.»<verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>Niizu, masagiti à kidafaawui ɠɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">À ɠigi zɔlɔɔ, wɔi wo zeini eteai unda.<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi dualuagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">à ɠoozunɛ, wo zasu ɗa ɓali gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>À ɓɔɠɔ unmaayei GALA doun zunui ʋɛ, nii a kɛ é mina yiiɠaawana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">wo undaa a ʋa ʋili, wɔi kpein wo ziɛzu ga pelei naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Mazɔlɔɔ ná-ziiɠaawanai zuvilɛʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati kpein, niiti ti ʋoluzeizu ba, ti lɔɔɠu pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kizogi zeɠeʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>Davide ná-guyei, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni ʋelazu la ná-doun zunui Aɓasalɔme ʋa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 15:13-18:18">2Sa 15:13—18:18</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, sìli nuiti mɔinʋɛ gola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:2">Ungo, sìli nuiti mɔinʋɛ gola, ti wuzeɠeai dàalɔɠɔma!<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>Nuiti mɔinʋɛ ti ɠɛɛzu ma nà-faa zu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">«Ná-kpɔba nɔpɛ ge la mɔ zɔlɔɔga GALA zea!»</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:3">Lo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lo!</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Niima wooi wo daa ɠɛɛʋɛ ga puulɔfela maazu ɠila (71) guye zɛʋɛi zu. Eɓulu wooi nii é ga «sela», naa ɠa tatigai ɠana. Poluʋɛ ɓɔɔɓɔgi la ɠwɛɛni. Poluʋɛ tanigaa ta ga niiti: </char><char style="fqa">tago looɠogi guyei zu</char>, ɓaa <char style="fqa">ta siɛposui</char>, ɓaa <char style="fqa">maamusɛi ma ʋoogi</char>.</note><verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è bɛ̀ ga kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">ɗa ga mà zaalai, ɗa nɔ̀ungi wuzeɠezu.<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>Nà wooɠulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma ga kpeei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">toɠa yɛsu ná-gize ɲadegai ma, é gòoɠaaʋote.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>Gè la, gè ɲi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">gè wuzeɠe, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa màkɛsu.<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>Gè la lua nu waa mɔinmɔingiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">niiti ti dàalɔɠɔma mini-o-mini.<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>Wuzeɠe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">Kìzo, nà-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">Tɔɔzei ɗa sìli nuiti kpein doɠazu ti-woizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">ɗa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ɲiigaiti galeɠalezu.<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 3:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa ɗa nu ɠizo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:9">Ɗa-luyai ɠɛ ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ba.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:9">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 3:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ziilɛigi veezu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu ga kɔnigiti. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>Siɛgi zu gè wooɠulazu la è ma, gòoɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">GALAGI nii é ga nà-telebodai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Kidaaʋiligi zu, ɗa ìɲɔdɔɔzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">Zaalai la mà, è woilo nà-fali wooiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>Wɔi wo ga nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">wa yɛsu nà-lɛbiyai maaɓoozu, eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">Wa yɛsu faa ɲakai nɛɛzu ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">wo ɗa zɛɛi ɠaiziɛ, eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 4:3">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>À suɠwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiimazeɠeʋɛ ga zunu ɠila, nii é ga wooɠɛɠila nu tɔun bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">toɠa ɗa gòomɛni, siɛgi zu gè tolisu da.<verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>Wa yiiɠaawanana, à mina koto ɠɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">À kisiɛi wo wa-ʋetei zu, wo maaɠɛ kpɔ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 4:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>À zalaɠaiti kula, niiti ti zoloogai tɔgi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">à ɓɔɠɔ ɠaliva Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.<verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>Naati mɔinʋɛ, niiti ti gaazaɠagi wosu ga: «Mini ɠa gá-undaanɛɛi ʋaazu, é zeɠe ná?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è-ɠaazuʋɛ ma wozakalagi lo gi ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>Ɗa koozunɛɛi ʋuuzu zìimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">é leʋe ta-molo leʋe ziɛgi zu ʋa, ta ta-lɔɔ niinɛi ʋu ziɛgi zu ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 4:9"/>Nà laana nɔ feya, nà ɲi ziilɛigi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:9">Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠila kpe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:9">ɗa sèizu ziilɛigi zu.<verse eid="PSA 4:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s">Lo tùɠɔ pelei zu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu ga kooleiti. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo gòoi ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">Kpalagi gè bosu gaaɠa!<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>Ɠida nà-kpee loligi wu, nà-masagi, nà-GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa gè è valizu.<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gosui, ɗa ɗa gòoi mɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">sobui, nà ɗa ʋa è ʋɔ bɛ, gè ɗa è maaɓɔun.<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è la ga GALAGI, nii faa ɲɔi nɛai bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">Faa ɲɔi la zeizu zɔlɔɔga è ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>Ɠimalala nuiti ti la zooga ti ʋa lo è ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">naati wɔin la è ma, niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>Ɗa zɛɛ wo nuiti kpein undaaʋili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">Nu ʋaa nuiti ta yaava nuiti wɔin la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>Ɗa-wooɠɛɠilada wolai ʋɔ, nii kpela ge la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">nà zoo gè lɛ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">è ɠaazuluabai é zèa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">nà nɔkɔ è wu, è zei ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu.<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, lo tùɠɔ ɗa-lelebodai zu, sìli nuiti maaʋele ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">Ɗa-ʋelei ɠaa ɠɛ sɔli tùɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nu nɔpɛ ge la laa ti-wooiti da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">ti ɠoozu ɠisiɛi kpein ka ga faa ɠoloɠologi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">ti-ɠɔdayeɠei ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ kabayeɠei daalaogai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">ti-nɛgi ɠa ga yaava anii.<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>Ee, GALA, ti leve ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti, è ti zo ɠana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">Ti ɠoozu ɠisiɛi ɠɛ ga ti loo zaɓui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">Ti ʋili ya ta-lɔ koloɠologiti maaʋele ma, nii gaa la luga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">Mazɔlɔɔ ta wuzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>Kɛlɛ niiti kpein ti lɔɔɠuzu è ʋɔ bɛ, ta ɠoozunɛ è ʋɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">Ta ɠoozunɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ, ɗa ɓaa ti maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">ta ɠoozunɛ è ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">niiti è-laaseigi nɛai ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 5:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗɔun ɗa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa tuya loo telebo nui ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:13">Ɗa ɓaa maazu ga ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai, eɠɛ kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi.<verse eid="PSA 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kpɔbai ɠaiziɛ vai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É looni ga kɔnigiti, niiti galu lɔsaʋai ti ɠa. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mina dòɠa ɗa-yiiɠaawanai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">mina kòlo ɗa-yiiɠulagi zu.<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, màawɔinɠa, mazɔlɔɔ zɛbɛ nɔpɛ ge la mɔ bà!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, bàlo, mazɔlɔɔ sàsu ɠa ɓalizu,<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>zìi ɗa wola ɓali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">Yeelɛ ɠa è ʋaazu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-kpɔba vai ma?<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>Ʋa bɛ̀ mɔnɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ùnmɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">kìzo ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niiti ti zaai, naati ti la zooga ti ʋa ɠisiɛ è zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é è maamusɛ gɔvɛalaazu?<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>Gè yɛga kpalagi wola wosu, gaaɓaai ɠula sù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">nà laani nà-betei zu, kpidii kpein gè ɗa wɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">dàazuʋɛ yɛɓɛa, é lɛilɛi ga gàazuɗɛi.<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>Gàazuɠɛzɛiti ti wɔlɔzaɠaga ga ziizoolɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">ta wɔlɔzaɠasu, tɔɔzei sìli nuiti ta-vaa zu.<verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>À maaɠooza bà, faa ɲɔu ɓɛtɛ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nà-gɔlɔ wooiti mɛnini.<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezeini nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooiti bu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vaani nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi wu.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 6:11"/>Sìli nuiti kpein ta unfe, ti zasuɓali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:11">ti ɠula ʋolu gaamanɔ, ti pɛ ti unfe.<verse eid="PSA 6:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI potokulai wo bɛ̀</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>Davide ná-maawɔin wuyei, é tooni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ʋilɛ Kuse ʋa, Ɓɛnzamɛn nui.<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, nà lɔɔɠuzu ɠaiziɛzu è ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">kìzo wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti kpein ma, ùnmɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>nii a kɛ ti mina bàli ga eɠɛ zalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">nii a ɗa li ga anii, nu la kula zea.<verse eid="PSA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ná-GALAGI, ni gè naa ɠɛɛʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">eɠɛʋelei ti pèelalazu la, ni gè ɲamaba vaa ɠɛɛʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>ni gè ɓaaɠogɛ bɔ̀ɔlai ta ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">ni gè sìli nui ta maavoogɛ, un ge la ba,<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>naazu sìli nui ʋilɛ pòlu, é sò,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">é ɠɔɠɔlo mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">é nà-lɛbiyai ɓokpo fufiligi zu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 7:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>Wuzeɠe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-yiiɠulagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti ta-yiiɠulagi laalɔɠɔma, ɠaaɓa mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">ɗɛi è faa zɔle fai leveai!<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>Ziiti ti maaɓɔ è-maaɠoolii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">ɗɔun ɗa zei ti unda, è yɛ zeini naa maazuʋɛ, ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗɛi è ga ziiti pɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">tukpɔi lo bɛ̀, kɛ eɠɛʋelei nà-sɔledai la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">É ɠɛ bɛ̀ eɠɛʋelei nà-sɔbalalai la.<verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>Pele ɓesa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-vaa ɲɔi luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">telebo nui ɠɔɠɔ losu ɓɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">ɗɛi è nuiti ziimaʋɛ ʋɛtɛsu, ta ta-ɠisiɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">telebo GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>GALA ka é ga nà-kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">Nii zii zɔlegai, toɠa naa ɠizo.<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>GALA ka ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui nii sɔlegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">nii a ɗa ná-ziiɠaawanai ɠula kɛlɛma voloi faaɠaazagi a ɠɛ la,<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>nui naa laalɔɠɔma, nii é la ʋaazu pɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">GALA ka ɗa ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠaali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">é ná-mɛɛin zumɛɛn, é kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>Toɠa kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti kpɛtɛzu nu ʋaa vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">é mɛɛinti kpɛtɛ niiti abui ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>Wɛlɛ, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa telebotalai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">toɠa kogi zeɠezu ga faa ɲɔi, é sɔlɔɔ ga zɛɛ vai.<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>Toɠa zeɠei wɔɔzu, é bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">é loo zeɠei zu, nii é bɔai.<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>Ná-faa ɲɔi ɠa loozu tɔ ɓɔɠɔi unma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">Ná-suɲɔulai ɠa loozu toʋalaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 7:18"/>Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ná-telebodai maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:18">nà guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi lɛbi vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:18">GALAGI nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda geezuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s">GALA bɔɔlɔ ʋelei, <optbreak/> ta nuɓusɛi ɓalaa losuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei. É loozu kɔnigi ɠa, nii é zeɠezu Gate taazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gi-Maliɠii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">È-laaseigi maayikiʋɛ, eteai zu ná pɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">Ɗa-maayikii é volozu, è naa zeiɗa geeɠɔlɔgi maazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>È lɛbiyai lɔa doungoiti daaʋɛ, ta ɲiimiɓɔlegiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">è wɔinzeɠe nuiti ta-vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">è è zili nuiti gaalɛi, ta potokula nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>Siɛgi zu nà geeɠɔlɔgiti pɛtɛna da, ti ga ɗɔnɔiti, è-yeei ti ɓɛtɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">alugi ta somideɠaiti, è ti ɲɛkpɛai:<verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>Nuɓusɛi ɠa ga leeni, è ʋa ɠigaiziɛ su?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">Nui ɠa ga leeni, è ʋa yiizoolɛ la?<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, è kɛɛʋɛ ga GALA ná-seikobai nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">è lɛbiyai ta unfemai veeʋɛ bɛ, ti ɠɛ unma ga masa bɔɔlɔgi.<verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>È zobogi veeʋɛ bɛ, ga é masadai ɠɛ anii kpein unda, è-yeei ti ɓɛtɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:7">è ti pɛ puuni kɔɠɔwu,<verse eid="PSA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>toganiiti pɛ, ma wolaiti ta ma goiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">anɛɛ dɔɓɔ zuaiti ɓalaa,<verse eid="PSA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>ta wɔniiti, ta kaleiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">ta niiti kpein ti ziɛzu ziɛiti bu.<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 8:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gi-Maliɠii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:10">È-laaseigi maayikiʋɛ, eteai zu ná pɛ!<verse eid="PSA 8:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sɔlegɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Zunu loin ná-saai». Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti. </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei 9 ta 10 ta-zɛʋɛ ɠaeiti ta ga faa ɠila.</char>
    </note>Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">nà ɗa-vaa ʋagɔi kpein bo.<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>Nà ɠoozunɛ è ʋɔ, gè ɠoozunɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">nà guyei loo è-laaseigi lɛbi vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda!<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>Siɛgi zu sìli nuiti ti ɠulazu la ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">ti-ɠɔɠɔi ɠa ɗa ziɠa, ti undaaʋili è ɠakala.<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è màaloboga, è bà vai ɠaaɠula ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">ɗa zeizu ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui sɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>Ɗa ɓaazaɠazu zii ɠiligiti ma, è faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui undaaʋili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">è ti-laaseigi ɓale eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>Sili nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">Ti ɠoloɠologa eyɛsu ɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ è ta-laa wolai lokaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">zeemai woga ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa sei wosu yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">é ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋilɛni tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>Tɔ ɠa é zeini eteai unda ga telebodai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">é ɗa ziiti pɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe ga sɔledai.<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ga siɠigi maanɔɠɔ nui ʋɛ kae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">é ɠɛ bɛ ga siɠigi kidaaʋili siɛgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>Niiti ti è ɠwɛɛ, naati ti la è la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">Mazɔlɔɔ ɗɔun ɗa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è la ɠɛlɛa nu ʋa, nii é ɠaaʋotesu è ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>À Siyɔn masagi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi ga guyeiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">faa wolaiti é ti ɠɛai, à naati bo zii ɠiligiti saama!<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɗa ɲama ʋui ʋotokula, ki ge la ɠula su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">é la yeema maawɔin nuiti ta-ɓee wooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, màawɔinɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">Kpɔlɔi ʋɛtɛ, nii wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti ti dɔ̀ai su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">Ɗa ɠa è lɛɛzu ga ze, è kùla saai ma ziɠidaʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>nii a kɛ è maamusɛ wooi wo Zeluzalɛme taa ziɠidaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">gè ɠɛ koozunɛɛi zu, tɔɔzei gè è zɔlɔɔga ga nà-kizo nui.<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>Zii ɠiligiti ta loozu zeɠei zu, nii ti bɔai ga ti-yeeiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">ti-ɠɔɠɔiti ta lɔɔzu tumɔi zu, nii ti seini dɔɔɠuzu.<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu, é sɔledai ɠɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">Toɠa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui zosu, ga naa ɓɔɠɔi ná-balii.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 9:17">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti, ta zii ɠiligiti, ti la yiizoolɛzu ga GALA ná-faa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">naati ta li gɔvɛalaazu.<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge la yeema pɛ maanɔɠɔ nuiti ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">maawɔin nuiti ta-ɠitogi la ɠoloɠologa eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>Wuzeɠe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nui mina pilɛ sɔlɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">Zii ɠiligiti to ɠaazu, è ta-lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 9:21"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, dualuagi lɔ ti zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:21">Nuɓusɛi naati ti kwɛɛ ga ta ga nuiti nɔ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 9:21">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s">Màliɠii, lee vaa zu?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti. </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei 9 ta 10 ta-zɛʋɛ ɠaeiti ta ga faa ɠila.</char>
    </note>Lee vaa zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è losu ɠoozama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">Lee vaa zu, kidaaʋili foloiti, è lɔɔɠuzu?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-wasogi zu, ta ɗa ʋilɛ maanɔɠɔ nuiti polu, ti ɗa ti ɓɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">ti yee ɠa zeelizu ti ma, ga ti ɠoozu ɠisiɛ ɲɔiti bogai.<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu su, ná-gaazuɠulapɔiti su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">Nui nii kpalaai ga é ɠula za nɔ zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">naa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠotozu, é ɲɛɛɠula su.<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ná-wasogi zu, toɠa ɠɛɛzu ma: «GALA ge la ná!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">GALA ge la ná</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zobo ge la GALA bɛ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">Kisu vai kpein kana, é la wɛlɛzu ɠoozama.<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>Yeenɔpɛ ná-faiti su ɠa ɗa ɓɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">ɗa-leveiti bɔɔlɔʋɛ, ti ɓudɛ ná-faaɠaaɠai maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">toɠa yeelaaʋilisu ga wɔinzeɠe nuiti kpein.<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>Toɠa ɠɛɛzu ma yiimaʋɛ: «Gè la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">Dɔ̀ɔɠuʋɛ, maanɔɠɔ la zeelia mà, eyɛsu ɠɔ, nà yɛ loni kpaan.»<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>Daaʋɛ laavegɛ ga foovooi, yaava wooiti ka ti da, ta ziiɠula vaiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">Suɲɔu vaiti, ta nu maawana vaiti ka ti nɛgi wu.<verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>Toɠa ɗa lɔɔɠu taa loaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">é sɔbalala nui ʋaa, ada maalɔɔɠuai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">Gaazuʋɛ la zeɠea zobotala nui ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>Toɠa laazu ná-dɔɔɠu wosuʋɛ, eɠɛ zalai nii é laani pɛɛzuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">Toɠa lɔɔɠuzu, é ʋa ɠula maanɔɠɔ nui viliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">toɠa ɠulazu maanɔɠɔ nui viliba, é pili ná-tumɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>É ɓili, é maaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">maanɔɠɔ nuiti ti loo zeezu.<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>É ɠɛ ma ziimaʋɛ: «GALA ka ɗa yeema!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">Toɠa ɗa ɠaazuʋɛ lɔɔɠu, é la ɗa ga wɛlɛ pɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>Wuzeɠe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI! GALA yeei wuzeɠe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">Mina yeema maawɔin nuiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Leeni vaa zu, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɲɛɛɠulazu GALA su?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">Lee vaa zu, é bosu ziimaʋɛ ga: «É la màaɠoloa»?<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ɗɔun ɗa, ɗa kpɔlɔi ta maanɔɠɔi ʋɛtɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">ɗa ɠaaɓaazu, è ti pɛ seɠe ya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Zɛbɛsulala nui ɠa ɓɔɠɔ veezu è ya ɲɛgɛlɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">ɗa ɓɔsu podoin ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui yeei ɠaleɠale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">ná-faa ɲɔiti sala, é ɲɛɛlɛ è ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga masagi eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">Zii ɠiligiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe ná-zooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è maawɔin nuiti wɔinma vaiti mɛniga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">Ɗa zɛbɛi veezu ti ʋɛ, è woilo ti-wooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>È sɔle fai ɠɛ podoin ʋɛ, ta maawɔin nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">nii a kɛ, nu vului tanɔpɛ ge mina bɔɔla maalua.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s">Nu lɔɔɠuzu ʋagɔi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 11:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">Dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ ɠa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">Wa zoo ɠale ɠɛɛzu mà:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">«Ʋela è li gizeiti ma, eɠɛ wɔni»?<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta mɛɛin ɠaalɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">ti mɛɛn ɠaei ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ galui ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">ti ʋa pili naati ma kpidii zu, niiti ti-yii zɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>Siɛgi zu ma ɓogiti ti lokasu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">leeni ɠa telebo nui a kɛ?<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa sei ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">gaazuʋɛ ɠa wozaɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">toɠa wɛlɛzu ga ɠaazuʋɛ, é ɗa nuɓusɛiti sumɔ.<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa telebo nui ta faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-vai wuuʋɛtɛsu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">Toɠa naama nui wɔinzeɠezu, nii toomai nɛai bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>É abulekai ʋu kae faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ma, nii é ɠalazu ga timinigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">Fiilɛ ɓadii nii é galai wosu, naa ɠa é ga ta-ɠulanumai.<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɔlegɛ, telebo faiti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">Nuiti ti zɔlegai, naati ta gaazuʋɛ ʋɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ɗa ná-minazeɠegiti daazeeli</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É looni ga kɔnigi, nii galu lɔsaʋai ga. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kpɔbai ɠɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">Wooɠɛɠila nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ nuɓusɛiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">nu la mɔ laa nu nɔpɛ da.<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Ɛsɛ ka seiɲɔɠɔi yaavazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">ti ɗa ɓɔɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɔ ga yaava lakɔlɔgiti, ta wooveledai ti-yiimaʋɛti.<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yaava lakɔlɔgiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">ta naama nɛgi nii é waso kpɔɛiti bosu.<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>É naati ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe, niiti ti ɠɛɛzu ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">«Ade-nɛgi ɠa é ga ada-zobogi é zɛbɛi veezu ade ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">Ade-lakɔlɔgiti ka ti ɓɔsu ade ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">Ɓɛ ɠa a zei ade unda?»<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">«Bala nuiti maaʋele ma ti ti maanɔɠɔzu, ta maawɔin nuiti ti liizu ga kpalagi woga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">nà ga wuzeɠe gè ti maalobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">gè kizogi ve naati zea, niiti ti ti ʋɛlɛʋilisu.»<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooiti ta ga wooiti ti ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">ti ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ walii puai aniɲakai zu, é zei abui ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">é ɲade ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela.<verse eid="PSA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɓaazu è-laawooi maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">ɗa gi makɛ, è gi ɠizo naama nui ɠilagilagi ma.<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 12:9"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta leʋesu mini-o-mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:9">faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 12:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s">Inɛinɛgi ta ladalai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, eyɛsu yeelɛ? È yeemazu mà kenein?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Ɗa maaɠoozazu bà, eyɛsu yeelɛ?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>Ziizoolɛi ɠa yɛsu mà, zìimaʋɛ eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">Folo-o-folo, ziiɓɔlɔi zìimaʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">Sìli nui ɠa yɛsu wuzeɠezu dàalɔɠɔma, eyɛsu yeelɛ?<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>Wɛlɛ, gòoɠaaʋote, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Gàazuʋɛ zeɠe ma, naa ɠa a kɛ, gè mina ɲi saai zu.<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>Sìli nui mina ɠɛ ma: «Gè vɔniga ma!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">Wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti ti mina ɠoozunɛ, ni nà ɲiikpina.<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>Nɔ̀un nà, dàaʋɛ ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">Koozunɛɛi ɠa zìimaʋɛ laavesu, ɗa-ɠizo faa wolai vaa zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">Nà pɔ gè guyei loo è lɛbi vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è màalatigɛ ga ɗa-vaanɛɛiti.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s">Telebotala eteai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 14:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Ɠimalala nui ɠa ɗa bo yiimaʋɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">«GALA ge la ná!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">GALA ge la ná</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zobo ge la GALA bɛ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Ti ɠakagɛ, ti telebotala ɲɔi ɠɛa, ta maaɲɛɛba vaiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">Gila kpalaa ge la ná, nii é faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛni geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">é unpilɛ, é nuɓusɛiti pɛtɛ zooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">é pɛtɛ, ni nu ɠila kpalaa ka ná, nii ɠi pagɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">é GALA gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Ti pɛ ti ɠakaga, ti kpein ti ɠɛa ga yaava nuiti ʋɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">taɠila kpalaa ge la ná, nii é faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛzu, anɛɛ gila kpalaa.<verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>Nii kpein é telebotala vai ɠɛɛzu, ti la faa ɠaaɠaazu ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">Tɛi ti nà-nuɓusɛiti numasu, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɗa ɓului numa da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">ti la wooɠulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>Naa ɠa ti zasuɓalizu la ga duai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka telebo nuiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>Wa pɔ wo maanɔɠɔ nuiti kisu vaa ʋagɔiti falibo ti unfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ga ti-lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>Nɔ̀un wɔ̀inʋɛ ga gè Izilayɛle ná-kizo fai ɠa, nii é ʋaazu Siyɔn gizei ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti ta-vai valibosu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Zakɔɓe mavofodai ɠa ɠoozunɛ, Izilayɛle ɠa ɠɛ koozunɛɛi zu!<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é zɛnvui wo GALA ba?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɓɛ ɠa a lɛ è zei ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Ɓɛ ɠa deɠɛmu a yɛ ɗa-ɠize ɲadegai ma?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>Zɔi é ziɛzu sɔledai zu, é ɗa telebodai ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">é ɗa gaamai wo ga yiimaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>É la maaɓoo vaa woga ga nɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">é la faa ɲɔu ɠɛa ga seiɲɔɠɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">é la unfetala vaa ɠɛa ga koba nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>Toɠa naama nui laaʋili, nii é la ʋani GALA gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">kɛlɛ toɠa unfe naati ma, niiti ti luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">Toɠa yɛ ná-minazeɠe gooi ʋolu, é so kpaan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">anɛɛ ni naa ɠa ɠɛ ga tɔun kpɔlɔ vaa.<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>É la ná-walii vea nu ya ga talama vaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">É la lobɛani zoga sɔbalala nu laalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Zɔi é ziɛzu ɠana, naa la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ!<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu ʋelei</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 16:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">Ee, GALA, màkɛ! Mazɔlɔɔ nà lɔɔɠuzu è ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>Nà ɗa ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma: «Ɗa ga Màliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">ɗa ga nà-undaanɛɛi, taɠili nɔpɛ ge la ná, a ùndaanɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>Nu ɲadegaiti ti zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">tiya ɓɔɠɔi, ti ga nu wolaiti, naati ka nà ɗa unfe ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>Taɠiligaa ta undaanɛɛi ɠaiziɛzu gala kiligiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">ta ta-ɓɔlɔi mɔinzu ɓɔɠɔ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">Gè la ta-ʋuya zalaɠa ɠula, nii é ga ɲamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">gè la ti-laasei boga ga dàkɔlɔgiti.<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga nà-kulanumai, ta nà-undaanɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">poganii nii gè sɔlɔɔgai, ɗa ɠa è ɓaazu maazu.<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>Gè nɔ̀nɔ ma ʋoganii zɔlɔɔga, nii fizɔgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">toɠa bɛ̀ ga poganii, é kòozunɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mamasu, nii é tɛ̀nɛsu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">Zìi ɓɔɠɔi ɠa ɗa gàanɛɛnɛ kpidii.<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>Gàazu logɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa yeenɔpɛ, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa kòbaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">nii a kɛ gè mina ɲiikpi eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zìi ɠaanɛa, zɛ̀nvui ɗa ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">kpùsɛi ɓɔɠɔi ɠa looɠosu, makɛgai kitogi zu.<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è la ɠɛlɛa bà, gè ʋa yɛ gɔvɛalaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">è la vaa bu ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, é ga wooɠɛɠila nui, é ʋa yei zeɠei zu.<verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>Ɗa zɛnvu ʋelei lɛ ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">koozunɛ wolai ɠa è ɠakalaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">ta ɠɔoɠɔ undaanɛɛi è yeezazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s">Ti ɗa kpɛ̀, un ge la ba</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>Davide ná-GALA falii.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 17:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo màavai ma, nii sɔlegai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">Woilo nà-kpee wooiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">Woiyeɠei laalao nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">nii gè kɛɛzu ga dakɔlɔgi, nii yaava la ba.<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>È nà-telebodai ɠula kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">è-ɠaazuʋɛti ti telebodai wuuzumɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>Zìi zumɔ, è wɛlɛ mà kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">ɗa pòluɠula, è la faa nɔpɛ kaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">Gè deveʋɛ ga gè mina koto ɠɛ kpɔɛzuɠulai zu.<verse eid="PSA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛ ʋa faa nɔpɛ kɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">nà ɓɔɠɔ zosu ga è-laawooiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">gè mina ziɛ ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-ʋeleiti.<verse eid="PSA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>Gè ziɛni ɗa-ʋeleiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">kɔ̀ɠɔiti ti la ɲiikpini.<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>Ee, GALA, nà wooɠulazu è ma, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa gòoɠaaʋote!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">Woii lati dɛɛ mà, è woilo gòoi ma!<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠula kɛlɛma bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">ɗɛi è naati kizosu toosu nuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">niiti ti lɔɔɠuzu ɠaiziɛzu è ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>Makɛ mà ga nu ɠaazuleegi ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">dɔ̀ɔɠu è-ɠoʋegiti ma niinigi wu,<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>màaɠooza sìli nuiti ba, ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">màaɠooza faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ba, ti latisu mà.<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>Maawɔinɠa la ti-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">ti-laaʋɛ ɗa waso kpɔɛi wo,<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>ta kɔ̀ɠɔʋo ba, ti ɠoolia mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">ta ɠaazulosu bà, ti ʋa gàavala zooi ma,<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>eɠɛ zalai nii pului ma, é anii zosu é bali ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">eɠɛ zala yiʋoi nii dɔɔɠuai makɛsuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wuzeɠe, è li è ti laaɠomi, è ti ɠaavala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">Kìzo, è kùla faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti zea, ga ɗa-woɠa zɔkpɔi.<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>Ɗɔun kìzo niima nuiti ma, è-zɛbɛi ʋɔ, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Kùla etea nuɓusɛiti zea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Ta-ɠulanumai ɠwɛɛ ge ɠɛ ga eteai zu nɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Ungo, ti yiɠo, tiya-o, ti-lointi-yo, ga naa, nii è makɛsu ti ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">Ti yiɠo la, ti mɔtai yɛ, ti-mavofodai ya!<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>Nɔ̀un nà, nà-telebodai ʋɔ, nà è-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">nà wuzeɠena feya, è-maaniinigi ɠa zìɠo!<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s">È mama ɗa-unmɔɔ fai zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">2 Samiyɛle 22:1-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nui Davide ná-guyei. É niima wuyei looni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, siɛgi zu naa unmɔɔni da, é kula sili nuiti kpein zeezu, ma un ge la ma mɛɛ ga Sayile.<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>É ɠɛni ma: «È nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-zobogi!<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ga nà-fasai, nà-siɠigi, ùnmɔɔ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">nà-GALAGI, nà-fasai, ʋɛ gè lɔɔɠuzu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">nà-kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi, zobogi nii é kìzosu, nà-siɠi gaaɠoozagi!<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">Siɛgi zu gè tolini da, gè vieni, gè ɠula sìli nuiti kpein zea.<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>«Saai gìlini ga ná-galuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">é ɗa màalua, eɠɛʋelei kɔtuɗɛi la, é faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Gɔvɛalaazu ɠaluiti ti veleveleni mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">saai ná-tumɔiti ti ɠɛ tùɠɔ, ti ɗa màalua.<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>Nà-kidaaʋiligi zu, gè wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">gè ɓainni nà-GALAGI woizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">é yɛni ná-masa pɛlɛi wu, é gòomɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">nà-kpee wooi looni goizu.<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>«Naazu, zooi ɓalini, é ɲiikpi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">gizeiti ma wuulaagiti ti ɓalini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">ti ɲiikpi ná-ziiɠaawanai maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>Duului ɠa ɠulazu sokpayeɠeiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">abui nii é galai wosu, naa ɗa ɠula daaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">ga tiɠilekai é ɗa ɠala.<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>É geeɠɔlɔgi ziɛni su, é yei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">tonaɓiin gaaɠiligai kɔɠɔi wu.<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>É lɛɛni seeluɓɛin ɠɔma, é ɗa ɠoʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">é ʋa fiilɛi ɠoʋegiti kɔma.<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>É kpidii latini ɓɔɠɔ ma, é lɔɔɠu ma ɓiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">fiilɛ wolai ma ɓidii zu, tonaɓiin gaaɠiligai zu.<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Wozakalagi é ɠɛni volozu tuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">sakɔtui ta abulekai niiti ti ɠɛni ɠulazu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">naati ti ɠɛni leʋesu tonaɓiingi zaama.<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa zikɔzu geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa wooi ɠa ɠulazu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai zu, niima wooi ʋɛɛʋɛ ba: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sakɔtui ta abulekai</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, nii ɠulazu puuzu 13 zu.</char></note><verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>É ná-mɛɛinti pilini ga é sili nuiti suvaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">é mainmainti pilini, nii a kɛ ti ʋoluazo.<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Kpoloɗɛi ɓomaʋɛ ɠulani kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">eteai ma wuulaagiti maa ɠɛ kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kpaazaɠai ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">ta sokpayeɠeiti su viilɛi ʋɔ!<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>«É yeemaaleni, é yɛ geezuʋɛ, é nɔ̀un so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">é mɛ̀ɛn, é kùla ziɛ wolaiti ga.<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>É kùlani sìli nu wolai ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu, tama ti zuɓaai nɔ̀un ba.<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>Ti wuzeɠeni dàalɔɠɔma nà-kidaaʋili foloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é loni pòlu.<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>É kùlani faaɓaagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">é kùlani, mazɔlɔɔ nɛ̀ɛʋɛ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vaani bu, é sò eɠɛʋelei nà-telebodai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">é kɛ bɛ̀, eɠɛʋelei zèeiti ɲade pelei la,<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>mazɔlɔɔ gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-peleiti sogɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">gè la maaɠoozani nà-GALAGI ʋa, ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛ vaa maaʋele.<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>Gàazu ɠa ná-tɔgiti ba yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">gè la ɗa ga ná-deveiti daa ɠoba.<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>Gè ɠɛni ga ziimai ɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">gè ɓɔɠɔ zoni ga gè mina faaɠaaza gola ɠɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI sàlani nà-telebo fai maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">eɠɛʋelei zèeiti ti ɲadeni da tɔun gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>«Zɔi é è ʋɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nui, ɗa ɠɛ naa ʋɛ ga wooɠɛɠila GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">zɔi peelalazu la ba, peelalazu la è ʋa naa letema.<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>Zɔi ɲadegai, ɗa ɗa-ɲadedai lɛɛzu ga naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">niiti ti ga yaava nuiti, ɗa ɗa-ɠimalai lɛɛzu ga naati.<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è maanɔɠɔ nuiti kizosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">è gaazulɛɛ nuiti gaazumaayei.<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>Ɗa ɠa è nà-wozakalagi volozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, ɗa nà-kpidii zu ɠɛɛzu kala.<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>Ni ɗa bà, nà ʋili salaʋusu ɓulugi zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">ni nà-GALAGI ɠa bà, nà ʋili gè ɓudɛ siɠigi maazu.<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>«GALA ná-peleiti daazeeliʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ɠoleʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">GALA ka ga kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi naati kpein bɛ, niiti ti lɔɔɠuzu tɔun polu.<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɓɛ ɠa é ga GALA, ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laade?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">Ɓɛ ɠa é ga fasai, ni gá-ƓALAGI laade?<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>GALA ka é sàamaɠilizu ga zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">é nà-pelei ɓɛtɛ ga pagɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>Toɠa kɔ̀ɠɔiti kɛɛzu, eɠɛ dopai ɠɔɠɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">é tò ada ɠaaɠoozagiti.<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>Tɔ ɠa é màalɛlɛzu ga kɔɔɠɔ vai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">mɛɛin é ga kɔlu ɓɔigi kpili fai ɓaai, zèeiti ta mɛɛn ɠae ʋilisu ga naa.<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>Unmɔɔgi è bosu ga ze, naa ɠa é ga nà-kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">ɗa yeezeizu bù ga è-yeezai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">Ɗa-ɓɔbaiti ta sɛ̀bɛlɔɔzu.<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>È-zaalai zu, nà ziɛzu valafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">kɔ̀ɠɔiti ti la liizu ga.<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>«Nà ʋilɛsu sìli nuiti polu, gè yeezeeli ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">gè la ɠalega ma, ni gè la ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋeni.<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>Nà ti ʋalizu ga, ti la zooga ti ʋa wuzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">ti loo kɔ̀ɠɔ wu.<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>Ɗa sàamaɠilizu ga zɛbɛi kɔɔɠɔ vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">ɗa sìli nuiti toozu bu bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>Ɗa sìli nuiti kpɛɛzu tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">nà wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti koloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>Ta kpee loozu ga ti kpɔba zɔlɔɔ, ti la sɔlɔɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">ni ta Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lolina, naa la ti wooɠaaʋotesu!<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>Nà ti ɠɛɛzu ga fufiligi, nii fiilɛi liizu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">gè ti ɓale eɠɛ pele zu ʋalaʋalagi.<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>«È kùla nà-nuɓusɛiti ta-ɓaka fai laawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">è sèiɗa zii ɠiligiti unda ga kundiɠii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">Nuɓusɛiti gè la ti ɠwɛɛ, naati ta botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Nà ti levena nɔ feya, ti ɠolo bɛ̀ gaamanɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">Wɛɛinti ta ʋaazu, ti ɗa tɛ̀ su.<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>Wɛɛinti ta iɲɔteʋei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">ti zasu ɗa ɓali, ta ɠɛna ɠulaa ta-ziɠigi zu.<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa vulua! Mamagi ɠa bɛ, tɔ ɠa é ga nà-fasai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">Ɛsɛ pɛ ge nà-kizo GALAGI maamusɛ,<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>GALAGI é zobo feezu bɛ̀, gè nɔ̀nɔ ʋotokula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">é ziiti kolozu bɛ̀,<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>ɗa kùlazu sìli nuiti zea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">Ɗa sèizu wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">è kùla nu ɲɔiti zea!<verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà è maamusɛ zii ɠiligiti saama, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">Nà guyei loo è-laaseigi lɛbi vaa ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 18:51"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI unmɔɔ faa wolai ɠɛa ná-masagi ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:51">Toɠa wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛɛzu naa ʋɛ, nii gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:51">nii é ga Davide, ta mavofodai, eyɛsu ɠɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 18:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-kulakɛlɛma felegɔiti</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Geeɠɔlɔgiti kpein ta GALA ná-lɛbiyai lɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">somideɠaiti ti geezuʋɛ, naati ta zeei ná-botii lɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Folo ɠilagi ɠa zɔɔma voloi ɠalasu ga naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">kpidi ɠilagi faaɠwɛgi ve zɔɔma ɓidii ya ga naa.<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>Naa la ɠɛɛzu ga wooiti ɓaa kpɔɛzuɠulaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">nii nu a zoo mɛnisu.<verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>Kɛlɛ ti-ma wooi ɠa laazeelizu eteai zu ná pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">Ti-wooi ɗa zeeli zou ɓela ga.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 19:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">GALA ge foloi ná-seɠe ɠotai ɓɛtɛʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ anzazini niinɛi, nii é ɠulazu daa ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">eɠɛ pilɛ sɔlɔɔ nui, é liizu luɠɔ, koozunɛai ga é kpizɛi lɔɔzei!<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>Toɠa ɠulazu geeɠɔlɔgi ɠwɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">é ná-kpizɛi ɠaaɓela zɔɔla ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">ani nɔpɛ ge la lɔɔɠua ná-diegi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi laazeeliʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">toɠa ɗa nu yii niinɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zeele wooi ɠa ga gaamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">toɠa ɗa ɠimalai ve ɠimalala nui ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti sɔlegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">ta ɗa nu ɠoozunɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti suɠalagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">ta ɗa nu ɠaazuzeɠe ma.<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuluabai ɠoleʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">toɠa yɛ kɛʋele ma eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti ta ga gaamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">ti zɔlegɛ gola.<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>Ti vizɔgɛ zanugi ʋa, anɛɛ zanu mɔinmɔingiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">niiti ti-ma nɔɠɔi ɠulaai ti ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">Ti ɲɛmigɛ kɔin gulɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">anɛɛ kɔin gulɔi nii é ɠulazu ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ma zɛpɛgi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-lɔgiti ti ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui loa ɠisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">é ná-kulanuma wola zɔlɔɔgɛ ti zu.<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-gaaɠilimalala vaaɠaazagi ɠwɛɛsu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">Màavaayɛ ga nà-kotoiti, ti lɔɔɠuai, gè la ti ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>Nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, màkɛ, gè mina gaaɠilima ɠoto ɠɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">Ti mina pilɛ sɔlɔɔ mà ga tago ɓalaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">Nà ɠɛ ga telebo nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">gè ɠɛ ga sɔbalala nu, tɔ koloɠologiti faa zu.<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 19:15"/>Yeezei dàawooiti bu ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">ta kòozu ɠisiɛiti è ɠakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:15">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-fasai, ùnmɔɔ nui!<verse eid="PSA 19:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s">Gá-Masagi zobo sɔlɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI è wooɠaaʋote è ɠidaaʋili foloi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI laaseigi è makɛ!<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>É ɗa-ɓɔbai leʋe è ma, é zeɠe seizu ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">é yɛ Siyɔn é yeezei è wu.<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>É ɠizɛ ɗa-vebɛaniiti kpein su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">É yeezei ɗa-zalaɠaiti bu ti ɠalazu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 20:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>É è yiima vai ɠɛ è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">é naati daazeeli, niiti è pɔ è ti ɠɛ!<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Gá wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi ɗa-zobo sɔlɔɔ fai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">gá gá-ƓALAGI ná-ɗalapoi lɛ geezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa naa kpein kɛ, nii è falizu ma.<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>Gè kwɛɛ niina, ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zee ɠa ná-masagi ʋa, nii é gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛni ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">toɠa yɛ ná-ada ɲadegai geezuʋɛ, é gooɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">é unmɔɔ, zeezazu ɓɔba wolai ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Tanigaani zee ɠa ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">tanigaani zee ɠa ta-zooiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">gɔun gá, gá-ɠitogi ɠa ga ɗe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gá-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>Tiya mu ta ɓilisu ti loo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">gɔun, gá yɛsu loni, gi lo kpaan.<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 20:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zobogi ve gá-masagi ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:10">É zoo é gi wooɠaaʋote, siɛgi zu gi wooɠulazu ma la, ga é ɓɔ gi ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 20:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s">Zobo sɔlɔɔ fai ma mamagi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, masagi ɠa ɠoozunɛɛzu è-zɛbɛi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">Ɗa-zobo sɔlɔɔ fai ɠa gola laavesu ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>È ziima anii veeni zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">è la ɠɛni ɠɛlɛni, è ʋa ɓe naa veezu zea, nii é ɠɛni falizu è ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 21:3">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>È ʋaani bɛ ga tuya ʋagɔiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">È masa bɔɔlɔgi lɔ unba nii é ga zanu kitei.<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>É zɛnvui valini è ma, è feeni zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">è sii suɠooza, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>Ná-lɛbiyai wɔɔlɔa, tɔɔzei ɗa-zobogi ʋɔ, nii è feeni zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">è maayikia, é ɗa volo.<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>È kɛɛʋɛ ga tuya ɗɛungi eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">è daavegɛ ga koozunɛɛi è ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Masagi ɠa ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ʋɔ, é la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>Ɗa yeeʋɛɛ è zili nuiti kpein ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">è-yeezai ɠa zeeli è wɔinzeɠe nuiti kpein ma.<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>Ɗa ti ɠɛ ga abuzulugi, siɛgi zu è ɠulazu la kɛlɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ti maaɓɔle ná-ziiɠaawanai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">abui ɠa ti ɠala.<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>Ɗa ti-mavofodai undaaʋili, é ɠula eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">ti-ma zuwu ɠula fulu nuiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Ta faa ɲɔi ɓɛtɛzu è laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">ti kisiɛ ɲɔiti bo, kɛlɛ ti la zobo sɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ti ɓɛ, ti ʋoluazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">ɗa ɗa-mɛɛin ʋili ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 21:14"/>Wuzeɠe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ga è-zɛbɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:14">Gɔun gá, gá pɔ gi guyei loo, gi ɗa-ʋilɛ sɔlɔɔdai maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s">Nà-GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, <optbreak/> leeni vaa zu è ɠɛlɛai bà?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Sobuzobu lopai». Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>Nà-GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, lee vaa zu è ɠɛlɛa bà?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">È loni ɠoozama, è la ʋaazu, è ʋa ɓɔ bà, anɛɛ ni nà kpalagiti bosu?<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>Nà-GALAGI, nà kpeei loozu foloi, è la gòoɠaaʋotesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">gè la maaɠɛsu kpɔ kpidii.<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ɗa ga GALAGI, Ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">ɗa zeini Izilayɛle ná-maamusɛi zaama.<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>Ɗa ɠa gi-mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni ɠalivaazu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">ti ɠɛni ɠalivaazu è ma, è ɗa ti unmɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>Ti ɠɛni wooɠulazu è ma, ti ɗa vie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">ti ɠɛni ɠalivaazu è ma, ti la ɠɛni unfeni pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà, gè ɠɛa ga kpeinɲaɠagi, gè la mɔ ga nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">kɛni fulu nuiti ta-ɲɛɛɠulasu anii, wɔ̀inzeɠea nuɓusɛiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>Nii kpein é pɛ̀tɛsu, naati ta ɲɛɛɠulazu sù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">ti ɗa laaɓɛɛlu, ti ɗa ɠɔmɔɔni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>«É ɠitoni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">deɠɛmu niizu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI fie niina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">Tɔɔzei nɛɛʋɛ bɛ, é kizo na mu!»<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>Ungo, ɗa ɠa è kùlaa dèe ɠoozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">ɗa ɠa è kàlivaani dèe ná-ɲiimiiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>Gè zɔlɔɔni nɔ feya, ti kàliva è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">kùlaai ma dèe ɠoozu nɔ feya, è ɠɛni ga nà-GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>Mina maaɠooza bà, mazɔlɔɔ kidaaʋiligi maaɓuɠa bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">tɔɔzei nu la ʋaazu, é ʋa ɓɔ bà!<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>Sìli nuiti tatigɛ mà, eɠɛ nikɛ zinɛ ɓulugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">Ɓasan nikɛ zinɛ ɓulugi ɠooliʋɛ mà.<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>Ta laalaosu dàalɔɠɔma eɠɛ zalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">nii é anii ʋalizu ga, é ɗa zikɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>Gè ɠɛa eɠɛ ziɛi é yeizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">kàeiti kpein ti ɠula ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">zìi ɠɛa eɠɛ kedoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">gaa ɠa wuunsu, kòozu zɔɔlaiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>Sùvikɛi vɔa, é ʋaliʋali eɠɛ penɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">nɛ̀gi ɗa ɠata dàa ɠoozuʋɛ ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">È dɔ̀a saai ma vufiligi zu.<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gilɛiti ti màaɠooliʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ma ɓulugi màaɠooliʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">ti zèeiti bɔɔʋɛ ta kɔ̀ɠɔiti.<verse eid="PSA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>Nà mà ɠaeiti kpein gaalusu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">Ta naa ʋɛtɛsu, ti ɠaazulo bà.<verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>Ta nà-seɠeiti gaaɠwɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">ti kpakutoomai ɠɛ ga màazeɠeiti.<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mina maaɠooza bà!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">Ɗa ɠa è ga sùvikɛi, ʋa fala è ɓɔ bà!<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>Zìi ɠula boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">è zɛ̀nvui ɠula gilɛiti zea!<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>Kìzo zalai laaʋɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">ta teɠui minɛiti!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 22:22"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">È gòoɠaaʋoteni!<verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>Nà zeze ga è-laaseigi kɛ̀ɛleaiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Nà è maamusɛ maaɓɔgi zaama.<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>Wɔiti wo luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, à maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti kpein à dɛbi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">Wo zasuɓali tuɠɔ, Izilayɛle mavofodaiti kpein!<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>É la bala nui ʋɛlɛʋilini, naa ná-maanɔɠɔ ziɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">é la ɠaazuzeɠeni ba, é ʋa maaɠooza ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">Kɛlɛ é woiloni, siɛgi zu naa ɓainni da, é wooɠula ma.<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>È-zaalai zu, nà è maamusɛ maaɓɔ golai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">Gè nà-minazeɠegiti daazeeli naati gaazu, niiti ti luazu è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>Maawɔin nuiti ti daami wo, ti yiɠo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">Naati ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, niiti ti eteai ziɛzu tɔun bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">wo-zii zuɠooza eyɛsu ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>Zou ɓela ga ɲɛgɛlɛin, ta ɠizɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zu, ti lati tɔun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">Zii ɠiligiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti kpein, ta nɔkɔ tɔun bu.<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>Mazɔlɔɔ masadai ɠa ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">toɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu zii ɠiligiti unda.<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>Etea zu zobobɛ nuiti kpein, ta daami wo, ti nɔkɔ bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">niiti kpein ti yeizu kabai zu, naati ta maayei bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">niiti ti la zooga ti ʋa ti-yɛnvui makɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>Ti-mavofodai ɠa Maliɠii lɛbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">ta ná-fai wo yamanii naazu nuiti ma, niiti ti wuzeɠezu.<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 22:32"/>Mavofodai naa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-telebodai lɛ adaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:32">é naa laazeeli nuɓusɛiti ma, ti ʋaazu zɔlɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:32">nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kɛa ná-nuiti ta-ɠizo fai zu.<verse eid="PSA 22:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s">Nà ga baalagi, <optbreak/> Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga màkɛ nui</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 23:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">Nà ga baalagi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga màkɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">gè la ʋalaga ani nɔpɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>Toɠa nà-dooɠo bosuʋɛ ɠɛɛzu ga tufa lɛnugi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">toɠa losu tùɠɔ, é li ga ze ziɛ lɛilɛigiti pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>Toɠa nìinɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">é lo tùɠɔ, é li ga ze telebo peleiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">daaseigi wɔɔlɔ vai zu.<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>Siɛgi zu gè ziɛzu la faaɓaagi ma ʋɛtugi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">gè la lua faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ ba, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">ɗa-lukpɔi, ta ɗa-ɓakɔi, naati ka ti zìilɛizu.<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>Ɗa fɛti laamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu bɛ̀ sìli nuiti gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">è gulɔi ziɛ nɔ̀ungi ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">è gulɔi ziɛ nɔ̀ungi ma</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Ti-ɠɛɛ vaa wɔlɔi ta ɠɛni ga naa, nii a kɛ ti unfemai ve nui ʋɛ, niiti toligai fɛti ɠula vai ma. Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:46">Luk 7:46</ref></char>.</note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">nà-ziawɔi laavegɛ, é ɗa ʋu ya.<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>Ungo, undaanɛɛi ta nɛɛbɛi ta yɛ bà, nà-eteai pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">nà ɠale ma, gè yɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-pɛlɛi wu, eyɛsu sìi ma voloi pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa lɛɛzu ná-ada ɲadegai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 24:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">Zooi ta gaa ɠaniiti ta ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">eteai ta nii kpein é zeini su!<verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é zooi zeiɗa kpoloɗɛiti gaaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">é suvie ziɛ wolaiti maazu.<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é lɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-gizei ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é wuzeɠe, eyɛsu é lo ná-ada ɲadegai?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>Nii zeeiti ti la ɠɔzɔni, ziimaʋɛ ɠoleai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">nii é la ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔzu faa ɲakaiti su,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nii é la ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔzu faa ɲakaiti su</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nii é la ɠaaʋotesu zɛɛ ɠalagiti ma</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">é la ɠonazu ga é ʋa nu yaava.<verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>Toɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tuyai zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">ná-kizo GALAGI ɠa deve ga telebo nu.<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>Pele ɠana niiti ti gaiziɛzu, naati ta-nuɓusɛiti ti la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">ti ɠilizu Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI ʋa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 24:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>Kpogiti, à wa-ɓofalagiti buzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">à ti wuzeɠe, ɠɔoɠɔ siɠidaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">naa ɠa a kɛ, lɛbiya Masagi lɛ ná!<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ga lɛbiya Masagi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋe, sulogai, kɔɔɠuluɓai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kɔɔɠuluɓai.<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Kpogiti, à wa-ɓofalagiti buzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">à ti wuzeɠe, ɠɔoɠɔ siɠidaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">naa ɠa a kɛ, lɛbiya Masagi lɛ ná!<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ga lɛbiya Masagi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋe, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">tɔ ɠa é ga lɛbiya Masagi!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 24:10">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s">Pelei lɛ ga ze, <optbreak/> nii è pɔ ga gè ziɛ la</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 25:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:1">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">25:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti.</char>
    </note>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ʋɔ pelei ɠa gè ɠaaʋotesu ná.<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>Nà-GALAGI, ɗa ɠa gè ɠalivaai è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">mina va bu gè ʋa lɔ unfegi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">sìli nuiti ti ʋa ɗa ɠoozunɛ nà-faa zu.<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>Nii kpein kitogai è ʋa, tanɔpɛ ge la lɔa unfegi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">Kɛlɛ niiti ti yaavai ɠɛɛzu fuun, naati ta unfe.<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɗa-ʋeleiti dɛɛ ga ze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">Kàla ga ɗa-ʋeleiti.<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>Lo tùɠɔ gè ziɛ ga ɗa-ɠaamai, è kàla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ga nà-kizo GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">ɗa ɠa kìtogai è ʋa folo-o-folo.<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠizɛ ɗa-maawɔinɠai zu, ta ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">mazɔlɔɔ ta ɠɛʋele ma eyɛsu ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>Mina ɠizɛ nà-doungo ziɛgi ma ɠotoiti su, ɓaa nà-tɔ koloɠologiti ti leʋegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">ɠizɛ sù ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma, tɔɔzei, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ʋagɛ!<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋagɛ, é zɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">naa ɠa é ba, é pelei lɛɛzu la ga kotoba nuiti, ga ti ziɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>Toɠa ɗa ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti pilɛ telebo pelei ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">toɠa ɗa ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti kala ga ná-pelei.<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-peleiti ta ga nuɓɔɠɔlai, ta wooɠɛɠiladai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">naati bɛ, niiti ti ga wooɠɛɠila nu, ná-minazeɠegiti su, ta ná-deveiti.<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-faaɠaaza golaiti suvaayɛ è-laaseigi ná-lɛbiyai ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">mazɔlɔɔ ti wola wɔɔlɔʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Nui nii é luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa pelei lɛ ga naa, nii maanɛai é yiimazeɠe la.<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>Toɠa zɛnvui wo undaanɛɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">mavofodai zooi zɔlɔɔ ga nɔnɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa koozu vaiti dɛɛ ga naati, niiti ti luazu ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">É ti ɠala ga ná-minazeɠegi.<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>Gàazu logɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é kɔ̀ɠɔi ɠulazu tumɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>Ɠaaʋote mà, è kulafiliba vaanɛɛi ɠɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠila be, màawɔinʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>Ziizoolɛi zìi laavega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">kìzo nà-ziiɓɔlɔ vaiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>Nà-maanɔɠɔi ʋɛtɛ, ta nà-kpɔlɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">nà-kotoiti kpein suvaayɛ bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>Wɛlɛ ʋelei sìli nuiti mɔinɗai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">ta wɔinzeɠema wolai, ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu la.<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>Zɛ̀nvui makɛ, è ùnmɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">Gè mina lɔ unfegi zu, tɔɔzei nà lɔɔɠuzu è ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>Telebodaiti ta sɔledai ta màkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">mazɔlɔɔ kìtogɛ è ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>Ee, GALA, Izilayɛle ɠula ná-kidaaʋili faiti pɛ su!<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s">Tukpɔi lo bɛ̀</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 26:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, tukpɔi lo bɛ̀!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">Mazɔlɔɔ nà nà-eteai ziɛzu peelalazu nɔpɛ ge la bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">Nà ɠalivaazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, gè la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>Fɛ̀ɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, pòluɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">è zìi ʋɛtɛ, ta nà-kisiɛiti.<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gàazu ɠa ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">nà nà-eteai ziɛzu, eɠɛʋelei ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai la.<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>Gè la liizu gè ʋa zei yaava nuiti koba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">gè la woovele nuiti seizeisu.<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>Niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu, naati ta-maaɓɔgi wɔinzeɠeʋɛ mà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">Gè la zeizu suɲɔu nuiti koba.<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>Nà zèeiti gaagbazu sɔbalalai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà latisu ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma,<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>gè mama gooiti bo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">gè ɗa-vaanɛɛiti kpein bo.<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è-zeizuʋɛ nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">ʋɛ ɗa-lɛbiyai zeini ná!<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>Mina sò ga nu ɲɔiti kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">mina zɛ̀nvui zeɠe ga nu ʋaa nuiti kɛʋele!<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>Ti-yeeiti dɔɔʋɛ faa ɲɔi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">Ti ɓɔɠɔ yɛgɛna ti ti ɠeya ga lobɛanii.<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Nɔ̀un, nà ziɛzu nà-telebodai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">ùnmɔɔ, è zaalai la mà!<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>Kɔ̀ɠɔi ɠa loni sɔledai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mamasu maaɓɔgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s">GALA pɔ bɛ ɠa é ga nu lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 27:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga nà-wozakalagi, ta nà-kizogi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Ɓɛ ɠa nà lua ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga zɛ̀nvui makɛ nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Ɓɛ ɠa nà inɛinɛ ba?<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>Siɛgi zu niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">ti maaɓuɠazu la bà, ga ti kpùsɛi mi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti ta sìli nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">tiya ɠa naazu, ti-ɠɔɠɔi ziɠazu, ti loo.<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>Ni kɔɔɠɔ nua ta wuzeɠena dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">gè la lua zìimaʋɛ ga tago ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">ni kɔɔ a wuzeɠena dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">anɛɛ naa ʋe, dàavegɛ ga kitogi.<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>Ani ɠila kpe ka gè falizu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">gè gaiziɛzu gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">gè zei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">sìi ma voloi pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">gè ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-maayikii ʋɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">gè ɠaaɓa gè tɔun kwɛɛ sei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa màkɛ ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">kpɔlɔi ma voloi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">Toɠa dɔ̀ɔɠu ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">toɠa bùzeɠe, é gàalɔ fasai ma.<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>Nɔ̀ungi wuzeɠeʋɛ na, gàaɠooza sìli nuiti ba, ti ɠooliai mà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">Nà zalaɠaiti kula ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, mama zalaɠaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">nà guyei loo, gè guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma.<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo gòoi ma, nà wooɠulazu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">gòoɠaaʋote è-zaalai ʋɔ!<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>Kìgi ɠa ɗa-vai wosu ma ga: «Gàiziɛ, è lati mà!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà è ɠaiziɛzu!<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>Mina ɠaazuʋɛ lɔɔɠu bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, mina dàaʋili ga ziiɠaawanai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">ɗa ga nà-kpɔba nui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Mina yeeɓe bà, mina ɠɛlɛ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">nà-kizo GALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>Kɛ̀ɛ ta dèe ti ɠɛlɛni bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezeini bù.<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>Pelei lɛ ga ze, nii è pɔ ga gè ziɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, lo tùɠɔ telebo pelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">tɔɔzei sìli nuiti ta gàiziɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>Mina dɔ̀ sìli nuiti ziimai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">mazɔlɔɔ zɛɛ zeeleiti ti wuzeɠea dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">toomai ɠa ti bosu.<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>Nà la ɠɛ ga leeni, ni kito ge la ɠɛni bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">gè ʋa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nɛɛbɛi ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">niima eteai zu fulu nuiti saama?<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>Ɠito Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">Zɛbɛzeɠe, è yiilɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">Ɠito Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-gooɠaaʋotegi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 28:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa gè wooɠulazu è ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Nà-fasai, mina woizuɓɔlɔ tùɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">Ni ɗa laaɠuluna, nà ɠɛ ga naati kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">niiti ti yeizu kabai zu.<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>Woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">siɛgi zu gè wooɠulazu la è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">siɛgi zu gè zèeiti tɛɛzu la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">è-zeizu ɲadegai ʋɔ pelei, è zeini ná!<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>Mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-vaa ɲɔu ɠasɔi ta la ùnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui naati, ti ziilɛi kpɔɛi wosu ti-zeiɲɔɠɔi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">kɛlɛ faa ɲɔi ti-yiimaʋɛ, ga yaavai.<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>Ti zala, eɠɛʋelei ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti ti la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">eɠɛʋelei ta-yaava ɠɛɛwotiiti ti la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">Ti zala é zoloo ti-yeei ná-kɛɛwotii ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">Nii soloogai ti ma, naa la ti unma.<verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kɛɛwotiiti deveni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">anɛɛ zeei ná-kɛɛwotiiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ɠoloɠolo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">Ti mina mɔ wuzeɠe eyɛsu pɛ!<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa woilosu nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga sùvikɛi ta nà-kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">Gè ɠalivaaʋɛ ma, toɠa ɓɔsu bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">Zìimaʋɛ laavegɛ ga koozunɛɛi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">Nà maamusɛzu ga nà-guye wooiti.<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga ná-nuiti kpein suvikɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">tɔ ɠa é ga siɠigi, ʋɛ masagi nii é gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma, naa a ɗa unmɔɔgi zɔlɔɔ ná.<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-nuɓusɛiti kizo, è tuya loo ti ʋɛ, ta ga ɗɔnɔiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">Ɠɛ ga ti makɛ nui, è yeezei ti wu, eyɛsu ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 29:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">wo ná-zɛbɛi ta ná-lɛbiyai ɠula kɛlɛma!<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>Ungo, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi ma lɛbiyai maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">wo nɔkɔ tɔun bu, maaɠiliai ga seɠe ɲadegai!<verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa ɠulazu ziɛiti maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">lɛbiya ƓALAGI ɠa tona ɓunɛ tugi ɠulazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa ɓudɛzu ziɛ wolaiti gooi maazu!<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa ɠulazu ga keɠaaɓa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa ɠulazu ga masa gooi!<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa sɛdele guluiti galeɠalezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa Liɓan sɛdele guluiti koloɠolosu,<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>toɠa Liɓan ɠizeiti kpizɛzu eɠɛ nikɛ ɓokpagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">ta Siliyɔn ɠizei eɠɛ teɠu ɓokpagi.<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa mainmain ɠulazu.<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa ɗa teʋebai zuɲiikpi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa Kadɛse teʋebai zuɲiikpi.<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠa ɗa ɠɛ ga zaɓui dopaiti ti yiʋoi ʋu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">Toɠa ɗa dɔɓɔi zuwolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">Ná-masa pɛlɛi wu ti pɛ ta ɗa wooɠula, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lɛbiyai ɠa bɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni masadai ɠɛɛzu, ziɛve golai ʋaa ziɛgi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa zobogi ve ná-nuɓusɛiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa tuya loo ná-nuɓusɛiti bɛ, é ziilɛigi ve ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s">È zɛ̀nvui vea zèa ʋolu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laalao guyei. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà è maamusɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">mazɔlɔɔ è kùlaa zeɠe ɓokulagi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">È la vaani bu, sìli nuiti ti ʋa ɗa ɲɛɛɠula sù.<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, gè è loligɛ ga è ɓɔ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">ɗa ma, è bàloʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è mɛ̀ɛnni, è kùla saai ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">è zɛ̀nvui ʋu sù, siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni liizu la kabayeɠei ʋɔ pelei.<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>À guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wɔiti wo bɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">À maamusɛ, wo ná-ɲadedai ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ná-ziiɠaawanai la ɗa ga lɛbiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">kɛlɛ ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠa ná nu zii ma voloi pɛ su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">Ni kpɔkɔi gɔlɔi ɠa é ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">geelaa ɠa laosu ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>Gè ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ga nà ziilɛi su, gè ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">«Gè la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ʋɔ, è sɛ̀bɛlɔɔni sèi ɠizei ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">Kɛlɛ è ʋoluavega bà, gaamanɔ kiteʋei zeelia mà.<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè wooɠulaa è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">ee, Màliɠii, gè è maanɛɛnɛ, gè ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>«Ni nà zaana, ni nà yeina kabayeɠei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">ɗa-ɠulanumai ɠa naazu ga leeni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Zɔi é niina ga fufiligi nɔ, naa ɠa zoo ɠale è maamusɛzu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Toɠa zoo ɠale ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠulazu kɛlɛma?<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo, gàazumaawɔinɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">ʋa è ɓɔ bà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>È nà-gɔlɔ wooiti faliboga ga kua wogai koozunɛɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">è saa wɔlɔ wo seɠeiti kula kɔ̀ba, è ti maavalibo ga fɛti ɠula zeɠeiti,<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 30:13"/>naa ɠa a kɛ gè è maamusɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ, gè mina ɓɔlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:13">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, nà è maamusɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 30:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s">Dàaʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa gè lɔɔɠuzu è ʋoluʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">màkɛ eyɛsu pɛ, gè mina lɔ unfegi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">Ùnmɔɔ ɗa-lelebodai zu!<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>Woilo gòoi ma, zuvilɛ è ùnmɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">Ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga dɔɔɠuzu vasai, ta siɠigi, nii a kɛ gè ɠizo!<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ga nà-fasai, ta nà-siɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">è-laaseigi lɛbi vai ma, ɗa lo tùɠɔ, è ɓɔ bà.<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>Ɗa kùla tumɔi zu, nii ti seiɗai tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ga siɠigi é màkɛsu.<verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>Nà zɛ̀nvui ɠalivaazu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">ɗɛi è ùnmɔɔni, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gaama ƓALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>Gè naati wɔinzeɠea, niiti ti ɠilizu zɛɛ zaleiti ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">Nà ɠalivaazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>Nà ɠɛ wuulee ga koozunɛɛi, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">tɔɔzei è nà-maanɔɠɔi ʋɛtɛga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">è ɠida nà-kidaaʋili fai wu.<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>È la dɔ̀ɔzu sìli nuiti zeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">è pìlɛga ɓɔɠɔyeemai zu.<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>Màawɔinɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">Mazɔlɔɔ nà kidaaʋiligi zu, ziizoolɛi gàazuʋɛ maaʋooloa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">ta zìi ta kpùsɛi kpein.<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Nà-eteai ɓega taɓai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">nà-konagiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛa kpalagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">sùvikɛi ɠula sù, tɔɔzei nà-faaɠaaza golai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">mà ɠaeiti sumiiʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>Wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti kpein ta ɲɛɛɠulazu sù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">sìɛɲɔɠɔiti ti ɗa ta ɓɔ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">kwɛ̀ɛ nuiti ti ɗa lua bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">Niiti ti kàazu eteaʋɛ, naati ti ɗa ɓizɛ, ti ɗa maaɠooza bà.<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>Nà-fai yeema nuiti bɛ ti-yiimaʋɛ, eɠɛ nà za.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">Gè ɠɛa eɠɛ anii nii toai ya.<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>Nà naama woo ɲɔiti mɛnisu, niiti ti wosu dàalɔɠɔma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">«Maaɠooliʋɛ ga maalua vai.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">Ti zoloogɛ ma dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">ti yaavai ɠili ga ti zɛ̀nvui ɠula zèa.<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà, nà ɠalivaazu è ma, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">Gè ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ga nà-GALAGI!»<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>Nà-eteai ɠa è yeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">kùla sìli nuiti zea, niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu!<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>Yeezei bù ga pagɔ, nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">Kìzo ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma!<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè mina lɔ unfegi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">siɛgi zu gè wooɠulazu la è ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti yɛ unfegi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">ti yɛ maaɠɛkpɔgi zu, ti yei gɔvɛalaazu!<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>Ti ɠɛ ga ɓoɓoiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">naama lakɔlɔgiti ti ɓɔɛzu ga gaazumaanɛɛi telebo nui laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">ta wasogi, ta wɔinzeɠemai.<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>Ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai wɔɔlɔʋɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">nii è makɛgai naati bɛ, niiti ti luazu è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">ta naati ti lɔɔɠuai è ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">nii è ʋaazu kɛɛzu ti ʋɛ, nuɓusɛi kpein gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>Ɗa ti lɔɔɠuzu è-ɠaazu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">ti maaɠooza nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠisiɛ ɲɔiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ miná ɠa è ti ɠizosu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">nuiti ti-nɛgiti ma, niiti ti laalɛɛzu ti wu.<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">Mazɔlɔɔ é ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">nɛ̀i gè ɠɛni eɠɛ taa wolai seiɗai kɛlɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>Kìgi zupuni, eyɛsu gè ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">«É la mɔ yiizoolɛzu ga ze!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">Kɛlɛ è nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooiti mɛnini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">siɛgi zu gè wooɠulani la è ma.<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>Wɔiti wo ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti, à nɛɛʋɛ wo pɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa kidaaleʋe nuiti makɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">Kɛlɛ toɠa waso nuiti sala ga ɲɔuɗa.<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 31:25"/>À zɛbɛzeɠe, wo zulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:25">wɔiti wo ɠitogai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 31:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s">Maavaayɛgi ma ɠoozunɛɛi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>Davide ná-kidafaawui.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 32:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii ná-tɔ koloɠologiti maavaayɛgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">ná-kotoiti suvaayɛgai!<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ná-faaɠaaza golai levezu unma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">nii yaava vaa la ziimaʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>Siɛgi zu gè maaɠɛni la kpɔ nà-kotoi ma, mà ɠaeiti ti ɠɛni ɠalazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">Gè ɠɛni kpeei loozu foloi laawu ɲɛgɛlɛin.<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è-yeei ɠa wuizu mà, folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">sùvikɛi vɔɔni eɠɛ foɠoi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>Gè nà-kotoi lɛɛni ga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">gè la nà-faaɠaaza golai maalɔɔɠuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Gè ɠɛni ma: «Nà laazu zɔ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga nà-tɔ koloɠologiti.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">Ɗɔun ɗa, è nà-kotoi ma ɠasɔi zeɠeni ùnma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>Wooɠɛɠila nuɓusɛi kpein ge è vali ɠana, yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">Ni ziɛve golaiti ta ɠulana, ti la zeelia ma pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>Ɗa ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">ɗa màkɛsu kidaaʋili foloi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">Nà wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi, tɔɔzei è màaɠoolia ga ɗa-ɓaamaazui.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:7">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>È ɠɛni ma: «Nà è ɠalasu, gè pelei lɛ ga ɗe, nii ɗa ziɛ la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">Nà è lɛnɛ, gàazu ɠa yɛ è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>À mina ɠɛ ga sooi ɠɛʋele, ɓaa soovale fuului nii ɠi ge la ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">nii nu a ɗa ti ɠili ga galui, ɓaa kalafei, ti maaɠilizu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">nii a kɛ ti maaɓuɠa è ʋa.»<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>Taɓa mɔinmɔin ka ɗa zeeli faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">kɛlɛ nuiti ti ɠigi logai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">naati maaɠooliʋɛ ga ná-wooɠɛɠiladai.<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>Telebo nuiti, à ɠoozunɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">À wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi, wɔiti wo yiimaʋɛ zɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s">Aniiti kpɛtɛ ƓALAGI, kizo GALAGI</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Telebo nuiti, à ɠoozunɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-faa zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">Mazɔlɔɔ soloogɛ sɔle nuiti ma ga ti maamusɛi wo.<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ga kɔnigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">à guyei loo dɛbi vai ma, ga kɔnigi nii galu puugɔi ga!<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>À guye niinɛi loo dɛbi vai ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">À wa-ɠɛingɛin ganiiti gɛin ga pagɔ dɛbi vai ma.<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi zɔlegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">ná-kɛɛwotiiti kpein ta ná-wooɠɛɠiladai lɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>Telebodai nɛɛʋɛ GALA bɛ ta sɔledai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-wooɠɛɠiladai eteai laavegɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ɠa é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛni la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">ta su aniiti kpein ga daa viilɛi.<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>Toɠa ɗa kpoloɗɛi ɠaalɛ ba, é siɠito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">é kpoloɗɛi zo, é pu aniɲaka wolaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Eteai kpein ge lua Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">Etea nuiti kpein ti ɓali tɔun tuɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>Nii nɔpɛ a bona, naama vai ɠa a ɗa ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">a devei wona, naa ɠa a ɠɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa zii ɠiligiti ta-lɛnɛ gooiti pu ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">toɠa ɗa ziiti pɛ ti ɠoozu ɠisiɛiti suɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɛnɛ gooiti ta ɗa yɛ ná yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">ta koozu ɠaaɠisiɛiti ta yɛ ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>Undaanɛɛ ɠa zii naati bɛ, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ga ta-ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">ta nuɓusɛiti é yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, ga ti ɠɛ ga nɔnɔiti!<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛni geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">é wɛlɛ, é nuɓusɛiti kpein ka.<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>É yɛni zeini zeizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">é eteai zu nuiti kpein pɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>Tɔungi é ti kpein zii ɓɛtɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">é ti-ɠɛɛ vaiti kpein kwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>Masa ge la ná, nii a ɠizo ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai mɔin vai ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">kɔɔɠuluɓa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii a ɠizo ná-zɛbɛ wolai ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>Ni pilɛ sɔlɔɔ fai ʋe, sooi ɠa ga kito gani nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">suvikɛi kpein ge ɓɔsu, naa la nu unmɔɔga.<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>Wɛlɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa naati ba, niiti ti luazu tɔun ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">ta niiti ti ɠitogai ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>Naa ɠa a kɛ, é ti ɠula saai ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">é ti-yɛnvui makɛ pulu loo ziɛgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>Ungo, gi ɠitogɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">toɠa ga gá-ɓɔba nui ta gá-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi.<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gi-yii ɠa ɠoozunɛɛzu ga tɔun maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">mazɔlɔɔ gi laaʋɛ daasei ɲadegai la.<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛ gi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">eɠɛʋelei gi è maaɓɔunsu da kitogi zu.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s">Màliɠii ùnmɔɔni, <optbreak/> é kùla maalua vaiti su</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>Davide ná-guyei, siɛgi zu é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛni la ga titi nui Aɓimelɛke ɠaazu, naa kpɛ, é ʋela, é li.<verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">34:2 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti.</char>
    </note>Ungo, yeenɔpɛ nà yɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mamasu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">ná-maamusɛi ɠa ɠɛ dàaʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>Nà-ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛi ma ungi ɠa é ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">Ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ti woilo, ti ɠoozunɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>À ʋa wo ɓɔ bà, ade Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ʋɔɔma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">Ade daaseigi lɛbi ʋɔɔma!<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>Gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaiziɛni, é gòoɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">toɠa ɗa kùla fai kpein su, nii é màaluazu.<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>Siɛgi zu nu wɛlɛzu la tɔun ba, ɗa ɗa volo ga koozunɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">unfe ge la lɔa nu ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>Maanɔɠɔ nui kpeei looni, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI goomɛnini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">é kizo ná-kidaaʋili fai pɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠa naati maaɠoolii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">niiti ti ziɛzu ga GALA ziimai, é ti ɠizo.<verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>À kɔɠɔ, wo pɛtɛ, ʋelegi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋagai la!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga zunui naa, nii é lɔɔɠuzu pɔ bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>À lua Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, wɔi wo ga ná-nu ɲadegaiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">Mazɔlɔɔ ani nɔpɛ ge la ʋalaga naati zea, niiti ti luazu ba.<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Zala yiʋoiti ta ɗa ʋala ani ma, ti yɛ pului zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">kɛlɛ niiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaiziɛzu, naati ti la ʋalaga ani ʋagɔ nɔpɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>À ʋa, dòun zunuiti, wo woilo gòoi ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">Nà wo ɠalasu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuluabai.<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>Zunui ɓɛ ɠa é wɔinni ga zɛnvui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">é wɔinni ga sii zuɠooza, é undaanɛɛi zɔlɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>È-nɛgi makɛ, é mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">è-lakɔlɔgiti ti mina yaava ɓɔɛ wo.<verse eid="PSA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>Ʋoluave faa ɲɔi ʋa, è faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">ziilɛigi ɠaiziɛ, è ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuʋɛ ɠa telebo nuiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">goilogɛ gola ti ɓain gooiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa ɠaazuʋɛ lati naati daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">nii a kɛ é ti ɠaaleʋe, nu mina ɠisiɛ ti zu eteai zu.<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>Siɛgi zu telebo nuiti ti kpeei loozu la, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa woilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">toɠa ɗa ti ɠula ta-ɠidaaʋiligiti kpein su.<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ziiɠoloɠolo nuiti koba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">toɠa naati kizo, niiti ti ziiɓɔlɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>Maanɔɠɔ mɔinmɔin ka ɗa zeeli telebo nui ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa unmɔɔ, é kula ti pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Toɠa ma ɠaeiti pɛ makɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">tanɔpɛ ge la ɠalea.<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ʋaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">telebo nui zili nuiti ta ti-zalai zɔlɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 34:23"/>kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa ná-botiɠɛ nuiti kpein zɛnvui ɠizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:23">ta niiti ti tɔun kɛai ga ti-lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, naati ti la ʋeelala.<verse eid="PSA 34:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa maawɔin nuiti makɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 35:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, naati sakpe, niiti ti sàkpesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">kɔɔi laalɛ naati bu, niiti ti kɔɔi laalɛɛzu bù!<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛ koi ta ma wolaiti seɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:2">è wuzeɠe, è ɓɔ bà!<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>Kpɛɛn goiti ta kɔɔɠɔ yoovɛiti seɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">è tɛ ga naati daalɔɠɔma niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">È ɠɛ zɛ̀nvui ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">«Nà ɠa gè ga è ɠizo nui!»<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>Naati ti unfe, ɓaaɠula ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">niiti ti wɔinɗai ga ti zɛ̀nvui ɠula zèa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">Ti ɠula ʋolu, ti unfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">tɛiti ti ɠisiɛzu nà-maanɔɠɔ vai zu!<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>Ti ɠɛ ga daazaɠagi ɠɛʋele, nii fiilɛi liizu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ti ɓɛ!<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Ta-ʋelei ti ziɛzu la suɓidi, suɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ʋilɛ ti ʋolu ga ti ɓɛa!<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti zeɠei wɔɔʋɛ, ti tumɔi zei su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">ma un ge la ba, ti naa wɔɔʋɛ nɔ̀un bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>Ziizoolɛi zeeli ti ma, ti yeemazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">ta-lumɔi ti dɔɔɠuai tùɠɔ, naa ti zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">ti loo naama undaaʋiligi zu!<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>Koozunɛɛi ɠa ɠɛ zìimaʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">toɠa ɠoozunɛ ná-kizo fai zu.<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>Mà ɠaeiti kpein ta ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">«Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɓɛ ɠa é ga è ɠɛʋele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Ɗa maanɔɠɔ nui unmɔɔsu, è kula naa yeezu, nii sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔai tɔun nɔnɔi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">Maanɔɠɔ nui ta bala nui ɓalaa, ɗa ti ɠulazu tooma nui ya.»<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Zɛɛ zeeleiti ta wuzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">ti ʋa, ti ɗa gàazaɠa faiti ma, niiti gè la ti zuɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>Nà-faa ʋagɔi gè kɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">ti ɗa naa zala mà ga faa ɲɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">Ti zɛ̀ gilɛlai zu.<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>Nɔ̀un nà, siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni zeeɓɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">gè ɓena saa wɔlɔ wo seɠei loo ɠɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">gè ɠaalɛi, gè ɓɔɠɔmaayei, gè zugi zo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">Gè la ɠɛni ɓeni GALA falii ʋa ti ʋɛ ɠɔ,<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>eɠɛ nà ɠɛ kɛɛzu bɔɔla ʋɛ, ɓaa kɛ̀ɛloun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">Gè maaʋɛ, gè ɗa ziɛ gaazuɠiliai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">gàalɛi, eɠɛ nu dee a za.<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Naa ʋolu, siɛgi zu gè ɲiikpisu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">ta ɠaalɛɛzu ba, ti ɗa ɲɛɛɠula sù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">gè la dòɠa nuiti kwɛɛ, ti ɠaalɛɛzu ba dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">ti ɗa dàazuɠɔli, ti la looɠosu.<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>Eɠɛ nuiti ti ɲɛɛɠulazu nɛɛʋuzu ba nuiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">ta ɲiigai ziɛzu ga dàalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>Màliɠii, ɗa yɛsu niima vaiti pɛtɛsu nɔ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">Zɛ̀nvui ɠula ta-wɔinzeɠemai laawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">zɛ̀nvui wola vizɔgɛ, é mina yɛ zalaiti zea.<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Nà è maamusɛ maaɓɔ golai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">nà è mama nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>Niiti ti ga sìli nuiti, ti ɓaaɠosu mà, naati ti mina ɲɛɛɠula sù.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">Niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu un ge la ba, naati ti mina pòomu ga ɠaazuɠɛzɛi.<verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti la ziilɛi kpɔɛ wosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">yaavai ɠa ti kpɛtɛzu nu ʋagɔiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">ti zeini zooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>Ta laalaosu dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ee, gi-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa wozaɠaazu!»<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa wozaɠaazu, mina maaɠɛ kpɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">Màliɠii, mina maaɠooza bà!<verse eid="PSA 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>Wuzeɠe, ɠaazuzeɠe ma, è màalobo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">Nà-GALAGI, Màliɠii, lo bɛ̀!<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>Tukpɔi lo bɛ̀, eɠɛʋelei ɗa-zɔledai la, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">Ti mina ɠoozunɛ, ti ʋa ɲɛɛɠula sù!<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>Ti mina ɠɛ ma ti-yiimaʋɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">«Ee, nii ɠa ade ɠɛa pɔ!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">Ti mina ɠɛ ma: «Ade kpɔlea!»<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Ti pɛ ti unfe ʋɔɔma, ti ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">tɛiti ti ɠoozunɛɛzu nà-maanɔɠɔ vai zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">Unfegi loo ti ɠɔba ta faazupui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">niiti dɔin ti ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔzu dàalɔɠɔma!<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Naati ti maamusɛi wo, ti ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">niiti ti yiilɛiɗai nà-telebo fai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">ti ɗa ɠɛ ma yeenɔpɛ: «Lɛbiyai ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">nii é ná-botiɠɛ nui ná-ziilɛigi ʋɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>Nɛ̀gi ɠa ɗa-lelebo fai wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">ta ɗa-maamusɛi, folo-o-folo.<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nui Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Nà ɗa ɠisiɛ zìimaʋɛ naa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">nii faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui bosu ná-tɔ koloɠologi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">GALA gaazuluabai la gaazu ga faa nɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ daaʋɛ ɓɔɠɔ la gola ná-sɔle fai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">é la zooga é ʋa ná-faaɠaaza golai ɠwɛɛ, é ʋa wɔinzeɠe.<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>Kpɔɛi niiti ti ɠulazu daaʋɛ, ta ga zɛɛi ta yaavai nɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">Toɠa ɠɛlɛzu faa yɔɠɔzuɠaa vai ʋa ta faa ʋagɔi.<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>Toɠa ɗa ɠisiɛ yaavai zu, a ɠɛna laani ná-betei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">toɠa ziɛzu pelei zu nii é la ʋani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">é la faa ɲɔi ʋilisu ya.<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai wɔɔlɔʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zeeli tonaɓiingiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>Ɗa-lelebodai ɠaaɠoozaʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei gize ɠaaɠoozagiti ti la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">ɗa-leveiti kpoma ɠoozaʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei kpoloɗɛiti buuzeiɗai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɓaazu nuiti maazu ta suaiti.<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai wola ʋagɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">Nuɓusɛiti ta lɔɔɠuzu è-ɠoʋegiti ma niinigi wu.<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>Ɗa ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu vaaɓɔɠɔi ɠɛɛzu ti ʋɛ, ta sɔlɔɔ é ʋooʋa ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">ti ɓɔɔle ga ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ma ɗɛ wola ʋagɔi.<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɛnvu ɗɛungi ɠa è ɠobaʋɛ nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">ɗa-wozakalagi ʋɔ, gá wozakalagi ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai makɛ è ɠwɛɛ nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">ta ɗa-lelebodai ɓalaa naati bɛ niiti ti-yii zɔlegai!<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>Waso nuiti ti mina ɠɔɠɔlo mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti mina kpɛ̀ ga ti-yeei!<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 36:13"/>Wɛlɛ, niizu niiti ti telebotala vai ɠɛɛzu, ti loa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:13">ti loka, ti la zooga ti ʋa wuzeɠe.<verse eid="PSA 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é zɔlɔɔsu faiti su, ti leʋegai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 37:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">Mina yiiɠaawana naati ma, niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">mina ɠaazuɠula naati ba, niiti ti kakama vaiti kɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ta ʋoolozu, eɠɛ tufai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">ti vɔ, eɠɛ tufa lɛnugi.<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>Ɠaliva Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, è ɗa faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">ɗa zei zooi zu, ziilɛigi zu.<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>Ɗa-undaanɛɛi ɠaiziɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">toɠa è yiima vai ɠɛ è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>È-maavaiti kpein zɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">ɠaliva tɔun ma, toɠa ti ɠaaɠula ba.<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>Toɠa ɗa-zɔledai ɠula kɛlɛma eɠɛ wozakalagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">ta ɗa-ɠaamai eɠɛ folo gaalɔgai.<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>Maaɠɛ kpɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, tɔun maaɓɔun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">mina yiiɠaawana naati ma, niiti ti ɓɔɠɔ zɔlɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">ɓaa nui naati daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti ɠisu vaa ɲɔiti suɓɛtɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>Ɓe ziiɠaawanai ʋa, è ziiɠulagi yɛ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">mina yiiɠaawana, toɠa ɠɛ ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛ vaa.<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu, naati ta leʋezu ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">kɛlɛ niiti ti ɠitogai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, naati ta zooi zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>Ná tago nɔ ʋe na, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui la mɔ ɠaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">Ʋɛ é ɠɛa ná, ɗa naa ʋɛtɛ, nu nɔpɛ ge la ná!<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>Ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ta zooi zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">ti ɠoozunɛ ziilɛi golai zu.<verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa ɗa kisiɛ ɲɔiti kpɛtɛ telebo nui laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">é ɗa ɲiigai ziɛ ga naa laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, Maliɠii ɠa ɲɛɛɠulazu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">tɔɔzei é kwɛɛ ga naa ná-foloi ɠa na zeeli.<verse eid="PSA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta ɗa boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠula su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">ti ta-mɛɛin ɠaalɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">nii a kɛ ti maanɔɠɔ nui ta bala nui loo bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">ti ʋa naati kɔdaaleʋe niiti ta-ʋelei zɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Tiya ɓɔɠɔi ta-woɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa ti yiiɓota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">ta-mɛɛinti ta ɠaleɠale.<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>Nii goi é telebo nui ya naa vizɔgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">é leʋe faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti tɔnɔ mɔinmɔin golai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>Tɔɔzei faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-zobogi zu ɠa ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɓaa sɔle nuiti maazu.<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI sɔbalala nuiti ta-eteai ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">ta-ʋoganii ɠa yɛ ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>Ti la unfega maanɔɠɔ ziɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">pului ma ziɛgi zu, ta laami, mɔtai yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti undaa ɠa ʋili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zili nuiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">ta ɠɛ eɠɛ tufa lɛnugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">ti ɲɛɛlɛ, ti ɲɛɛlɛ duului zu.<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Nu ɲɔi ɠa ɗa kuyei zeɠe, kɛlɛ é la kulaa ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">Telebo nui ɠa ɗa maawɔinɠai wo, é fe zea.<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loozu ti ʋɛ, naati ta zooi zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">niiti é ti voovoozu, naati ta leʋe ga.<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>Siɛgi zu nui ziɛ ʋelei nɛɛzu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">toɠa naa ɠɔɠɔ losu ɓɛtɛ ná-eteai zu.<verse eid="PSA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Ni a loona, é la vɛzɛɠɛlɛga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa sosu zeei ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>Gè ɠɛni ga doungoi, gè wɔlɔzaɠaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">gè la dɛ nu ɠaani nii sɔlegai, kɛlɛbai ʋa wo da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">ɓaa mavofodai ʋa ɗa daamianigi vali.<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>Toɠa ɗa maawɔinɠai ɠɛ, é kuye ʋɛɛ nu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">mavofodai ɠa tuyai zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Ʋoluave faa ɲɔi ʋa, è faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">zei zooi zu, yɛ ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɔlegi nɛɛʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">é la ɠɛlɛa ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti ba.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 37:28"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">Toɠa wɛlɛzu ti ma siɛnɔpɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">kɛlɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti mavofodai ɠa leʋe ga.<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Telebo nuiti ta zooi zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">ti yɛ zeini ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Telebo nuiti ta ɗa ɠima ɓɔɛiti bo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">ti-nɛgi ɠa ɗa sɔledai ɠɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>Ta-ƓALAGI ná-tɔgi ɠa ti-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">ti-ɠɔɠɔi la ɓunɛga.<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa ɗa telebo nui maayaava,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:32">é gaiziɛ ga é paa.<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la yeeɓega ba, é ʋa zɛ zeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">é la zɛga naa, ti ʋa peelala, siɛgi zu ti tukpɔzu la.<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Ɠito Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">è ziɛ ga ná-pelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">toɠa è wuzeɠe, è zooi zɔlɔɔ ga ɗɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">ɗa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ka, ti leʋe ga.<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>Gè nu ɲɔi ɠaa, é ná-zobodai kpein su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">é ɗa wɔɔlɔ, eɠɛ gulu wolai nii kpɔvɔai.<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>É leʋeni, wɛlɛ, é la mɔ ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">Gè gaiziɛni, kɛlɛ é la ɠaani.<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>Ɠida GALA gaazuluaba nui ná-fai wu, nui naa ʋɛtɛ nii sɔlegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">ziilɛi nui ɠa ɓɔɠɔ zɔlɔɔ ná-eteai zu.<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Kɛlɛ kpaka nuiti kpein ta ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-eteai ɠa ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Telebo nuiti ta-ɠizogi ɠa ʋaazu, é zeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">Tɔ ɠa é ga ti-lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, kidaaʋili foloi.<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɓɔ ti ʋa, é ti unmɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">Toɠa ti unmɔɔ, é ti ɠula faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti zea, é ti ɠizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">tɔɔzei naati ta lɔɔɠuzu pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s">Seeɓɛ nui ná-GALA falii, <optbreak/> tɔɔzei ná-kotoi ʋa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>Davide ná-guyei, é ɠɛ ga ɠizɛsui.<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mina fàla, ɗa-yiiɠaawanai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">mina dòɠa, ɗa-yiiɠulagi zu.<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-mɛɛinti ti nɔ̀un soga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">è-yeei wuiʋɛ mà.<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>Fai tanɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛʋele ma kpùsɛi zu, ɗa-yiiɠaawanai maaʋele ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">Kɛdɛya la mà ɠaeiti zea, nà-kotoi maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà-faaɠaaza golaiti kpudɛʋɛ nà-kisiɛi maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">eɠɛ kasɔ wuigi, ti wuiʋɛ mà gola.<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>Nà-palaiti ti ɲɔuɗa, ti-ɠugi ɗa ɠula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">nà-ɠimalalai maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>Kpìligɛ, gè ɓɔlɔ fɔ da ge leʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">folo-o-folo, nà ziɛzu ziizoolɛi zu.<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ abui ɠa é sàamaʋɛti galazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">fai tanɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛʋele ma kpùsɛi zu.<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>Zɛbɛ la mɔ bà, sùɠaleɠalea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">nà kpalagi wosu, tɔɔzei nà-ziiɓɔlɔi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Màliɠii, wɔ̀inma vaiti kpein ta è ɠakalaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">kpàla gooiti ti la lɔɔɠuni è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>Zìi ɠa doɠazu gola, sɛ̀bɛi ɗa ɠula zèa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">gàazuʋɛ la mɔ wozaɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>Nà-kpɔlɔi maaʋele ma, bɔ̀ɔlaiti ta sìɛpoluɲɔɠɔiti ti maaɠooza bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">sèiɲɔɠɔiti ɓalaa ti maaɠooza bà.<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Niiti ti pɔ ti pàa, naati ta baliiti tɛɛzu tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">niiti ti ɠɛɛzu maanɔɠɔi zeeli mà, naati ta kpɔɛiti bosu, nii a kɛ gè ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">ti ɗa unsuyelii lo folo-o-folo yaavai zu.<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>Nɔ̀un nà, gè ɠɛa eɠɛ goizuɓɔlɔ nui, gè la ta mɛnisu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">Nɔ̀un daaɠulugɛ eɠɛ ɓoɓoi.<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>Kɛ̀ɛʋɛ eɠɛ zunui nii é la faa mɛnisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">é la ta zuloozu.<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Ɗa ɠa gè è maaɓɔunsu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">ɗa ɠa ɗa gooɠaaʋotegi wo, Màliɠii, nà-GALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà bosu è ma ga: «Ti mina ɲɛɛɠula nɔ̀un su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">ti ʋa wuzeɠe dàalɔɠɔma siɛgi zu kɔ̀ɠɔi ɓalizu la!»<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sàsu ɠa na ʋa ɓalizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">taɓai ɠa kɔ̀lɔ su yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>Ungo, gè nà-faaɠaaza golai ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">zìi ɠa zoolɛzu ga nà-kotoi vaa.<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>Tama sìli nuiti ta vulua, zɛbɛi ɠa ti ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">Niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu fuun, naati mɔinʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>Niiti ti nà-faanɛɛi zuloozu ga faa ɲɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">ti ɗa wuzeɠe dàalɔɠɔma, tɔɔzei faa ʋagɔi ɠa gè gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mina ɠɛlɛ bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:22">Nà-GALAGI, mina maaɠooza bà.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 38:23"/>Ʋa fala, è ɓɔ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:23">Màliɠii, nà-kizogi!<verse eid="PSA 38:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s">Saai ɠakala</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii Yedutun nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>Gè ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Nà daazu ma kpɛ ga sìɛ ʋeleiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">gè ʋa koto ɠɛ kpɔ̀ɛ wooiti su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">Nà yeeʋɛɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">ni nɔ dɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa tùɠɔ.»<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>Gè ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔni maaɠɛkpɔ golai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">gè la woo ɠila kpalaa boni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">Nà-taɓai wola zuwɔɔlɔni.<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>Zìi ɠɛni zoolɛzu kòozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">zɛ̀gɛ kpalagi wosu, abui ɗa zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">wooi ʋaani kìsu, gè ɓɔɛ, gè ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-eteai ɠaaɓelagi lɛ ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">sìi ma voloi liegɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">naa ɠa a kɛ gè kwɛɛ ʋelei sìi zuɓuɠaai la.<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>Wɛlɛ, nà-foloiti kwɛteʋeʋɛ, ta ga zeelo gilagi liegɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">Sìi zuɠooza ʋelei la è ɠaazu ga ani nɔpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">Ungo, nui kpein é loni, toɠa è ɠaazu ga fiilɛi nɔ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 39:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>Ungo, nui ɠa ziɛzu eɠɛ niinigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɲiikpi, kɛlɛ toɠa ga fiilɛi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Toɠa ani ʋagɔiti gaalɛɛzu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">kɛlɛ é la kwɛni, ɓɛ ɠa é ʋaazu ti yɛʋɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>«Niizu, Màliɠii, leeni ɠa nà ɠito ba niina?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">Nà-kitogi ɠa ɗa nɔ è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla nà-tɔ koloɠologi kpein su!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">Mina va bu, ɠimalala nuiti ti ʋa dɔ̀ ɓaaɠulamai zu!<verse eid="PSA 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>Nà maaɠɛsu kpɔ, gè la laalaosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è tii ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>Ɗa-ɓakɔiti maaɠooza bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">È-yeei a ɠɛna dòɠaa, nà loozu.<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>Ni a kɛ è nuiti maaɠolo, ɗa ti loɠazu ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">è ti nɛɛbɛ aniiti koloɠolo eɠɛ fɔfɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Ungo, nui kpein ka ga fiilɛi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 39:12">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>«Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">woilo nà-kpee wooi ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">Mina woizuɓɔlɔ nà-gɔlɔ wooiti tuɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">Mazɔlɔɔ nà ga wɛɛn è ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">gè ɠɛ ga seikɔɠɔma nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">eɠɛʋelei mɛ̀mɛwolani ti ɠɛni la.<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 39:14"/>Ɠaazu lati, è seɠe bà, ga gè undaanɛɛ zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:14">aisa gè ʋa li, gè ɲɛɛlɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 39:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-kizo fai ta ná-botiɠɛ nui ná-fai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>Gè ɠitoni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">é ungi maayeini pɔ̀ pelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">é woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>É mɛ̀ɛnni, é kùla zeɠezaɠa ɲɔi zu, palaʋalai ɓomaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">É kɔ̀ɠɔiti to fasai ma, é kɔ̀ɠɔiti topele ɓɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>É guye niinɛ lɔ dà, da-ƓALAGI maamusɛ vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">ma mɔinmɔin ka pɛtɛ, ti lua tɔun ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">ta ɠaliva Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii é ɠitosu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">é la ɠaaʋotesu waso nuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">niiti ti zɛɛ wo maaɓɔgi zu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">niiti ti zɛɛ wo maaɓɔgi zu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">niiti ti ɠaaʋotesu zɛɛ ɠalagiti ma</char></note><verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ná-GALAGI, è ɗa-vaa ʋagɔiti ta è ɠisu vaiti mɔinʋɛ su gi letegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">è-ʋokɔɠɔma la ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">nà pɔ gè naa wo, gè zeze la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">ti wola mɔinʋɛ gola, ti ɠaa la luga.<verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>È la zalaɠai ʋɔ, ɓaa vebɛanii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">è gòiyeɠeiti daalaogɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">è la gala zalaɠai maaɠaazaɠaboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">ɓaa koto gba zalaɠai.<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>Gè ɠɛni ma naazu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">«Wɛlɛ, gè ʋa ga sɛʋɛi nii kɛai nà-faa zu,<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>zìima vai ɠa ga gè è-yiimai ɠɛ, nà-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">Ɗa-lɔgi ɠa zìimaʋɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>Nà unmɔɔ fai ma woo niinɛ ʋagɔi laazeelizu maaɓɔ golai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">wɛlɛ, gè la laaɠulusu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è naa zuɠwɛɛ!<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>Gè la unmɔɔ fai zulɔɔɠua zìimaʋɛ, nii è kɛai bɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">Nà zezezu ga ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ma vai, ta ɗa-ɠizo fai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">gè la ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai lɔɔɠua, ta ɗa-ɠaamai maaɓɔ golai zu.<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>Ɗa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è la ɠɛlɛa, è ʋa ɓe ɗa-maawɔinɠai veezu bɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ta ɗa-ɠaamai, ta màkɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>Maanɔɠɔ mɔinmɔin ka màaɠoolii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">nà-faaɠaaza golaiti ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔga mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">gè la zooga gè ʋa wozaɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">Ti mɔinʋɛ, ti leʋe nɔ̀undeɠai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">sùvikɛi ɠulaa sù.<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, soma è ùnmɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, suvilɛ, è ɓɔ bà!<verse eid="PSA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Ti pɛ ti unfe ʋɔɔma, ti wooi zupu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">tɛiti ti pɔ ti zɛ̀nvui ɠula zèa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">Ti li ga ʋoluʋelei, ti unfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">tɛiti kpein ti wɔinɗai ga màanɔɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Ti laavɔ ta-unfegi ma ɠasɔi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">niiti ti ɲɛɛɠulazu nɔ̀un su!<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Niiti dɔin ti è ɠaiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">ti ɠaazuɠalakala, ti ɠoozunɛ è ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">niiti ɗa-ɠizo fai nɛai ti ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">ti ɠɛ ma yeenɔpɛ: «Lɛbiyai ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 40:18"/>Nɔ̀un nà, màanɔɠɔʋɛ, gè ɠɛ ga bala nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">kɛlɛ Màliɠii ɠa ɠisiɛzu sù.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">Ɗa ga nà-kpɔba nui, ta ùnmɔɔ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:18">nà-GALAGI, mina nɛkɛ!<verse eid="PSA 40:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s">Seeɓɛ nui, ti wɔinzeɠezu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii é daazu ma ga bala nui ná-fai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">Maanɔɠɔ voloi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI unmɔɔ tɔ ɓalaa.<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa makɛ, é zɛnvui wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">undaa ɠa nɛ ná-zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">é la dɔa sili nuiti ziimai zu.<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa yeeyɛ ba, a ɠɛna laani betei zu taɓai ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">Toɠa pilɛ kɔɠɔiti ga, siɛgi zu é zeeɓɛzu la.<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: «Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, màawɔinɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">Kɛdɛyai ve bɛ̀, gè kotoi ɠɛa è laalɔɠɔma!»<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>Wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti ta ɓɔɛzu dàalɔɠɔma ga ɲɔuɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Siɛgi ɓɛgele zu ɠa é zaazu la?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">Daaseigi ɠa za siɛgi ɓɛgele zu?»<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Ni nui ta a ʋaana é wɛlɛ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">toɠa kpɔɛ wafuungiti bosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">zii ɠa telebotala vaiti gaalɛɛzu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">é ɠula, é li, é ɓɔɛ eteaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>Niiti kpein ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu, ta ɓɔɛzu laa wu ɓɔɠɔ zaama ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">ti ɗa ɠisiɛ maanɔɠɔ vaiti su dàalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>«Niima zeeɓɛi é sogai, faa ɲɔu wola ɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">É laa betei ɠa, é la mɔ wuzeɠea eyɛsu pɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>Anɛɛ bɔ̀ɔla ʋagɔi nii gè laani da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">gi ɗa nà-daamianigi mi gá tɔ, naa wuzeɠea dàalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, màawɔinɠa, è ʋa è bùzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">nà naa ve ti ya, nii maanɛai ti sɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>Wɛlɛ, nii gè kwɛɛgai la ga è wɔinʋɛ ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">toɠa ga sìli nui la zobo sɔlɔɔsu mà.<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>Ɗa makɛsu mà nà-sɔbalalai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">ɗa màkɛ è ɠakalaʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 41:14"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:14">Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, ɠɔoɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:14">Amina! Amina!<verse eid="PSA 41:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="ms1">Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 42-72">Guyeiti 42—72</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Eɠɛ dopai nii kpɔɔle wɔin ma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">42:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma mɔinmɔin su, Guyeiti 42 ta 43 kpɔgɛ su, ti ɠɛ ga guyei ɠila.</char>
    </note>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-ɠidafaawui.<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>Ʋelei kpɔɔle wɔin a ɠɛna dopai ma, a ɗa ziɛi ɠaiziɛ la, nii é yeizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">ʋele ɠana zìi è magalasu da, ee, GALA!<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>GALA wɔin ɠa zìi ma, eɠɛ kpɔɔle wɔin, zɛnvu su ƓALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">Siɛgi ɓɛgele ɠa nà lii la, gè ɠula kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">gè lo GALA gaazu ná-pɛlɛi wu?<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>Gàazuɗɛiti ti ɠɛa ga kɔ̀nɔgi, folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">siɛgi zu ti ɠɛɛzu mà la yeenɔpɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">«Mini ɠa ɗa-ƓALAGI ná?»<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nii gè ɠisiɛzu su, zìi ɗa ɓali kòozu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Gè ɠɛni bɛbɛi luɠɔ, gi ɗa li GALA pɛlɛi ʋɔ pelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">koozunɛ wolai zu, ta faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">nuɓusɛi kpein bɛ, niiti ti ɠɛni fɛtii zu.<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>Leeni vaa zu, zìi, è ɲiikpisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">è ɗa kpalagi wo kòozu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">Ɠito GALA ba, mazɔlɔɔ nà maamusɛzu ʋolu dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">toɠa ga nà-kizogi ta nà-GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>Zìi ɠa ɓalizu nà-faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">naa ɠa é ba, nà ɠisiɛzu è zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">Zuludɛn yooi zu, gè su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn gizei, ta Miseyaal gizei ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>Ziɛ zulugi ɠa ɗa taɠili toli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">ɗa-ɠɔtuɗɛiti gooiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">Ɗa-veinfeingiti ta ɗa-ɗɛ lakpatakpagiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">ti yeini nɔ̀un ma.<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>Foloi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛɛzu bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">kpidii, ná-guyei ɠa ɗa ʋilɛ pòlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">Nà nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi laazeelizu GALAGI ma, nii é ga zɛ̀nvui.<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>Nà ɗa ɠɛ GALA ma, nii é ga nà-fasai:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">«Lee vaa zu è yeemaai mà?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">Lee vaa zu kɛni gè ziɛ gaazuɠilii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">sìli nuiti ta-wɔinzeɠemai zu?»<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>Wɛlɛ, gè ɠoloɠologa ɲɛgɛlɛin ga ta-ʋoomugiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">siɛgi zu wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti ti ɓaaɠulazu mà la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Ta ɠɛna ɠɛa mà yeenɔpɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">«Mini ɠa ɗa-ƓALAGI ná?»<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 42:12"/>Leeni vaa zu, zìi, è ɲiikpisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">è ɗa kpalagi wo kòozu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">Ɠito GALA ba, mazɔlɔɔ nà maamusɛzu ʋolu dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:12">toɠa ga nà-kizogi, ta nà-GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 42:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠito GALA ba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">43:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma mɔinmɔin su, Guyeiti 42 ta 43 kpɔgɛ su, ti ɠɛ ga guyei ɠila.</char>
    </note>Ee, GALA, tukpɔi lo bɛ̀!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">Màalobo ladalala nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla keleɠele ɲɔu nuiti zea, ti ga yaava nuiti!<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>Ɗa ɠa è ga nà-GALAGI, màkɛ nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Leeni vaa zu è pìliga ya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Leeni vaa zu nà nà-eteai ziɛ gaazuɠilii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">sìli nuiti ta-wɔinzeɠemai zu?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>Ɗa-wozakalagi leʋe ta ɗa-ɠaamai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">Ti lo tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">ti li ga ze ɗa-ɠize ɲadegai ma, è-zeizuʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>Nà liizu GALA ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">GALA pɔ bɛ, nii é ga nà-koozunɛ wolai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">Nà è maamusɛ ga kɔnigi wooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">ee, GALA, nà-GALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Leeni vaa zu, zìi, è ɲiikpisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">è ɗa kpalagi wo kòozu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Ɠito GALA ba, mazɔlɔɔ nà maamusɛzu ʋolu dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">toɠa ga nà-kizogi, ta nà-GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s">Nii GALA ge piligai ya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-ɠidafaawui.<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>Ee, GALA, gi mɛnini ga gi-woiyeɠeiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">gi-mɛmɛwolani ti boni gi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">kɛɛwotii nii kpein è kɛɛni ta-ziɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">wɔlɔwɔlɔi ma voloiti su.<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>È-yeei ɠa è zii ɠiligiti kpɛɛni la, è gi-mɛmɛwolani seizu ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">è ziiti doɠani, nii a kɛ ti ɠaawɔɔlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ta-woɠa zɔkpɔi laade, ti ʋa zooi zɔlɔɔ da ga tɔnɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">Ti-yeelokoi laade, é ʋa ti ɠizo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">Kɛlɛ kɛni è-yeezai, è-yeelokoi, è-ɠaazuʋɛ ma wozakalagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">tɔɔzei è ɠɛni ga ti-ʋoluzeigi, ɗa-ƓALA pagɔlai ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa ɠa è ga nà-masagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">devei ve Zakɔɓe ná-kizo fai zu!<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>Gá ɠɛna è ʋolu, gá gi zili nuiti toka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">è-zaalai zu, gá ɠɔɠɔlo naati ma, niiti ti wuzeɠezu gi laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè la ɠalivaani nà-mɛɛin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">nà-boɠa zɔkpɔi laade, é ʋa ɠɛ kìzosu.<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa ɠa è gi ɠizosu gi zili nuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">niiti ti gi maayoseɠezu, è unfegi lɔ naati gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Gá-ƓALAGI, gá è maamusɛzu folo-o-folo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">gá yɛ è-laaseigi lɛbizu eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 44:9">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, è gi ʋiliga ya, è unfegi yei ga giye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">è la mɔ yɛsu gá-zalaʋusuiti ba kɔɔmaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>Ɗa vaazu bu gi zili nuiti ti gi ɓɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">gi wɔinzeɠe nuiti ti loo gi ma ga ti-yiimai.<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>È gi lɔɔni ti yeezu eɠɛ baalagiti ti liizu ti ʋaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">ɗa gi vazasu zii ɠiligiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>È ɗa-nuɓusɛiti pɔdini ga daanɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">è la tɔnɔ nɔpɛ sɔlɔɔni su.<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>È gi ɠɛɛni ga zɔngɔzɛlɛ ba anii, gi-zeiɲɔɠɔiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">gi ɠɛa ga gi-maaɠoolii zu nuiti ta-ɲɛɛɠulasu anii, nii ti zɔngɔzu ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>È gi ɠɛa ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii zii ɠiligiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">nuiti ta ɠɔmɔɔnizu ga giye zii ɠiligiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>Nà-ɓaaɠulamai ɠa tùɠɔ yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">unfegi gàazuʋɛ ɓidia,<verse eid="PSA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>siɛgi zu gè zɔngɔzɛlɛ ba nui wooi mɛnisu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">é ɗa faiti gaaʋala ba, sili nui é ga potokula nui.<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>Naa kpein ka zeelizu gi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">anɛɛ naa ʋe, gi la yeemani è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">gi la ɗa-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠoloni.<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>Gi la ʋoluaveni ɗa gi-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">gi-ɠɔɠɔiti ti la maaɠoozani ɗa-ʋelei ʋa,<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>anɛɛ naa ʋe, è gi wolowoloni koʋeiti pɛɛzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">è gi maaɓɔlega ga kpidi ɓɔii.<verse eid="PSA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>Ni gi yeemani gá-ƓALAGI laaseigi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">ni gi yeezeini gala kili bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>GALA ge la ɓena naa ʋoluɠula ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">tɔungi é dɔɔɠuzu vaiti kwɛɛ nu yiimaʋɛ?<verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>Kɛlɛ è maaʋele ɠa é kɛɛzu, ti gi lɔɔzu la saai zu folo-o-folo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">ti ɗa gi leve ga baalagiti, ti liizu ga tiye ti-ʋaazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Wuzeɠe! Leeni vaa zu è ɲiizu, Màliɠii?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">Wuun! Mina gi ʋili ya ɲɛgɛlɛin!<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>Leeni vaa zu è ɠaazuʋɛ lɔɔɠuzu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">Leeni vaa zu è yeemazu gá-maanɔɠɔi ma, ta gá-wɔinzeɠemai?<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gá laani fufiligi zu, ziiɓɔlɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">gi laaʋɛɛʋɛ zooi ma, ungo, pɔlɔi ɓɔɠɔi ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 44:27"/>Wuzeɠe! È ɓɔ gi ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:27">Gi unmɔɔ ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma!<verse eid="PSA 44:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s">Masagi ná-vulu ɠɛɛ vai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Bulɛgi ma ʋuaiti». Kolé mavofodaiti ta-ɠidafaawui, ta ta-nɛɛbɛ wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>Zìi ɠa ɲiikpisu ga woo ʋagɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">nà-kɛɛwotiiti ta ga masagi nɔnɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">Nà pɔ ga nɛ̀gi ɠɛ ga seeli kpaɠai, é sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui yeezu nii ɠigi ma.<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>Nuɓusɛiti kpein saama, è ʋagɛ ti pɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">è ɓɔɛ ʋeleiti pagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">GALA ge tuya looʋɛ è ʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>Ɗa-woɠa zɔkpɔi ɠili zaama, kɔɔɠɔ nu wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">ɗa-maayikii ta ɗa-lɛbiyai nii é volozu.<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Ɗa-lɛbiyai zu, zobo sɔlɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">Lo ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ wotoloi luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">è gaamai maalobo, naa ʋɛɛ ɓɔɠɔmaayeii ʋa ta telebodai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">È-yeezai ɠa pilɛ sɔlɔɔ, é faa wolaiti dɛɛ ga ɗe!<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>Ɗa-mɛɛinti gaazoɓaʋɛ, nuɓusɛiti ta loo bu è ɠakalaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">ɗa-mɛɛinti ta lɔ masagi zili nuiti ziiti su.<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa ná yeenɔpɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ee, GALA, ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa ná yeenɔpɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ɗa-masadai GALA ge fea è ya, toɠa ná ɠɔoɠɔ ta ɠɔoɠɔ</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">ɗa-masa tukpɔi ɠa ga telebo tukpɔi.<verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Telebodai nɛɛʋɛ è ʋɛ, è faa ɲɔi wɔinzeɠe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">Naa ɠa é ba, GALA, ɗa-ƓALAGI gulɔi ziɛni è ma, koozunɛ wulɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">é yiimazeɠe ga ɗe è ɠɛɠalaiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Miilegi, ta kanɛlegi, naa ʋɛɛ alɔwɛgi ʋa ta ɗa-zeɠei makugi nɛɛzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">Ɗa-masa pɛlɛiti buuɓɛtɛʋɛ ga see ɲiigai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">miná ɠa ti kɔnigi ɠɛinsu ná, ti ɗa è ɠoozunɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Wɛlɛ, masa anzanuiti ka ti ga è-ziɛpoluɲɔɠɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">masa anzanui ɠa è yeezazuʋɛ, maaɠiliai ga zanugi nii seɠeai Wofiil yooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Woilo dòun anzanu, wɛlɛ, è woilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">yeema ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ma, ta è-ɠɛɛ ná-pɛlɛyeɠei.<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>Ɗa-ʋadai nɛa masagi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">tɔɔzei tɔ ɠa é ga è-maliɠii, nɔkɔ tɔun bu.<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Tiil yooi zu nuiti, nuɓusɛiti ti wola ɓɛtɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">naati ta ɗa-ɓɔbai ɠaiziɛ, faanɛɛi ʋɔ ta kɛ è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Anzanu loin maazogai masagi ʋɛ, toɠa volozu masa pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">ma zeɠei zuʋuʋɛ ga zanugi.<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>Ta liizu la masagi ʋɔ, é seɠe zuʋuai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">Anzalopo ɓulugi ʋilɛgai polu, ti ʋa ga tiye è ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>Ti lɔ masagi ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">ga fɛti wuyeiti, koozunɛɛi zaama.<verse eid="PSA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>È-loun zunuiti ta zei, ti ɠɛ ga masagi, è ɠɛɛni potogi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">Ɗa ti zei ga kundiɠiiti zooi zu ná pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 45:18"/>Nà è-laaseigi ɠula kɛlɛma, gè bo yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su nuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:18">naa ɠa a kɛ, nuɓusɛiti ti è maamusɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ade ma ga siɠigi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei. Too ʋelei ɠaaɓaingai.<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>GALA ka ade ʋɛ ga ade-lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, ta siɠigi é ade ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">kpɔbai é nu yeema yeenɔpɛ kidaaʋili foloi zu.<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, maaɠili la ade ma, siɛgi zu eteai ɲiikpisu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">gizeiti ti ɓusɛ, ti ʋu kpoloɗɛiti saamaʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>siɛgi zu ma ɗɛiti ti zɔngɔzu la, ti ɗa vuɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">ti ɗa gizeiti ɲiikpi, ti ɗa ti wuzeɠe.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>Ziɛ wolai ɠa ná, nii ma lobaiti ti GALA ná-taai ɠoozunɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa zeizu ɲadega wolai zaamaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>GALA ka zeini saama, é la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">GALA ka ɓɔsu ba, é lɔɔzei folo lie kulazuʋɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>Zii ɠiligiti ta zɔngɔzu, masadaiti ti ɗa ɲiikpi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Kɛlɛ GALA ga ɓɔɛna, eteai ɠa lua.<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa ade ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI ɠa é ade ʋɛ ga siɠi gaaɠoozagi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:8">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>À ʋa lɛɛ, wo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kɛɛwotiiti ka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">laavɔɔ vaa wolaiti é ti ɠɛai eteai zu!<verse eid="PSA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>Tɔ ɠa é kɔɔi ɓegai eyɛsu é zeeli zou ɓela ga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">Toɠa mɛɛin ɠaleɠalezu, é kpɛɛin zuɠaleɠale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">é kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai zu, naa ɠa ga: </char><char style="fqa">kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti</char>.</note> gala ga abui.<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>«À lo! À suɠwɛɛ ga nà ɠa gè ga GALA.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">Nà zeini ziiti pɛ unda, nà zeini eteai unda.»<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 46:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa ade ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:12">Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI ɠa é ade ʋɛ ga siɠi gaaɠoozagi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:12">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 46:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s">À yealoɠa GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Nuɓusɛiti, wo kpein à yealoɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">À ɠoozunɛ wo wooɠula GALA ma!<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maayikiʋɛ, nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">tɔ ɠa é ga eteai kpein su masa golai.<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>É nuɓusɛiti koloa gi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">é ziiti kolo gi-ɠɔɠɔi wu.<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>É yiimazeɠea ga gá-yooi gi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">é ɠɛ ga nɛɛbɛ nui Zakɔɓe mavofodai ná-lɛbiyai.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 47:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>GALA ka lɛɛzu seizuʋɛ pilɛ sɔlɔɔ gooi zaama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa liizu ɠakala ʋelei puʋu fɛɛ wooi ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>À guyei loo GALA dɛbi vai ma, à guyei loo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">À guyei loo gá-masagi lɛbi vai ma, à guyei loo!<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka ga eteai ma masagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">à kidafaawu wuyei loo bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>GALA ka masadai ɠɛɛzu ziiti unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">GALA ka masadai ɠɛɛzu ná-masa kpɔkpɔ ɲadegai ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 47:10"/>Ziiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ta ɓɔsu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">ta Abalaame ná-GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">Mazɔlɔɔ eteai ma wɛlɛma nuiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wɛlɛma nuiti</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">zobobɛ nuiti</char></note> kpein ta GALA zeezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:10">Tɔ ɠa é zeini eteai pɛ unda.<verse eid="PSA 47:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-taazuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Guyei. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>Ungo, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔɔlɔʋɛ, toɠa maamusɛi kpein soloogai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">gá-ƓALAGI ná-taazuʋɛ, ná-gize ɲadegai ma.<verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>Gize maanɛɛgi, nii é eteai pɛ koozunɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">Siyɔn gizei, nii é ga GALA seizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">masa golai ná-taai!<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>GALA ka ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu, eɠɛ siɠi gaaɠoozagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">Siyɔn masa pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wɛlɛ, masagiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:5">ti liini ʋɔɔma Siyɔn laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>Ti wɛlɛni, ti laavɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">ti ɠoozuʋilini ti ʋela.<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Ti zasuɓalini náʋɛ nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">eɠɛ taɓai nii a ɗa anzanui zo a ɠɛna doin zɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>Eɠɛ folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">é Taalasise ɓato wolaiti koloɠolosu.<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>Nii gi mɛnini, gi naa ɠa gá ɓɔɠɔi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-taazuʋɛ, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, gá-ƓALAGI ná-taazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">GALA ka sasulɔ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Ee, GALA, gá ɠisiɛzu ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">è zei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>Ee, GALA, è lɔɠɔɠulaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">ɗa-maamusɛi zeelia zou ɓela ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">è-yeezai laavegɛ ga telebodai.<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>Koozunɛɛi ɠa Siyɔn gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">Zuda yooi zu laaiti ta ɠoozunɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:12">ɗa-lukpɔɠaaleʋe vaiti maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>À Siyɔn maalati, wo ziɛ koozuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">wo ná-pɛlɛ ɠaaɠoozagiti gaalu,<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>à ná-siɠigiti pɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">wo wɛlɛ dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ ma ʋɛlɛiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">wo ʋa bo yamanii zu nuiti ma, ti ʋaazu.<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 48:15"/>Wɛlɛna GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:15">nii é ga gá-ƓALAGI eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:15">Toɠa ɠɛ ga gá-lotuɠɔi eyɛsu saai.<verse eid="PSA 48:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s">Gɔvɛ la lia ga ani nɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>À woilo dɛɛ nii ma, wo kpein nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">à woilo dɛɛ, nuɓusɛiti wɔi kpein wo zeini eteai zu,<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>ɓolomadɔɠɔiti ta nu wolaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">wo pɛ kpɛtɛ nuiti ta bala nuiti!<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>Ɠima ɓɔɛiti ta ɠulazu dàaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">Nà-kigaiziɛiti daavegɛ ga kisiɛ ʋagɔiti.<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>Gòilogɛ ɠima vaalaaliiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">nà faalaaliiti poluwosu kɔnigi ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Leeni vaa zu nà lua maanɔɠɔ voloiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">siɛgi zu sìli nuiti ta-vaaɠaaza golai màaɠoolizu la?<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>Ta-zɔlɔɔgi ɠa ti laai da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">ti ɗa waso da, ta-naavolo wolai zaama.<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa bɔɔla unmɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">Tanɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa zɛnvui unmɔɔ salai ve GALA zea.<verse eid="PSA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti-yɛnvui unmɔɔ salai wola ɓaaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">Kɛni ti yeema ma ɠisiɛi ma vɔlɔ ɲɛgɛlɛin.<verse eid="PSA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>Ta ɠisiɛzu ga ta yɛ vulua eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">ti lɔɔɠu saai ʋa?<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Ɗa ɠima nui ɠaazu, é za,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">titi nui ta ɠimalala nui naati undaa ɠa ʋilisu ɠana nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">ti ti-yeaɠɔligiti zɛ taɠiligaani zea.<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Anɛɛ ni ti-laaseigiti pɛɛʋɛ ta-yooiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">ta-ɠabaiti ta ɠɛɛzu ga ta-ʋɛlɛ ɠaaɓelagiti, eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">ti-zeizuʋɛti ti yɛsu ná, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Kɛlɛ nui nii unfema wolai bɛ, naa zii zu la ɠooza ɲɛgɛlɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">kulaʋɛ ga suaiti ti undaaʋilisu.<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>Wɛlɛ fai ʋa, seiɗai naati tuɠɔ, niiti ti laazu ti la, ta-litigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">naati ta-ʋelela ʋele vai ɠana, niiti ti ɠitosu ta-ɓɔɛzuɠulaiti ba.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 49:14">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>Ta ti laaʋilisu gɔvɛalaazu eɠɛ baala kpulugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">saai lo ti luɠɔ, é li ga tiye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Su la ɠooza telebo nuiti ti ɠɔɠɔlo ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">pagi ti ɠɛni su, naa ɲɛɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">gɔvɛalaazu ɠa ɠɛ ga ti-zeizuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ka zɛ̀nvui unmɔɔ, é kùla gɔvɛalaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">mazɔlɔɔ toɠa sèɠe.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 49:16">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>Mina yiizoolɛ, siɛgi zu nui ta ɓɛtɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">siɛgi zu ná-pɛlɛ wu zɔɔlai ɠaawɔɔlɔzu la,<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>mazɔlɔɔ é la lia ga tanɔpɛ a ɠɛna zaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">sɔlɔɔ ganiiti ti la ʋilɛga polu.<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>Toɠa ɓɔɠɔ leve ga undaanɛɛʋɛ ná-eteai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">Ta maamusɛ tɔɔzei é undaanɛɛi zɔlɔɔni.<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>Kɛni é ʋilɛ mɛmɛwolani polu, ti zaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">niiti ti la mɔ wozakalagi ɠa é ʋa volo eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 49:21"/>Nui nii unfemai bɛ, kɛlɛ ɠi ge la ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:21">kulaʋɛ ga suaiti ti undaaʋilisu.<verse eid="PSA 49:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ʋaazu <optbreak/> ná-nuɓusɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Azafe ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 50:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">GALA, GALA, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɓɔɛzu, é ɗa eteai loli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">é zo folo ɠulazu, é li folo liizu.<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>É zo Siyɔn, taai naa fizɔgai pagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">miná ɠa GALA ge volozu ná, é ɗa ɠula kɛlɛma adaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>Gá-ƓALAGI ɠa ʋaazu, é la yɛga maaɠɛkpɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">abui ɠa tuɠɔ, é ɗa galai wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">maaɠooliʋɛ ga tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi.<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>GALA ka geeɠɔlɔgiti tolisu ti maazu ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">ta zooi, ga ti ʋa ná-nuɓusɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>«À nà-lada nuiti gaalɛ ba bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">ti minazeɠe bɛ̀ ga zalaɠai!»<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>Geeɠɔlɔgiti ta ná-telebodai lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka é ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 50:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>«Nà-nuɓusɛi woilo, nà ɓɔɛzu è ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">Izilayɛle, nà zeele wooi wosu è laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">nɛ̀i gè ga GALA, ɗa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>Ɗa-zalaɠaiti faa laade, gè ʋa ɠɛ zeliiti tosu da è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">ɗa-ɠala zalaɠaiti ta gàazu yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Gè la nikɛ zinɛ zeɠezu ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">anɛɛ bolia ɗa-logani makɛsuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ dɔɓɔ zuaiti kpein ta ga nɔ̀nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">ta sua mɔinmɔingiti ti gizeiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>Gè wɔniiti kpein kwɛɛ, ti gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">ta nii kpein é ɲiikpisu dɔɓɔiti su ta ga nɔ̀nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>Ni pulu ɠɛni ma, gè la ɓena bo è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">mazɔlɔɔ eteai ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ, ta nii dɔin é ʋuuni su.<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>Nà ɗa nikɛ zinɛi ma zuaiti mi ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">Nà ɗa boli ɲamaiti kpɔle ɓaa?<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>Nii ɗa kɛ ga zalaɠai bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga GALA, naa ɠa ga faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">È ɗa-minazeɠegiti daazeeli bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè Anii-Pɛ-Unda.<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>Wooɠula mà kidaaʋili foloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">nà è unmɔɔ, ɗa lɛbiyai ve bɛ̀.»<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>GALA ge ɠɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">«Leeni ʋe mu! Ɗa nà-deveiti bosu ɠisu nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">nà-minazeɠe gooi ɠɛ è-laaʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>ɗɛi è kalagi wɔinzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">è dàawooiti pilisu ya è ʋoluʋelei!<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Ɗa unma nui ɠaana, ɗa ɠɛɛzu ga naa ná-kpɔba nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">wa ɓɔsu faa ɠilagi ma wa wɛɛnzo nuiti,<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>ɗa è-laaʋɛ lɔɔzu faa ɲɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">è-nɛgi ɠa yaavai ɓɛtɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Siɛgi zu wo zeizu la wa zɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">ɗa vaazu è-ɠɛɛloin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">ɗa è-leeloin maaɓoozu.<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>«Wɛlɛna, naa ɠa è kɛɛni, gè maaɠɛ kpɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">è ɠisiɛni ga nà ga è ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">kɛlɛ nà zeliiti tosu è ma, gè ti pɛ dɛɛ è ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>À naa ɠaaɠa, wɔi wo yeemazu mà, nɛ̀i gè ga GALA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">à dama, gè mina wo ʋali ga, nu nɔpɛ ge la wo unmɔɔga.<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>Zɔi a ɠɛ zalaɠa ɠulazu, é kɛ ga faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛgai, naama nui ɠa dɛ̀bizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">zɔi é ɠaaɓaazu siɛ ʋelei ma, nà, GALA, nà nà-kizo fai lɛɛ la.»<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s">Maavaayɛ gaiziɛ ƓALA falii</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei. <verse eid="PSA 51:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>Siɛgi zu GALA goo wo nui Natan liini la Davide ʋɔ bɛ, pilɛgai ma Ɓate-Seɓa ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>Ee, GALA, màawɔinɠa ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">ɗa-maawɔinɠaa wolai ʋɔ, nà-tɔ koloɠologiti gaaʋa.<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>Gbà ga pagɔ, è kùla nà-faaɠaaza golaiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">ɲàde, è nà-kotoi zeɠe bà.<verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè nà-tɔ koloɠologiti kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">nà-kotoi ma ɠisiɛi ɠa kpɔ̀lɔzu yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>Ɗa ɠa gè kotoi ɠɛai è laalɔɠɔma, ɗa ɠila kpe è laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">nii ɲɔuɗai è ɠaazu, gè naa ɠɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">naa ɠa a kɛ, è ɠɛ ga sɔle nu ɗa-vaawogi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">zelii mina lo è ma, ɗa ɠɛna tùkpɔɠaaleʋea.<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>Wɛlɛ, sɔ̀lɔɔgɛ faaɠaaza golai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">kaite zɛ̀gɛ dèe ɠoozu, gè ɠɛ ga kotoba nu.<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>Kɛlɛ, gaamai é nui yiimaʋɛ, naa ɠa nɛai è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">ɠimalai lɛ ga ze zìimaʋɛ, ʋɛ ná lɔɔɠuai.<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>Ɲàde ga ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ɲàde ga ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 14:4">Lev 14:4</ref></char>.</char></note> nà ɠole naazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">gbà, nà ɠole kobe kolegi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>Koozunɛɛi ta ziilɛi fai wo mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">kpùsɛi è suɓɔlɔkpɔlɔni, naa ɠa ɠoozunɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>Ɠaazuzeɠe nà-kotoiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">nà-faaɠaaza golaiti gaaʋa.<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>Ee, GALA, zii ʋagɔi ɓɛtɛ kòozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">kìgi niinɛ, è sei ʋele ɓɛtɛ sù.<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>Mina pìli ya, è ʋa màaɠooza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">mina ɗa-Yɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠula zèa.<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>Ɗa-ɠizo fai ma ɠoozunɛɛi ve zèa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">GALA, è-yiimaɠɛ ɠi pagɔi yeezei bù, é màkɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>Niiti ti ga tɔ koloɠolo nuiti, nà naati kala ga ɗa-ʋeleiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">kotoba nuiti ta ʋa ʋolu è ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>Ee, GALA, nà-kizo GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla ɲama ʋuu vai nii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">nà guyei loo, gè ɗa-lelebodai ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>Màliɠii, dàkɔlɔgiti buzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">dàaʋɛ è maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zalaɠai la ga è yiilɛi gani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">ni naa laade, nà la ta ɠula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">Gala zalaɠai la ga è yiilɛi gani.<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Zalaɠa ɠila kpegi soloogai GALA ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">naa ɠa é ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei ɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">zɔi nimizaai, ziiɓɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">ee, GALA, è la ɠɛlɛa naa ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 51:20"/>Ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai zu, faa ʋagɔiti kɛ Siyɔn taa wolai ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:20">Zeluzalɛme ná-siɠigiti to.<verse eid="PSA 51:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 51:21"/>Naazu, è yiima zalaɠaiti ta ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">ta gala zalaɠaiti, nii kpusɛi kpein ge ɠalazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:21">Naazu, nikɛ zinɛiti ta ɠula ga zalaɠai, ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s">Naavolo nu ɲɔi ná-eteai ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-kidafaawui. <verse eid="PSA 52:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>Siɛgi zu Edɔme nui Dowɛge liini la, é ɠɛ Sayile ma, Davide liiʋɛ Ayimelɛke ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Ɗɛi è zuɓaai, leeni vaa zu è wasosu ɗa-zuɲɔi zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">Wɛlɛ, GALA ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa ɠulazu kɛlɛma folo-o-folo.<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>Yaavai nɔ ɠa è-nɛgi kpɛtɛzu, kpeka ɠaaligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">ɗa ga yaava nui!<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Faa ɲɔi nɛɛʋɛ è ʋɛ, é leʋe faa ʋagɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">zɛɛ vai nɛ è ʋɛ, é leʋe sɔle kpɔɛi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 52:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Nu ɠoloɠolo gooiti nɛɛʋɛ è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">è-nɛgi yaavaʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ka è lokasu eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">Toɠa è zosu ɗa-zeɠe ɠotai wu, é è lɔɔɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">é è-ma zapei lɔɔɠula fulu nuiti ta-yooi ɠa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 52:7">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Telebo nuiti ta naa ɠa, dualuagi ti zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">ti ɲɛɛɠula è zu, ti ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="PSA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>«Wɛlɛ zunui ʋa, nii é la ɠɛni GALA kɛɛni ga makɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">kɛlɛ é ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaani ná-naavolo wolai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">é ɗa ɓaa ɓɔɠɔ maazu ga ná-keleɠele ɲɔi!»<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 52:10"/>Nɔ̀un nà, nà GALA ná-pɛlɛi wu eɠɛ wolive wului ma wundui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:10">gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaaʋɛ GALA ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ma eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 52:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 52:11"/>Nà è maamusɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ, è-ɠɛɛ vai ʋɔ, nii è kɛai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:11">Nà ɠitosu è-laaseigi ʋa, tɔɔzei è ʋagɛ ɗa-wooɠɛɠila nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 52:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s">Eteai ná-kaka faa wolai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu koolei zu. Davide ná-kidafaawui.<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>Ɠimalala nui ɠa ɗa bo yiimaʋɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">«GALA ge la ná!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">Ti ɠakagɛ, ti faaɠaaza golai ɠɛa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">Gila kpalaa ge la ná, nii é faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>GALA ge yɛni geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">é unpilɛ, é nuɓusɛiti pɛtɛ zooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">é pɛtɛ, ni nu ɠila kpalaa ka ná, nii ɠi pagɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">é GALA gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>Ti pɛ ti maaɠooza, ti kpein ti ɠɛa ga yaava nuiti ʋɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">taɠila kpalaa ge la ná, nii é faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛzu, anɛɛ gila kpalaa.<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Niiti ti telebotala vai ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">ti la faa ɠaaɠaazu ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">Tɛi ti nà-nuɓusɛiti numasu, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɗa ɓului numa da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">Ti la wooɠulazu GALA ma.<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Miná ɠa ti zasuɓalizu ná ga duai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">anɛɛ dua un taade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">GALA ka naati ma ɠaei vaza niiti ti laalɛɛzu è wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">ɗa ti unfe, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge ti ʋilini ya.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 53:7"/>Nɔ̀un wɔ̀inʋɛ ga gè Izilayɛle ná-kizo fai ɠa, nii é ʋaazu Siyɔn gizei ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:7">Siɛgi zu GALA ge ná-nuɓusɛiti ta-vai valibosu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:7">Zakɔɓe mavofodai ɠa ɠoozunɛ, Izilayɛle ɠa ɠɛ koozunɛɛi zu!<verse eid="PSA 53:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ge ùnmɔɔni</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu ga kɔnigiti. Davide ná-kidafaawui. <verse eid="PSA 54:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>Siɛgi zu Zife nuiti ti ʋaani la, ti ɠɛ Sayile ma: «Davide lɔɔɠuʋɛ gi zaama.»<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Ee, GALA, kìzo è-laaseigi ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">telebo fai ɠɛ bɛ̀, ɗa-zobogi ʋɔ!<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Ee, GALA, nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi mɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">woilo dàawooiti ma!<verse eid="PSA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wɛɛinti ti wuzeɠea dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">suɲɔu zunuiti ta pɔ ti zɛ̀nvui ɠula zèa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">ti la ɠisiɛzu GALA su ga tago ɓalaa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 54:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ, GALA ka é ga nà-kpɔba nui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">Maliɠii ɠila kpe ka é ga pòluzeigi.<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>Toɠa sìli nuiti ta-vaa ɲɔi loo ti ma ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ʋɔ, ti laaɠulu, eyɛsu ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 54:8"/>Nà zalaɠaiti kula è ʋɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:8">nà è-laaseigi maamusɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, tɔɔzei pagɛ.<verse eid="PSA 54:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 54:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è ùnmɔɔni, è kùla kidaaʋiligiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:9">niizu, nà zoosu gè wɛlɛ sìli nuiti ba, ti maa ɗa nɔɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 54:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s">Nui ti yaavaai, ná-GALA falii</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu ga kɔnigiti. Davide ná-kidafaawui.<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Ee, GALA, woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">mina lɔɔɠu nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>Ɠida nà-faiti bu, è gòoɠaaʋote!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">Mazɔlɔɔ nà kpalagi wosu, gè ɗa kpeei loo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">Zìi ɠa kpɔlɔzu,<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>sìli nuiti daawooi maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">kpɔidai ʋɔ nu ɲɔiti ti bosu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">Mazɔlɔɔ ta màanɔɠɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">ti ɗa ʋilɛ pòlu ta-yiiɠulagi zu.<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>Zìi ɠa ɓalizu kòozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">saai ʋa luabai ɠa lɔɔzu ùnga.<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>Dualuagi ta sasuɓalii naati ta kpɔ̀lɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">maalua vai màaɓɔlega.<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>Gè ɠɛ ma: «Nà pɔ ga gè koʋe sɔlɔɔ, ga poopogi ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">gè ɠoʋe, gè li gè dooɠo bosu ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>Wɛlɛ, nà ʋela gè li ɠoozama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">gè li gè zei teʋebai zu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 55:8">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>Nà ʋelazu ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔ ga suvilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">gè lɔɔɠu fiilɛi ʋa, anɛɛ fiilɛ wolai.»<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Faazupui lɔ ti zaama, Màliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">ti laawooi zupu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">mazɔlɔɔ nà toomai ta zeeɠaaɠwɛɛi ɠaazu taazuʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>ti ziɛzu kpidii ta foloi siɠigiti ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">telebotalai ta faa ɲɔi ɠa taazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>Faa zuɠoloɠologi nɔ ɠa é ɠɛɛzu siɠigi naa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">yaavai ta zɛɛi la zeɠezu ta-maaɓɔ bosuʋɛti.<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sìli nu laade, é ʋa ɠɛ ɓaaɠulazu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">nà la va naa wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">wɔ̀inzeɠe nui laade, é ʋa ɠɛ wuzeɠeni dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">nà la lɔɔɠu ba.<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa ʋe, è ga zunui ga nɔ̀un kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">bɔ̀ɔlai, nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔi!<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>Dɛi de ɠɛa ɓɔni dɔɔɠuzu vaiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">siɛgi zu de ɠɛni liizu la ʋɔɔma, ada bɛbɛi GALA pɛlɛi wu!<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>Saai ɠula ti viliba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">Ti ma vului yei gɔvɛalaazu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">Mazɔlɔɔ faa ɲɔi ɠa ti-zeizuʋɛ, ta ti-yiimaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Nɔ̀un nà, nà kpee loozu GALA goizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa kìzo.<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>Kpɔkɔ, sobu ta folo gaalɔgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">zìi ɠa ɓɔlɔzu, gè ɗa ɓala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">toɠa gòoi mɛni.<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>Toɠa ziilɛigi veezu bɛ̀, é zɛ̀nvui unmɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">é kùla kɔɔi ya, nii ti daalɛa bù.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">Mazɔlɔɔ niiti ti kpɛ̀ɛzu, ti wola mɔinʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>GALA ka gòomɛni é ti ɠaayei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">Toɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu yeenɔpɛ!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 55:20">Lo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">Mazɔlɔɔ ti la valibosu ɲɛgɛlɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">ti la luazu GALA ba.<verse eid="PSA 55:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>Zunui naa ɠa laalɛɛzu seiɲɔɠɔiti kpein bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">é ná-minazeɠegi ɠaaʋala ba.<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>Daaʋɛ ʋagɛ nɔnɔ vukɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">kɛlɛ kɔɔi ɠa é ziimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">daawooiti nɛɛʋɛ gulɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">anɛɛ naa ʋe, ta ga boɠa zɔkpɔiti niiti ti ɠulaai ti-maalaɠagiti su.<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>È-maavaiti zɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">toɠa è zɛsɛbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">é la telebo nui yɛga ná, é ʋa ɲiikpi, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 55:24"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa ti yei zeɠezaɠai ɓomaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">ɲama ʋuu nuiti, yaava nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">ti la ti-zii ma voloi ma ɠaaɠwɛsui zɔlɔɔga eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:24">kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà, nà ɠalivaazu è ma.<verse eid="PSA 55:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s">Ni GALA ka nu ʋa, dualuagi ɓega</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Poopogi, gaayeiɗai, é lo zooiti ba, ti maaɠoozaai». Davide ná-guyei. Siɛgi zu Filisiti nuiti ti soni da Gate.<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Ee, GALA, màawɔinɠa, mazɔlɔɔ nuiti ta kpɔ̀lɔzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:2">Foloi kpein daawu ta sàkpesu, ti ɗa dàaʋili.<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>Yeenɔpɛ sìli nuiti ta ʋilɛsu pòlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">ti mɔinʋɛ gola, ta kɔɔi ʋɛɛzu bà, GALA é Anii-Pɛ-Unda!<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>Voloi nà ɠɛ luazu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">ɗa ɠa nà ɗa ɠaliva è ma.<verse eid="PSA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>Nà GALA maamusɛzu daawooi vaa zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">Nà ɠalivaazu GALA ma, gè la lua ani nɔpɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">Leeni ɠa nuiti ta zoo ti kɛ ga ze?<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Yeenɔpɛ, ta gòoi maavalibosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">kisiɛ ɲɔi nɔ ɠa é ti ɠisu nɔ̀un tetema.<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>Ta yaavai ɠɛɛzu, ti maaʋɛɛnɛgi wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">ti ɗa kɔ̀ɠɔʋo gaiziɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">tɔɔzei ti wɔinʋɛ ga ti zɛ̀nvui ɠula zèa.<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>Telebotalai naati kpein poluma, ta ɠula su nɛi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">Ee, GALA, nuɓusɛi naati pu ya zooi ma, ɗa-yiiɠaawanai zu!<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>È kɔ̀ɠɔ ʋilɛsuʋɛ liegi ɠaalugɛ nà-eteai zu, gè kɛai siɛziɛgi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">Gàazuɗɛi ɠaalɛ ba, è pu ɗa-ɠɔlɔ woolei zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">Ti zɛʋɛʋɛ ɗa-zɛʋɛi zu.<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>Naazu nɔ̀un sili nuiti ta ɠulazu ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">voloi gè kpee loozu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">gè kwɛni ga GALA ka bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>Nà GALA maamusɛzu daawooi vaa zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI musɛzu daawooi vaa zu.<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>Nà ɠalivaazu GALA ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">gè la lua ani nɔpɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">Leeni ɠa nuiti ta zoo ti kɛ ga ze?<verse eid="PSA 56:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>Ee, GALA, maanɛɛʋɛ gè minazeɠegiti daazeeli, niiti gè ti woni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">Nà mama zalaɠaiti kula è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 56:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è zɛ̀nvui ɠizoga, è kùla saai ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">kɔ̀ɠɔiti ti ʋoola tooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">naa ɠa a kɛ, gè ziɛ è ɠaazu, ee, GALA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:14">zɛnvui ma wozakalagi ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 56:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s">Nui ziilɛiɗai sili nuiti saama</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>Guyei loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Mina koloɠolo!» Davide ná-guyei. Siɛgi zu é ʋelani la, Sayile ɗa kpɛ, é li é lɔɔɠu pugi zu.<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>Màawɔinɠa, ee, GALA, màawɔinɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">Mazɔlɔɔ zɛ̀nvui ɠa lɔɔɠuzu è ʋoluʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">è-ɠoʋegiti ma niinigi ɠa gè lɔɔɠuzu bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">eyɛsu maanɔɠɔiti ti leʋe.<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>Nà wooɠulazu GALA ma, nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">GALA nii é fai pɛ kɛɛzu bɛ̀, eyɛsu gaaɓela ga pagɔ.<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>Toɠa ná-kizogi leʋe mà, é zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">É zelii lo naati ma, niiti ti kpɔ̀lɔzu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 57:4">Lo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">GALA ka ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ta ná-gaamai leʋe mà.<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>Nà zalaiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">nà laani nu mii nuiti kakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">ti-ɲiigaiti ta ga kpɛɛin ta mɛɛinti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">ti-nɛgi ɠaaliʋɛ eɠɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi.<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Ee, GALA, è wɔɔlɔ ʋelei lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi maazuʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">Ɗa-lɛbiyai volo eteai zu ná pɛ!<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>Ti tumɔi laani nà-pelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">ti pɛ̀lɛʋɛlɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">ti zeɠei wɔ tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">kɛlɛ tiya ɓɔɠɔi nɔ ɠa ti loai zeɠei naa zu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 57:7">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Ladalai ɠa zìimaʋɛ, ee, GALA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">Nà guyei loo, gè è maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>Wuzeɠe, zìi, wuzeɠe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">À wuzeɠe, nà-kɔnigi ta nà-papai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">Nà geelaalaosuʋɛ maaloɠa!<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>Nà è maamusɛ ziiti pɛ saama, ee, Màliɠii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">Nà guyei loo è ʋɛ zii ɠiligiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai wɔɔlɔʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɓudɛʋɛ tonaɓiingiti maazu.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 57:12"/>Ee, GALA, è wɔɔlɔ ʋelei lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi maazuʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:12">Ɗa-lɛbiyai volo eteai zu ná pɛ!<verse eid="PSA 57:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ná, <optbreak/> nii é eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋezu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Mina koloɠolo!» Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>Gaamazu, wa tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga maaɠɛkpɔgi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">58:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gaamazu, wa tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga maaɠɛkpɔgi?</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gaama ʋe ɓaa ga wɔi wo ga totuɠɔiti, wa telebodai ziɛzu?</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">Wa nuiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu nɛi ga sɔledai?<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Naa li poun! Wa telebotalai ɠɛɛzu ga kɛɛɠɛɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">Zooi zu, toomai ɠa wo fazasu ga wo-yeeiti.<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta yɛsu ti-lee ɠoozu ti ɠaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">zɛɛ nuiti ta ɓɔɠɔ ɠakasu, é zo ta ɠɛna zɔlɔɔga ti ʋa ɠula ti-lee ɠoozu,<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>ma wanai ɠa ti ʋa eɠɛ kaaliiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">ta woiyeɠei laaɠulusu eɠɛ pɛɛɠaalii goizuɓɔlɔai,<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>é la woiloga pote nuiti ta-wuye wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:6">anɛɛ nii gola ɠeleɠelegai.<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>GALA, ti-ɲiigaiti galeɠale ti-laaʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zala yiʋoiti kpalɔɠaeiti gale!<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>Niima nuiti ti ɲɛɛlɛ, eɠɛ ziɛiti ti yeizu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">É ná-mɛɛinti pili, ti mina faa ʋaa.<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>Eɠɛ koe goi é ʋoolozu, a ɠɛna lia luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">eɠɛ doin saai é ʋa leɠa zɔlɔɔ, ti la ɠaazulaani foloi ma.<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>Aisa wa-laaɠoli liɠiiti ti ʋa ɓadi ga dɔɓɔ ɠaingiti ma abui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">ti ma lɛnugi, ɓaa abui ti ʋa, GALA ka tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi zei faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui wu, é lii la!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">58:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛi zu, puuzu 10 wola la ɠoleni.</char></note><verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>Toɠa ga koozunɛ telebo nui ʋɛ, a faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti kaana ti ɗa zalai zɔlɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">Toɠa ɠɔɠɔiti maagba ti-ma ɲamai zu.<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 58:12"/>Nuɓusɛiti ta ɠɛ ma naazu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:12">«Ungo, telebo nui zalai ɠa ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:12">Ungo, GALA gila kana nii é tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu eteai zu!»<verse eid="PSA 58:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s">Nà-GALAGI, ùnmɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Mina koloɠolo!» Davide ná-guyei. Siɛgi zu Sayile ná-pɛlɛi maalatini da ga é ʋa paa.<verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>Nà-GALAGI, ùnmɔɔ, è kùla sìli nuiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">bùzeɠe, gàaɠooza naati ba, niiti ti wuzeɠezu dàalɔɠɔma!<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla naati zea, niiti ti telebotala vai ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">kìzo ɲama ʋuu nuiti ma!<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti ʋɛtɛ, ti lɔɔɠuai zɛ̀nvui ɠoloɠolo fai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">zobobɛ nuiti ta yaavai ɠilizu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">anɛɛ ni gè la ga tɔ koloɠolo nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">anɛɛ ni gè la koto ɠɛɛni, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>Anɛɛ ni gè la faaɠaaza gola ɠɛɛni, ta ɓizɛzu, ti ɗa ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">Wuzeɠe, ʋa è dàaɠomi, gwɛlɛi wo!<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">ɗɔun wuzeɠe, è zii ɠiligiti sakpe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">Mina nu ʋaa nui tɛiti, telebotala nuiti maawɔinɠa!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 59:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>Ta ʋaana ʋolu kpɔkɔi, ti ɓozɔ eɠɛ gilɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">ti taai maalati.<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>Wɛlɛ, poomugi ɠa ti-laaʋɛ, ti-lakɔlɔgiti ta ga boɠa zɔkpɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">ta ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa a woilo ade-woo ma?»<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ti ɲɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">ɗa ɲɛɛɠulazu zii ɠiligiti kpein su.<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>Ɗɛi è ga sɛ̀bɛi, è ʋɔ pelei ɠa gè wɛlɛzu ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">Ungo, GALA ka é mà ga siɠigi.<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>Nà-wooɠɛɠila ƓALAGI ɠa ʋa pɔ̀.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">Nà-GALAGI ɠa sìli nuiti kpein dɛɛ ga ze, pilɛgi zɔlɔɔgai na ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Mina ti ʋa, nà-nuɓusɛiti ta ʋa yeema naa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">kɛlɛ è-zɛbɛi ʋɔ, ti ɠɛ ga teʋeteʋe nu, è ti loka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">ɗɛi è ga gá-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi, Maliɠii!<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>Ti-laawooi kpein ka ga kotoi nɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">Ti ɠɔ ga tiya ɓɔɠɔi ta-waso balii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">ta-yɛɛiti kpein faa zu ta ta-voovooiti kpein.<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>Ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe, ɗa-yiiɠulagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe, ti mina mɔ ɠɛna!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">Toɠa ɠwɛɛ naazu ga GALA ka masadai ɠɛɛzu Izilayɛle unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">eyɛsu é zeeli eteai ɓela ga.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 59:14">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>Ta ʋaana ʋolu kpɔkɔi, ti ɓozɔ eɠɛ gilɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">ti taai maalati,<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>ti ziɛziɛ, ti ɗa ti-laamianigi ɠaiziɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">Ni ti la sɔlɔɔni, ti yɛ ná eyɛsu geelaalao.<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>Nɔ̀un nà, nà è-zɛbɛi maawuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">sobui, gè ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maamusɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa bɛ̀ ga siɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">ʋɛ gè lɔɔɠuzu ná kidaaʋili foloi.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 59:18"/>Ee, nà-zobogi, nà guyei loo è-laaseigi lɛbi vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:18">mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka ga nà-siɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:18">nà-GALAGI nii é wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛai bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 59:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sɛbɛi zu, <optbreak/> gá pilɛ sɔlɔɔ nɔ fai pɛ su</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Bulɛgi ma ʋuaiti». Zeele wooi. Davide ná-guyei, kalagi wosu da. <verse eid="PSA 60:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Siɛgi zu é kɔɔi ʋɛɛni la Siili yooi zu nuiti ba, niiti ti Mezopotami, ta Soɓa. Zoaɓe ɠalesuʋɛ ma, é Edɔme nu waapuugɔ maazu felegɔ (12.000) ʋaani Kpolo Ʋɛtugi zu.<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>Ee, GALA, è ɠɛlɛa gi ʋa, è gá-ɠɔɔi ɠoloɠologa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">È ɗa-yiiɠaawanai ɠula kɛlɛma, niizu, gi ɓɛtɛna ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>È eteai ɲiikpiga, è bali ga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">Galeɠalezuʋɛti kpɛtɛ, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɲiikpisu.<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>È ʋoluɠula vaa ɓaa golaiti seiɗa ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">è gaazulati dɔɔi loga gi-la.<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>È poo gila fea nuiti zea, niiti ti luazu è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">ti ʋa ʋela ti zili nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔi ʋa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ti ʋa ʋela ti zili nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔi ʋa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">é ɠɛ ga gaamai ná-kulanumai</char></note></para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 60:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>Gi unmɔɔ ga è-yeezai, gi wooɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">naa ɠa a kɛ è nɛɛbɛ nuiti ti unmɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>GALA ge ɓɔɛni seizu ɲadegai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">seizu ɲadegai</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ná-ɲadedai zu</char></note> é ɠɛ ma: «Pilɛ sɔlɔɔ nui ɠa é ga ze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">Nà Sikɛme ɠaaɠwɛ su, gè Sukɔte nɛmɛi ɠaaɠwɛ.<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>Galaade ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ, Manasé ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Efelayime ɠa ga kɔɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔgi ùnba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Zuda ɠa ga nà-masa tukpɔi.<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>Moaɓe ɠa ga kokoi, nii gè maagbazu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">nà-saʋala pilisuʋɛ ɠa ga Edɔme yooi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">Nà pilɛ sɔlɔɔ kpeei loozu Filisiti nuiti ta-yooi laalɔɠɔma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nà pilɛ sɔlɔɔ kpeei loozu Filisiti nuiti ta-yooi laalɔɠɔma</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Filisiti nuiti ta zɔngɔzu mà</char></note><verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a li ga ze taa wolai zu, nii siɠigi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">Ɓɛ ɠa a li ga ze Edɔme?<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa laade ɓaa, è ɠɛa ɠɛlɛni gi ʋa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">Ee, GALA, siɛgi zu gá-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠulazu la, è la mɔ ɠɛni ʋilɛsu ti ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 60:13"/>Ɓɔ gi ʋa gi zili nuiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:13">mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛiti ta-ɓɔbai ɠa nɔ ga wafuun faa.<verse eid="PSA 60:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 60:14"/>Ni GALA ka ade ʋa, ada pilɛ sɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:14">mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é ade zili nuiti dɛɛvɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 60:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s">Dɔ̀ɔɠu è-ɠoʋegiti bu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu ga kɔnigiti. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>Ee, GALA, woilo nà-kpee wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">ɠida nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi wu!<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>Eteai ɠwɛmaʋɛ ɠa gè wooɠulazu ná è ma, zìiɓɔlɔʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">Lɛ ga ze fasa ɠaaɠoozagi ma, nii gè la zooga gè ʋa zeeli ma ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ga nɔ̀un dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">pɛlɛ ɠaaɠoozagi siɠigi ma, sìli nui ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>Nà pɔ gè zei ɗa-zeɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, gè yɛ ná ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">gè lɔɔɠu è-ɠoʋegiti bu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 61:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA, ɗa ɠa è woilosu nà-minazeɠe gooiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">è poganii ve zèa, nii è feezu naati zea, niiti ti luazu è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>Gá-masagi zii ma voloiti suɠooza, è ta ɓɔ ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">ná-konagiti suɠooza yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su!<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>É yɛ zeini GALA kakala, eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">Va bu, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ta ɗa-ɠaamai, naati ti ɓaa tɔun maazu.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 61:9"/>Ungo, nà guyei loozu yeenɔpɛ è-laaseigi lɛbi vai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:9">gè nà-minazeɠegiti daazeeli folo-o-folo.<verse eid="PSA 61:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s">Ni nà GALA zea, zìilɛiʋɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Eɠɛʋelei Yedutun la. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>GALA gila kpegi ʋɔ bɛ ɠa nà ziilɛigi zɔlɔɔ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">tɔ ɠa nà-kizo fai zea.<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>Tɔ ɠila kpegi ɠa é bɛ̀ ga fasai ta kizogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">nà-siɠigi, gè la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Yeeɠɛɠala lielegɔ ɠa wo kɛɛzu, wo ɗa ɠili ɓɔɠɔ ʋa zunu ɠilagi laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">nii a kɛ wo golo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">eɠɛ siɠigi maalaai na, ɓaa eɠɛ sasai é loozu niina?<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>Ti deveiti boga ga ti too, ti kula tosu wolai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">Zɛɛi nɛɛʋɛ ti ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">ta tuyai loozu ga ti-laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">ti ɗa foovooi loo ti-ɠoozuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 62:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>GALA gila kpegi ʋɔ bɛ ɠa nà ziilɛigi zɔlɔɔ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é ga nà-kitogi.<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>Tɔ ɠila kpegi ɠa é bɛ̀ ga fasai ta kizogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">nà-siɠigi, gè la ɓunɛga pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>Nà-kizogi, nà-lɛbiyai, ti kpein sɛlɛgɛ GALA ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">Nà-fasai é màkɛsu, dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ, toɠa ga GALA.<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Nuɓusɛiti, à ɠaliva tɔun ma yeenɔpɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">À wo-yiiti daalao tɔun bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">GALA ka é ga ade-lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 62:9">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>Ungo, Adama leaiti ta nɔ ga fiilɛi é leʋesu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">Nuiti kpein ti ɓɔ su, ta nɔ ga gaaʋɛ nua.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">Ɗa ti pɛ seina kiloi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">fiilɛi wuiʋɛ ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>Mina ʋilɛ toomai ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">Mina ɠito naavoloiti ba, niiti ti zɔlɔɔ pelei ɲɔuɗai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">Ni è-zɔlɔɔgi ɠaa a wɔɔlɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">mina kɛ ga ɗa-ɠitogi.<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>GALA ge faa ɠila boni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">é lati, é bo ʋolu, gè mɛnini, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">«Zobogi ɠa ga GALA nɔnɔ.»<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 62:13"/>Ɗa ɓalaagi, Màliɠii, wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa ga ɗɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:13">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ɛsɛ gilagilagi zalai veezu zea, eɠɛʋelei ná-kɛɛwotiiti ti la.<verse eid="PSA 62:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s">Ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai vizɔgɛ zɛnvui ʋa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>Davide ná-guyei. Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la Zuda yooi zu teʋebai zu.<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa ga nà-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">Nà è ɠaiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">è wɔin ɠa zìi ma eɠɛ kpɔɔle wɔin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">kpùsɛi ɠa ɓalasu ga ɗa-vaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">eɠɛ zou vɔɔi, ná vɔai, ziɛ la ná.<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>Zekana gè è ɠaazu la è-zeizu ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">gè ɗa wɛlɛ è-zɛbɛi ta ɗa-lɛbiyai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai vizɔgɛ zɛnvui ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">dàkɔlɔgiti ta è maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà è mama sìi ma voloi pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">gè zèeiti tɛ geezu è-laaseigi zu.<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>Nà anii pɛ sɔlɔɔ é kula ɠɛ, eɠɛ ma wulɔi ta ma ɓɔlɔgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">nà wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi, gè guyeiti too, gè è maamusɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>Siɛgi zu kìgi loozu la è zu, dàazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">nà ɗa ɠigaiziɛ è zu kpidii ma yeeɠɛɠalai kpein su.<verse eid="PSA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ga nà-kpɔba nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">nà guyei loozu ga koozunɛɛi, è-ɠoʋegiti ma niinigi wu.<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>Gìliʋɛ è ʋa ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">è-yeezai ɠa é ɓaazu màazu.<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Kɛlɛ niiti wɔin ti ma ga ti zɛ̀nvui ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">naati ta yei zooi ma yeɠezaɠai ɓomaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>Ta ti ʋaa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">ti ɠɛ ga koʋeiti daamianigi,<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 63:12"/>masagi ɠa ɠoozunɛ ga GALA maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:12">nu-o-nu nii a minazeɠe ná-faa zu, naa ɠa ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ naazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:12">Kɛlɛ naazu zɛɛ wo nuiti gaa ɠa lɛi, ti laaɠulu.<verse eid="PSA 63:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s">Makɛ mà!</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Ee, GALA, woilo gòoi ma, siɛgi zu gè kpalagi wosu da!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">Zɛ̀nvui makɛ sìli nuiti daalɔɠɔma, gè luazu ti ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>Kìzo nu ɲɔiti daayaavai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">ta naati ta-woya vaiti ma, niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>Ta ti-nɛgi ɠaalizu eɠɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">ta nu maawana ɓɔɛiti bosu, eɠɛ mɛɛinti ti ʋilisu,<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>é ʋilisu dɔɔɠuzu telebo nui ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">Ta pilisu ma ga kulafilibai, inɛinɛ ge la ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>Ta ɓɔɠɔ zasulɔɔzu kpɔɛ ɲɔu wogaiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">ta bosu ga ti baliiti da, ti maalɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa a ti ɠa?»<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>Ti ɗa yaavaiti kpɛtɛ, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">«Wɛlɛ, ade ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛa, ada-vaa ɓɛtɛi zolooga su!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">Ungo, kigaiziɛi, nu zii ɠa ga zeɠezaɠai.<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ka mɛɛin ʋilisu ti ma ga kulafilibai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">tiya ɠana ti zuloɠaai.<verse eid="PSA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>Ti-nɛgi ɠa é ti ɓunɛgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">Nuiti ta ti ʋɛtɛna, ti ɗa ɠɔmɔɔni ga tiye.<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>Dualuagi nuɓusɛiti kpein sogɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">ta GALA ná-kɛɛwotii ɠulazu kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">ti ná-kɛɛwotiiti gaaɠa.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 64:11"/>Telebo nui ɠa ɠoozunɛɛzu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-fai zu, é lɔɔɠu pɔ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:11">Niiti dɔin ti-yii zɔlegai, naati ta ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka anii pɛ feezu ade ya ga bɔɔlɔa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei. Guyei.<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>Gá-maaɠɛkpɔgi gi bosu maaɓɔungi zu, ɗɔun è letemazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">naa ɠa ga maamusɛi, gi feezu è ʋɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gá-maaɠɛkpɔgi gi bosu maaɓɔungi zu, ɗɔun è letemazu, naa ɠa ga maamusɛi, gi feezu è ʋɛ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">È letema, maaɠɛkpɔgi ɠa ga maamusɛi</char></note> ee, GALA, Siyɔn taazuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">Gɔun, gá gá-minazeɠegiti daazeeli, nii gi kɛɛni è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>Ɗɛi è maanɛɛnɛ wooi mɛnisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">nuiti kpein ta ʋa è ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>Kotoi ma ɠasɔi wuiʋɛ mà, gola wuiʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">kɛlɛ ɗa gá-lɔ koloɠologi kpein gbazu, è ti zuvaayɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii è yiimazeɠezu la, è maaɓuɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">ga é yɛ è zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">Gá yiɠo ga ɗa-ʋɛlɛwuʋɛ ma undaanɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">ta ɗa-ʋɛlɛi ná-ɲadedai.<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>GALA gi Ɠizo Nui, ɗa-lelebodai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">ɗa gi wooɠaaʋotesu ga laavɔɔ ɠɛɛwotiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">ɗɛi è ga nuɓusɛiti kpein ta-ɠitogi zou ɓela ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">ziɛ zaama yooiti su, ti maaɠoozaai.<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>É gizeiti togɛ kpaan ga ná-zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">é ɓɔɠɔ maaɠiliʋɛ ga zobogi.<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>Toɠa kpoloɗɛiti sulu gooiti gaaɓɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">ta ti-ma lakpatakpagiti tugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">ta nuɓusɛiti sɔngɔ wooiti.<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>Niiti ti zeini zou ɓela ga, naati daavɔɔʋɛ, ti ɗa lua, ga ɗa-ʋoogiti kaa vai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">ɗa folo ɠulazu ta folo liizu laavesu ga koozunɛ wooiti.<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>Ɗa eteai zɛsɛbosu, è kɔ ga bɔɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">è sulaave ga kulanumai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">GALA ná-laasamagi laavegɛ ga ziɛi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">Ɗa moloi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu nuiti bɛ, zooi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>Ɗa ziɛi ʋuuzu ma ɓabiiti su ga bɔɔlɔa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">È pɔlɔ ɓuiti golowolo, gaanɛmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">è zɛɓɛ ga tonaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">è tuya loo pɔnɔ ganiiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>È konagi maaɠiliʋɛ ga ɗa-vaanɛɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">ʋɛ dɔin è leʋeni ná, zooi wulɔʋɛ ná pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Anɛɛ dɔɓɔ zaama lufaiti ta ziɛi wola zɔlɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">gizeiti ti zaamaɠilia ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 65:14"/>Toganiiti ta ʋɛɛni tufa lɛnugi zu mɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:14">molo lufai nɛmɛiti suɓidia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:14">ti pɛ ta guyei loozu, ti ta-ɠoozunɛɛi ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 65:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s">Mamagi ɠa GALA bɛ, nii é gi unmɔɔni</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 66:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:1">À wooɠula GALA ma ga koozunɛɛi, wo kpein, wɔi wo zeini eteai zu!<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>À daaseigi ná-lɛbiyai maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">À lɛbiyai ve bɛ ga wa-maamusɛiti!<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>À ɠɛ GALA ma: «Ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti maayikiʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">Ɗa-zobogi nii ɓela ge la ba, naa maaʋele ma, è zili nuiti ta nɔkɔ è wu.<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>Eteai pɛ ka nɔkɔ è wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">ti guyei loo è lɛbi vai ma, ga ti ɗa-lɛbiyai maamusɛ.»</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>À ʋa wo GALA ná-kɛɛwotiiti pɛtɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">Ti maayikiʋɛ niiti é ti ɠɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>É kpoloɗɛi valiboni, é kɛ ga zou vɔɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">ti ziɛ wolai ɓudɛni ɠɔɠɔa, kpaaɠɔ la maazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">Miná ɠa gi ɠoozunɛɛni ná ga tɔun maaʋele.<verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>Toɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu eyɛsu ɠɔ ná-zɛbɛi ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">gaazuʋɛ ɠa wɛlɛzu ziiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">kololala nuiti ti mina mɔ wuzeɠe pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Nuɓusɛiti, à gá-ƓALAGI mama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">à wooɠula ga maamusɛ vai!<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>Gá vulua tɔun saalai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">é gi makɛ, gi mina loo.<verse eid="PSA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>Ee, GALA, è gi ʋoluɠulani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">È gi ʋoluɠulani, eɠɛʋelei ta ɗa walii ʋoluɠula la.<verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>Gi ɠɛni è ya tumɔi zu, è ɗa ʋa ga giye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">è kasɔ wuigi laani gi-ɓokpozuʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>è zobogi veeni gi zili nui ʋɛ, é zei gi unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">gi leʋeni abui zu ta ziɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">kɛlɛ è gi ɠulani ti zu, è kulagaanɛɛzui ve gi ya.<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>Nà liizu ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu ga gala zalaɠaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">nà nà-minazeɠegiti daazeeli è ʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>niiti dàkɔlɔgiti ti ti woni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:14">dàaʋɛ boni nà-kidaaʋiligiti su.<verse eid="PSA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>Nà gala zalaɠaiti kula è ʋɛ, ti wulɔai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">baala sinɛ wolaiti ta ti ɠala luului.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">Nà nikɛ zinɛiti kula ga zalaɠai, é ɓɔ boliiti ba.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:15">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>À ʋa wo woilo, wɔiti kpein wo luazu GALA ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">nà naa wosu wo ma, nii é kɛa nɔ̀un bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>Gè wooɠulani ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">ná-maamusɛi ɠɛni dàaʋɛ nɛ̀gi ma.<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>Ni gè ɠɛni faa ɲɔi makɛni zìimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">Màliɠii la ɠɛni woiloga gòo ma.<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ, GALA ge woiloni gòoi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">é woiloni nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>Mamagi ɠa GALA bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">mazɔlɔɔ é la ɠɛlɛni nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">é la ná-wooɠɛɠiladai maaɠoozani bà!<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s">Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti GALA maamusɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu ga kɔnigiti. Guyei.<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>GALA ge undaanɛɛi ɠɛ ade ʋɛ, é tuya loo ade ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">é yeezei ade wu ga pagɔ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 67:2">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>Naa ɠa a kɛ, ti ɗa-ʋelei ɠwɛɛ eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">ta ɗa-ɠizo fai ziiti kpein saama.<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti è maamusɛ, ee, GALA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti è maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>Ziiti ti ta-ɠoozunɛ wuyeiti too è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa nuɓusɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu ga sɔledai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">ɗa losu ziiti untuɠɔ eteai zu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 67:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti è maamusɛ, ee, GALA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti è maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Zooi ná-kulanumaiti feeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">GALAGI, ada-ƓALAGI ɠa tuya loozu ade ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 67:8"/>GALA ge tuya loo ade ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:8">zou ɓela ga ɲɛgɛlɛin ti lua é ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 67:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s">Pilɛ sɔlɔɔ GALAGI ná-maamusɛi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei. Guyei.<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>GALA ge wuzeɠe, sili nuiti ti vaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">niiti ti maayoseɠezu, naati ti ʋela ba.<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>Ʋelei abu luului a ɗa ɲɛɛlɛ la, ɗa ti ɲɛɛlɛ ɠana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">eɠɛʋelei kedoi ɠaa a ɗa wuun da abui ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">ʋele ɠana faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti undaaʋilisu da GALA gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>Naazu telebo nuiti ta ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">ti wola ɠoozunɛ gola GALA gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">ta kpeei loozu ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>À guyei loo GALA bɛ! À maamusɛ ga wa-wuye wooiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">À pelei la naa ʋɛ, nii é zeini tonaɓiingi ɠɔma eɠɛ sooi, é ɗa ziɛ la!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">Daasei ka ga «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI». À ɠoozunɛ tɔun gaazu!<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>Tɔ ɠa é ga podointi ti-ɠɛɛ, poanzaiti maalobo nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">tɔ ɠa é ga GALA, ná-ada ɲadegai.<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>GALA ka ɗa pɛlɛyeɠei ve gilɛ nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">é ɓɔɠɔyeemalai ma ɠoozunɛɛi ve kasoɠa nuiti zea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">Kɛlɛ kololala nuiti nɔ ɠa, ta ɗa yɛ ada vɔɔiti.<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>GALA, siɛgi zu è ɠɛni losu da ɗa-nuɓusɛiti untuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">siɛgi zu è ɠɛni ziɛzu la teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:8">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>zooi ɓalini, geeɠɔlɔgi ɠaawuunni, é ɠɛ ga ziɛi, GALA gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">Sinayi gizei ná-GALAGI, GALAGI ɠakala, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>Ee, GALA, è ɗa-vaanɛɛ lonai ʋuuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">Ɗa-yooi nii gaaʋalani ba, è naa ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta zeini ná, ʋɛ è ti zeini ná ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">ee, GALA, è naa ɓɛtɛni maanɔɠɔ nui ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>Maliɠii woo ɠila boni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">gaamago nɔ, woo niinɛ ʋagɔi ma ɠeelaiti ti ɠɛni ga kɔɔʋɛbɛ wolai,<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>kɔɔʋɛbɛiti ta-masagiti ti ʋela, ti ʋela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">anzanuiti ti yɛni taazuʋɛ, naati ka ti aniiti gaaɠwɛɛni, niiti ti zogai kɔɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Wa yɛsu nɔ laani togani ɠotai wu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">68:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">togani ɠotai wu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kɔɔlaaɠai zu</char></note> wo ɗa looɠo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">Poopogi ɠoʋegiti ti ɠolea ga walii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">maaleɠai é ga bazii, naa ɠɛa ga zanugi.<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>Siɛgi zu GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii masagiti suvazani da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:15">kɔɔlɛ vukɔi ʋɛɛni Salamon gizei ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>Ɓasan ɠizei, ɠa ga maaɲɛɛba ɠizei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Gizei nii nɔungi mɔinɗai, Ɓasan ɠizei,<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>leeni vaa zu, gizei, ɗɛi ɗɔungiti mɔinɗai, è toloi ɠulazu ga gizei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">nii nɛai GALA bɛ ga é zei ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa kɛɛzu ga seizuʋɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>GALA ná-kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti ta ga waa mɔinmɔingiti, nu la zooga é ʋa ti ɠaalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">Maliɠii ɠa ti zaama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">Sinayi ƓALAGI ɠa seizu ɲadegai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">68:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maliɠii ɠa ti zaama. Sinayi ƓALAGI ɠa seizu ɲadegai</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠiligaa ɓalaa ka ga niiti: </char><char style="fqa">Maliɠii ɠa ti zaama, Sinayi ɠizei ma, seizu ɲadegai zu</char> ɓaa <char style="fqa" closed="false">Maliɠii ɠa ti zaama, Sinayi ɠizei ɠɛ seizu ɲadegai zu</char></note><verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>È lɛɛni naa maazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">è ʋa ná ɠɛ ga è-zeizuʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">È liini ga kɔɔ luɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">è vebɛaniiti seɠe nuɓusɛiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">anɛɛ kololala nuiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>Mamagi ɠa Maliɠii ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">toɠa gi zeɠezu ga ɠasɔ, folo-o-folo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">Naama ƓALAGI tɔna ka é ga gá-ɠizogi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:20">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>Naama ƓALAGI ɠa é gi ʋɛ ga kizo GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Maliɠii, toɠa zobogi bɛ é gi ɠizo saai ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>GALA ka sili nuiti tɔungi wolowolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">zɔi siɛ ʋelei ɲɔuɗai, toɠa naa nɔundeɠai yɛ nɔunkalagi ma é golowolo.<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: «Nà ʋaazu ga tiye, gè zeɠe ga tiye Ɓasan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">gè ʋa ga tiye ti zeɠe kpoloɗɛi wuʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, è è-ɠɔɠɔi maagba ɲamai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">ɗa-ɠilɛiti ta tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ, è zili nuiti ma ɲamai zu.»<verse eid="PSA 68:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Nuiti ta ɗa-ʋɛbɛi ziɛzuʋɛ ɠaazu, ee, GALA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">nà-GALAGI, ɗa-ʋɛbɛi ziɛzuʋɛ, nà-masagi, ɗa-ʋɛbɛi ɗa ziɛ, é ɗa li seizu ɲadegai.<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Guye loo nuiti ta loni ti untuɠɔ, naa ʋolu, niiti ti gɛingɛin ganigiti gɛinsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">zaamazuʋɛ ɠa anzalopoiti ti loni ná, tamadegiti ti ti ya, ti ɗa gɛin.<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>Ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «À GALA mama wa-ɠaalɛbaiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama, wɔiti wo ɠulaai Izilayɛle ma zuwui zu!»<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>Wɛlɛ Ɓɛnzamɛn ʋa, nii dɔiɗai ti zaama, é loni ti untuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">naa ʋoluma Zuda wolodamai ma ɠundiɠiiti, ti maaɠiliai ta-zeɠe zuʋuaiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">naa ʋoluma Zaɓulɔn nɔnɔ ma ɠundiɠiiti, é ɓɔ Nɛfɛtali nɔnɔiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>Ɗa-ƓALAGI devea ga é zobogi ve è ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">È zɛbɛi naa wɔɔlɔ, nii è kɛa gi ʋɛ, ee, GALA!<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>È zei ʋɛlɛi nii é zɛlɛni Zeluzalɛme maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">masagiti ta ʋa miná ga vebɛaniiti è ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>Zelii lo seeligi zu zuai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">ta nikɛ zinɛ ɓulugi, é ɓɔ nuɓusɛiti ta-nikɛ yiʋoiti ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Ta ʋaazu ti nɔkɔ è wu ga ta-wali ɠaeiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Ʋa è niima nuɓusɛiti suvaza, tɛiti kpein kɔɔ vai nɛai ti ʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Nu wolaiti ta ʋaazu, ti zeɠe Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">Etiyopi nuiti ta ɓizɛzu, ti ʋa GALA pɔ bɛ, ti yeemaale tɔun ma.<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>Etea masadai zu nuɓusɛiti kpein, à guyei loo GALA bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">à guyei loo Maliɠii wɔɔlɔ vaa ma.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:33">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>À guyei loo naa ʋɛ, nii é zeini geeɠɔlɔgi ɠɔma eɠɛ sooi, é ɗa ziɛ geeɠɔlɔ pɔlɔmai maazuʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">Wɛlɛ, toɠa wooɠulazu, gooi ɠaaɓaingai.<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>À GALA ná-zobodai zuɠwɛɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Ná-bɔɔlɔlai ɠa volozu Izilayɛle maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">ná-zobogi ɠa ɠulazu kɛlɛma tonaɓiingi zu.<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 68:36"/>Ee, GALA, è maayikiʋɛ è-zeizu ɲadegai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">Tɔ ɠa é ga Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">é zɛbɛi ta zobogi veezu nuɓusɛiti zea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:36">Mamagi ɠa GALA bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 68:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s">Màaɓɔlea, kìzo</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Bulɛgi ma ʋuaiti».<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>Kìzo, ee, GALA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">Ziɛi sòga kɔ̀daʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>Gè ɠataga palaʋalai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">kɔ̀ɠɔ losu nɔpɛ ge la bɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">Wɛlɛ, nɔ̀un gè yeiɗa ziɛi ɓomaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">ziɛ veinfeingi màaɓɔlega.<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>Gè ɓɔlɔa ga kpee looi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">kɔ̀da yeɠei ɠaawana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">gàazuɠɛzɛiti ti ɓɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">ga nà-GALAGI maaɓɔun fai.<verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu un ge la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">naati mɔinʋɛ, ti leʋe ùnma undeɠai liegɔi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">Ti-zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ, tɛiti ti pɔ ga ti kòloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">ti ga sìli nuiti un ge la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">nii gè la unmani, kɛni gè naa ʋotogi ve.<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>Ee, GALA, è nà-ɠimalalai ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">ta nà-kɛɛwoti ɲɔiti ti la lɔɔɠuni è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Niiti ti ɠitogai è ʋa, naati ti mina unfe nɔ̀un maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">Niiti ti è ɠaiziɛzu, naati ti mina unfe nɔ̀un maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>Ɗa-vaa ɠa é kɛɛzu gè ɓaaɠulamai zuzosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">ta unfegi lɔɔzu gàazu.<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>Gè ɠɛa ga wɛɛn kɛ̀ɛleaiti gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">gè ɠɛ ga nui é la ɠwɛɛni pɛlɛyeɠei wu.<verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi ma wɔinlai ɠa gàlazu eɠɛ abui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">È ʋoomu nuiti ta-ʋoomugiti ti zeelia mà.<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>Gè wɔlɔni ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ, gè zugi zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">naa ɠɛa zèa ga ɓaaɠulamai.<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>Gè saa wɔlɔ wo seɠei loa ɠɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">gè ɠɛa tiya ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii.<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>Ta zeizu kpɔgi zu, ti ɗa sùɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">dɔɔ ɓɔle nuiti ti ɗa dàalɔɔ guyei zu.<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà, nà nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi laazeelizu è ma, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">É ɠɛ ga siɛgi nii soloogai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">ee, GALA, gòoɠaaʋote ɗa-wooɠɛɠilada wolai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">è kìzo ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma!<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla palaʋalai zu, gè mina mɔ yei su ʋolu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla naati zea, niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">kùla pali ɓomaʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>Ziɛ veinfeingi mina màaɓɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">zeɠezaɠa ɓokulagi mina màalɔɔɠu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">Kabayeɠei laa mina ɠulu mà!<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>Gòoɠaaʋote, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mazɔlɔɔ è ʋagɛ ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">Ɗa-maawɔinɠaa wolai zu, lati nɔ̀un ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>Mina ʋoluave bà, nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ zunui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">Nà-kidaaʋiligi zu, gòoɠaaʋote fala!<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Maaɓuɠa bà, è ùnmɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">Nɔ̀un fie, sìli nuiti maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>È nà-ɓaaɠulamai ɠwɛɛ, ta nà-unfegi, ta nà-bɛlɛʋiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu, ta loni è ɠakala.<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>Ɓaaɠulamai ɠa zìi ɓɔlɔzu, gè la ziɛzu bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">kìtogɛ maawɔinɠai ʋa tètema, kɛlɛ nà-maaɓɔungi ɠɛa ga wafuun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">Nà gaanɛɛnɛ nu ɠaiziɛzu, kɛlɛ gè la nu zɔlɔɔsu.<verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>Ta anivebɛi ʋuuzu nà-daamianigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">kpɔɔle wɔin a ɠɛna mà, ti dɔɔ ɓodai ve, è lo dà.<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Ta-laami maaɓɔgi ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga balii, ti ɠɔɔ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">ti-zɔlɔɔ ganii ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga balii!<verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>Ti-ɠaazuʋɛ ɓidi, ti mina wozaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">è ti-zaamaʋɛ ɓili eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>Ɗa-yiiɠulagi yei ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">ɗa-yiiɠaawana wolai ti mazɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>Ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">ti ʋala nuɓusɛiti ma ti-zeizuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ta ʋilɛsu naa ʋolu, nii ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è doɠaai na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">ta naati ta-maanɔɠɔ vai zuɠulazu, niiti è ti maawanaai niina.<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>Ta-vaaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi la ti unma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">ti mina lɔɔzu zɔlɔɔ ɗa-lelebodai zu.<verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>Ti-laaseigi ɓale, é ɠula zɛnvu zɛʋɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">ti-laaseigi mina zɛʋɛ ʋɔɔma ta telebo nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>Nɔ̀un, màanɔɠɔʋɛ, gè ɗa zoolɛ ga ɓɔɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">ee, GALA, ɗa-ɠizo fai bùzeɠe!<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>Nà GALA daaseigi mama ga guyei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">nà bɔɔlɔ, nà ɠɛna maamusɛa,<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>naa nɛɛʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é leʋe nikɛ zinɛi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">anɛɛ nikɛ zinɛ wolai nii minɛiti ti ba, ta polokagiti.<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ta naa ɠa, ti ɠoozunɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">Ungo, wɔi wo GALA gaiziɛzu, zɛnvui ve wo ya.<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa woilo bala nuiti gooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">wooɠɛɠila nuiti ti ga ná-nuiti, é la ɗa ga naati ta-vai ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛga, ni ta ɠɛna kasoi ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ti maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">ta kpoloɗɛi ta niiti kpein ti bu.<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka ʋaazu é Siyɔn taai ɠizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">toɠa Zuda laa wolaiti to ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">Ná-nuɓusɛiti ta zei ná, ná ɠɛ ga tɔnɔ,<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 69:37"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti-mavofodai ɠa ná zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:37">niiti nɛai ti ʋɛ, naati ta ná ɠɛ ga ti-zeizuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s">GALA, ʋa è ɓɔ bà</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei, é ɠɛ ga ɠizɛsui.<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Ee, GALA, soma è ùnmɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, suvilɛ, è ɓɔ bà!<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Unfegi ti maaɓɔle, ti wooi zupu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">tɛiti ti pɔ ti zɛ̀nvui ɠula zèa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">Ti li ga ʋoluʋelei, ti unfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">tɛiti kpein ti wɔinɗai ga màanɔɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>Niiti ti ɲɛɛɠulazu nɔ̀un su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">ti ɠula ʋolu, ta-unfe kasɔi la ti unma!<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>Niiti dɔin ti è ɠaiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">ti ɠaazuɠalakala, ti ɠoozunɛ è ʋɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Niiti ɗa-ɠizo fai nɛai ti ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">ti ɠɛ ma yeenɔpɛ: «Lɛbiyai ɠa GALA bɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 70:6"/>Nɔ̀un nà, màanɔɠɔʋɛ, gè ɠɛ ga bala nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:6">ee, GALA, ʋa kòba fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:6">ɗa ga nà-kpɔba nui, ta ùnmɔɔ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:6">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mina nɛkɛ!<verse eid="PSA 70:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s">Mina yeeɓe nɔ̀un ba pɔlɔzaɠa siɛgi zu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa gè lɔɔɠuzu è ʋoluʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">màkɛ eyɛsu pɛ, gè mina lɔ unfegi zu.<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>Ɗa-lelebodai zu, ùnmɔɔ, è fìe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">Woilo gòoi ma, è kìzo!<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>Ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga fasai, nii é bɛ̀ ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">è devei veeni zèa, ga gè ʋa ná yeenɔpɛ, nii a kɛ gè ɠizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ga nà-fasai ta nà-siɠigi.<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>Ee, nà-GALAGI, kìzo nu ɲɔi yeei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">ta telebotala nui, nii zii ɲɔuɗai.<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Màliɠii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è ga nà-kitogi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">Nà-kitogi ɠa ga ɗe, é zo nà-doungo ziɛgi zu ma,<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>kaite dèe ɠoozu gè ʋoluzeini è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">kaipa gè zɔlɔɔni, ɗa makɛsu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">yeenɔpɛ nà-maamusɛi ma ungi ɠa ga ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>Nà nui ma mɔinmɔin gaazu ga laavɔɔ anii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">dɔɔɠuzu ɠitei ɠa é ga ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>Dàaʋɛ laave ga ɗa-maamusɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:8">folo-o-folo é ɗa ɗa-lɛbiyai ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>Mina pìli ya pɔ̀lɔzaɠa siɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">siɛgi zu sɛ̀bɛiti ti ɠulazu la zèa, mina ɠɛlɛ bà!<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nɔ̀un sili nuiti ta sùɠulazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">ta nɔ̀un gaaʋɛɛnɛsu zɛ̀nvui vaa zu, ta ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu,<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «GALA ge ɠɛlɛa ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">à ʋilɛ polu, à so!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">Nu nɔpɛ ge la fiega.»<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>Ee, GALA, mina maaɠooza nɔ̀un ba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">Nà-GALAGI, ʋa ga suvilɛ, è ɓɔ bà!<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Ti unfe, ti zuwuɠaaleʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">niiti ti pèelalazu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">Ɓaaɠulamai ta unfegi ti maaɓɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">tɛiti ti wɔinɗai ga nà-maanɔɠɔ vai!<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>Nɔ̀un nà, kìgi logɛ è ʋa yeenɔpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">Nà yɛ è lɛbizu yeenɔpɛ nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>Dàaʋɛ ɠa ɗa-lelebo fai wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">ta ɗa-ɠizo fai folo-o-folo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">mazɔlɔɔ gè la ti-liegɔ ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>Nà liizu ga luɠɔʋelei, ɗa-vɔnifaamai ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">Màliɠii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">Nà ɗa-lelebodai ɠila kpe nɔ ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>Ee, GALA, è kàlani, é zo nà-doungo ziɛgi zu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">eyɛsu niizu, nà ɗa-vaa maanɛɛnɛgiti bosu.<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>Anɛɛ ɓalaa gè wɔlɔzaɠa pa, nɔ̀ungi ɠole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">ee, GALA, mina ɠɛlɛ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">naa ɠa a kɛ gè è-zɛbɛi ma vaiti bo niima ziɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">gè ɗa-ɠaaɓaai lɛ ga naati kpein, niiti ti ʋaazu.<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa-lelebogi ɠwɛ ge la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">è faa ʋagɔ wolaiti kɛɛni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">Ee, GALA, ɓɛ ɠa é ga è ɠɛʋele?<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>È ʋoluɠulai zeiʋɛ gi ma, ga kidaaʋiligiti ta maanɔɠɔiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">Kɛlɛ ɗa zɛnvui veezu gi ya ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">ɗa mɛ̀ɛn, è kùla zeɠezaɠai ɓomaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>Ɗa nà-unfemai ve zèa mɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">è gàanɛɛnɛ mɔnɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>Nɔ̀un, nà lati niina, gè è maamusɛ ga kɔnigi wooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma, nà-GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">Nà ɗa-lɛbiyai maamusɛ ga papai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">Izilayɛle ná-GALA Ɲadegai!<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>Dàkɔlɔgiti ta è maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">siɛgi zu gè guyei loozu la è lɛbi vai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ, nɛi è ùnmɔɔgai.<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>Folo-o-folo, nɛ̀gi ɠa ɠɛ ɗa-lelebo fai wosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">mazɔlɔɔ ti-ɠigi zupua, ti maaɓɔle ga unfegi, tɛiti wɔin ɠɛni ti ma ga ti màanɔɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s">GALA maanɛɛnɛi é wosu masagi ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>Salomɔn ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 72:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">Ee, GALA, fe masagi ʋɛ, é tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga è ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">ɗa-lelebodai ma ɠigi ve masagi tɛi zea.<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>Toɠa ɗa-nuɓusɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe ga telebodai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">ta sɔledai maanɔɠɔ nuiti tetema.<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Ziilɛigi yei é zeɠe gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">ta telebodai gize goiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">ti ɠɛ ga nuɓusɛiti pɛ tɔnɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>É sɔle fai ɠɛ maanɔɠɔ nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">é bala nuiti ti-lointi kizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">é naati kpɔlɔ nui wolowolo!<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>Ni nɔ foloi ɠa dɛ toozu, toɠa yɛ vulua,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">72:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">toɠa yɛ vulua</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai zu, naa ɠa ga: </char><char style="fqa">ta lua è ʋa</char>.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">ni nɔ alugi ɠa dɛ volozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">eyɛsu yeeɠɛɠalaiti ti ɓe.<verse eid="PSA 72:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Masagi ɠa ɠɛ eɠɛ tonai é ʋuuzu wozawoliai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">eɠɛ duɓui é zooi yɛɓɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>Ná-foloiti su, telebodai ɠaa ɠa wɔɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">ziilɛigi zu ɠa wɔɔlɔ, ni nɔ dɛ alugi ɠa volozu.<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>Toɠa masadai ɠɛ é zo kpoloɗɛi ʋa, é zei kpoloɗɛi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">é zo ziɛ wolai Efelate ma, é li zou ɓela ga.<verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Nuiti ti zeini teʋebai zu, naati ta ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa, ti nɔkɔ bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">sili nuiti ta fufiligi ɠɔmɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Taalasise masagiti ta ziɛ zaama yooiti ma masagiti ta ʋa pɔ bɛ ga maazoloo ganiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">Saɓa yooi ta Seɓa yooi ma masagiti ta ʋa pɔ bɛ ga ta-vebɛaniiti.<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>Masagiti kpein ta nɔkɔ bu, ti dɛbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">ziiti kpein ta ɠɛ ga ná-botiɠɛ nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa bala nui unmɔɔ, nii é kpɔba ɠaiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">ta maanɔɠɔ nui, nii kpɔba nu la bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>Toɠa zɛbɛsulala nuiti maawɔinɠa ta bala nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">toɠa bala nuiti zɛnvui ɠizo.<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>Toɠa ti unmɔɔ, é ti ɠula toomai ta maanɔɠɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">mazɔlɔɔ ti-yɛnvui ɠa vizɔ gaazu gola.<verse eid="PSA 72:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Masagi yɛnvui zuɠooza!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">Toɠa zanugi zɔlɔɔ, nii é ga Saɓa yooi zu gelei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">Nuiti ti GALA maanɛɛnɛ bɛ yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">ti ɗa tuyai lo bɛ yeenɔpɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Moloi ɠa ʋooʋa zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">moloi ɠa ʋɛɛ mɛɛ gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">su ɠa wɔɔlɔ eɠɛ Liɓan ɠizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">nuiti ta mɔin eɠɛ zooi zu lufaiti.<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>Daaseigi ɠa yɛ ná ɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Ni nɔ dɛ foloi ɠa toozu, tɔɠɔi ɠa ɠula, maawoo ziɛ adaʋɛ pɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Siɛgi zu nuiti ti tuya loozu la ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ti ɠilagilagi, ta daaseigi wo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">Ziiti kpein eteai zu ta ɠɛ ma undaanɛ nui!<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">tɔ ɠila kpe ka a ɗa laavɔɔ vaiti kɛ!<verse eid="PSA 72:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>Eyɛsu ɠɔ, mamagi ɠa GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">é volozu, ná-lɛbiyai ma voloi eteai kpein sulaave!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Amina! Amina!<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Ʋɛ ɠa Izayi ná-doun zunui, Davide ná-maanɛɛnɛiti kwɛgai ná.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="ms1">Sɛʋɛi Zaʋasiɛi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 73-89">Guyeiti 73—89</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Leeni vaa zu <optbreak/> faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ zɔlɔɔsu?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>Azafe ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 73:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">Ungo, GALA pagɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">pagɛ naati bɛ, niiti ti-yiimaʋɛ ɠoleai.<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nɔ̀un nà, ná tago nɔ kɔ̀ɠɔiti ti ɠɛnina ɓunɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">ná tago nɔ te, gè ʋa loo,<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>mazɔlɔɔ gè ɠɛni toloi ɠulazu ga waso nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">gè nu ɲɔiti ta-zɔlɔɔgi ʋɛtɛgai ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kpɔlɔ la zeelizu ti ma, eyɛsu ti zaa voloi zeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">kɛdɛyai ɠa ti ya, ti lɔtɔai.<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>Kpɔlɔi nii é zeizu nuɓusɛiti ma, naa tanɔpɛ ge la zeizu ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">nimizai nu vuluiti ti sɔlɔɔsu, naa ta la zeizu ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ta ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilizu ga wasogi, é ɠɛ ti ɠɔbu ga yɔlɔɠɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">ti maaɠiliʋɛ ga toomai, eɠɛ tookɔbai kɔɠɔgai ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Ti-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠa volozu ga ti-ma wulɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">ti ɠoozu ɠisiɛ ɲɔi ɓela ge la ba.<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>Ta ɲɛɛɠulasui ɠɛɛzu, ti ɗa ɓɔɛ ga ɲɔuɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">nu nimiza vai zu, ta ɓɔɛzu ga gaazulɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>Ta laalosu geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɔɠɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">ti-laa la leʋesu faa nɔpɛ ba eteai zu.<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nuɓusɛiti ta ʋilɛsu ti ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">ti ɓɔɔle ga ti-laawooiti eɠɛ ziɛ,<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa GALA ge kwɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Zɔi é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ɠa kwɛɛ ɠale?»<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Ʋele ɠana faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">ti yiilɛiɗai yeenɔpɛ nɔ, ti ɗa naavoloi ɠaalɛ ba.<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Deɠɛmu fuun faa ɠa gè kɛɛni ga gè ɓɔɠɔ makɛ ladalai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">gè ɓɔɠɔ makɛ sɔbalalai zu nɔ fuun.<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>Nà kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔsu folo-o-folo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">nà maaɠoloi laawu sobu-o-sobu.<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Kɛlɛ ni gè deveni ga gè ɓɔɛ ga ti ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">nà la ɗa-nuɓusɛiti yaava.<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Gè tɔɔzeini ga ɠigaiziɛ, gè ɠidaani bu, ga gè gaaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">é ɠɛni gàazu ga faaɓaa gola.<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>Eyɛsu naama voloi, yeei gè lɛɛni la GALA seizu ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">miná ɠa gè ɠidaanina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti gaaɓelazuʋɛ wu.<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Gaamazu, ɗa ti ʋilɛsu pele zuɲagiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">ɗa ti laaʋilisu ti-undaaʋilisuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Ee, wɛlɛ, yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ laawu, é ɠɛa ga nimizai, ti loa ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">saai ma luabai ti ɠoloɠologa.<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>Eɠɛʋelei maaniinigiti ti la, niiti ti ɠaazu segi zu, ɗa wuunna ti ɲɛɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">ee, Màliɠii, siɛgi zu è wuzeɠezu la, ɗa ti kpein ɲɛɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>Siɛgi zu zìiɠaawanani la gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">gè ɗa ɓɔlɔ zìimaʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>gè ɠɛni ga ɠimalala nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">gè ɗa ziɛ è ʋolu, eɠɛ suai nii nɔungi la ná.<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nà è ʋa yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">è sògɛ zèezai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>Ɗa losu tùɠɔ è-yiimai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">naa ʋoluma, ɗa sèɠe, è li ga ze ɗa-lɛbiyai zu.<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>Ɓɛ ɠili ka é zèema geeɠɔlɔgi zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">É ɠula ɗɔun è ʋolu, zìima vaa ɠili nɔpɛ ge la ná eteai zu.<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>Anɛɛ ni kpùsɛi ɠa ɓɔlɔ, zìi ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">kɛlɛ GALA ka ga nà-fasai, zìi ʋoluzeiɗai ba, é ɠɛ ga nɔ̀nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wɛlɛ, niiti ti maaɠoozazu è ʋa, ti undaa ɠa ʋilisu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">Ɗa naati pɛ koloɠolo, niiti ti la ga wooɠɛɠila nu è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>Nɔ̀un nà, nà-undaanɛɛi ɠa é ga gè ɠɛ GALA kobaʋɛ yeenɔpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">Ungo, gè dɔɔɠuzu ɠiteɠitegi ɓɛtɛʋɛ, Màliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">naa ɠa a kɛ, nii kpein é kɛa, gè ɗa naati bo.<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s">Kpee wooi é lo <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠoloɠolo fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>Azafe ná-kidafaawui.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 74:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Leeni vaa zu, ee, GALA, è ɠɛlɛa gi ʋa ɠɔ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Leeni vaa zu, è yɛsu yiiɠaawanazu gi ma, gɛi gi ga baalagiti, è ga ti makɛ nui?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>Ɠizɛ ɗa-nuɓusɛiti su, niiti è ti zeɠeni ʋɛ kaite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">è ti unmɔɔ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, bolodai ʋe é ga ɗɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">ɠizɛ Siyɔn gizei zu, ʋɛ è ɠɛni ná ɠɛɛzu ga è-zeizuʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>Ʋa lɛɛ, è adaʋɛti pɛtɛ, ti ɠoloɠologai mɛtu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">È zili nuiti ti anii pɛ koloɠologa è-zeizu ɲadegai wu.<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>È zili nuiti ti zɔngɔni ɗa-ada ɲadegai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">ti poogi ʋilɛni ná, ga ta-vɔnifaamai ma ʋoogi.<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>Ti pɔgi woni ga ta-yoovɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:5">eɠɛ pɔ bea goyai zu.<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>Aniiti ti ʋɛlupɛlugai pɛlɛi wu, ti naati koloɠologa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">ga zoovɛi, ta maadalagiti.<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>Ti abui ʋiliga è-zeizu ɲadegai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">ti pu ya zooi ma, ti è-zeizuʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi ɠɔzɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>Ti ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ada ti pɛ koloɠolosu ʋɔɔma!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">Ti ada ɲadegaiti pɛ galaa zooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>Ɗa-ɠulakɛlɛmai ma ʋoo ge la mɔ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">GALA goo wo nu la mɔ ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">Nu nɔpɛ ge la gi zaama, nii é kwɛɛ ga niima vaiti ta yɛsu ɠɛɛzu, eyɛsu yeelɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>Ee, GALA, tooma nui ɠa yɛsu maaɲɛɛba ɓɔɛi wosu, eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">È zili nui ɠa yɛsu ɲɛɛɠulazu è-laaseigi zu, dooɠo ge la ba?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>Leeni vaa zu è ɓɔɠɔ zuzosu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Mina yɛ loni ɠana nɔ, ʋa è ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe!<verse eid="PSA 74:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ee, GALA, nà-Masagi, kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">ɗa ɠa è unmɔɔgi wosu eteai zu.<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>Ɗa ɠa è ziɛiti zeeɠaaɠwɛɛni su ga è-zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">è kpoloɗɛ wu zua wolai nɔungiti golowoloni, ziɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>Ɗa ɠa è ziɛ wu zua maayikiai naa nɔungiti golowoloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">È kɛ ga daamianigi, è teʋe teʋebai zu zuaiti pɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>Ɗa ɠa è pelei ɠulazu ziɛungiti bɛ, ta kɔtuɗɛiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">Ɗa ɠa è ziɛiti fɔɔzu kpaankpaan ti-laazuʋɛti, niiti ti la ɠɛa vɔɔzu kpaan.<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>Foloi ɠa ga ɗɔnɔ, ta kpidii ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">ɗa ɠa è alugi ɓɛtɛa, ta foloi.<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>Ɗa ɠa è zooi ɠwɛgiti kpein daai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">è foɠoi ɓɛtɛ, ta samai.<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Ɠizɛ nii zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ga è zili nui ɠa é è ʋoomuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">ɠimalala nuɓusɛiti ta è-laaseigi ʋɛlɛʋilisu.<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ti wola nɛai è ʋɛ, mina naati zɛnvui ve dɔɓɔ zuaiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">mina yeema ɲɛgɛlɛin maawɔin nuiti zɛnvui ma, ti ga ɗa-nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>Ɠizɛ ɗa-minazeɠegi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">Mazɔlɔɔ, zooi zu ɠoozamaʋɛti ka ti ga toomai zeizuʋɛti.<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>Nuiti, ti ti zopele ɲɔu zu, mina va bu, naati ti ʋa ɠale ma ʋolu unfegi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">Maawɔin nui ta bala nui, ti è-laaseigi lɛbi.<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>Ee, GALA, wuzeɠe, ɓɔɠɔ maalobo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">Ɠizɛ è ʋoomu gooi zu, nii ɠimalala nui bosu folo-o-folo.<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>Mina yeema è zili nuiti ta-ɓee wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">ti zɔngɔ wooi, é wɔɔlɔzu yeenɔpɛ, ti bosu è laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Mina koloɠolo!» Azafe ná-guyei. Guyei.<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>Gá è maamusɛzu, ee, GALA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">Gá è maamusɛzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">Gá zezezu ga è-lɔɠɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">Ɛsɛ pɛ ka ɗa-ɠɛɛwoti maayikiaiti ta-vaa wosu.<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ma: «Siɛgi gè teʋeai ba, naa a zeelina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">nà tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga sɔledai.<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Eteai ɠa ɲiikpi, ta nii kpein é zeini su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">nà ɠa nà zɛ loni kpaan kpɛdɛgiti ga.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 75:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>«Nà bosu naati ma, niiti ti wasosu ga: ‹À mina waso pa!›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:5">Gè ɠɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ma: ‹À mina loʋalaʋɛ wuzeɠe!<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>À mina gaazulɛ ɠula ga GALA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">À ɓe ɠɔgi losu ga, wo ʋa ɗa gaazulɛɛ ɓɔɛiti bo!› »<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>À suɠwɛɛ ga nui ná-bɔɔlɔlai la zeɠezu folo ɠulazu ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">ɓaa folo liizu ʋelei, ɓaa teʋebai zu.<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka é tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">toɠa ta wuzeɠe, é ta ɠaayei.<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Ziawɔi ɠa zoni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">daavegai ga ná-ziiɠaawana lɔɔi, nii sɔgai é zupu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">Toɠa puuzu faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti bɛ eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">ta kpɔle, ti ziawɔi naa zuwo eyɛsu é zeeli kpogi zu.<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Nɔ̀un nà, gè la looɠoga bo fai ʋa ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">nà Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI maamusɛ yeenɔpɛ ga guyei.<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 75:11"/>Toɠa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-wasogi zuɠaleɠale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:11">kɛlɛ tɔun, telebo nui ɠa ɠɛ ziɛzu nɔungi wuzeɠeai.<verse eid="PSA 75:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka é ga zobo sɔlɔɔ nui</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Guyei loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu ga kɔnigiti. Azafe ná-guyei. Guyei.<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>GALA ge ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni Zuda yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">daaseigi wɔɔlɔʋɛ Izilayɛle yooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>Ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi ɠa Salɛme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">seizuʋɛ ɠɛ Siyɔn.<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>Miná ɠa é kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti galeɠaleni ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">mɛɛinti, ta kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti, ta boɠa zɔkpɔiti.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 76:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa volozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">è maayiki, é leʋe gizeiti ba, ʋɛti è è zili nuiti koloɠoloni ná.<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>Ti salaʋusu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti maavooni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">ti loa bu ɲiimɛnii zu, ta-ɲiimɛni ɠaaɓelagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">Naama ɠɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti, ti la zooni ti ʋa ɓɔɠɔ maalobo.<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI, siɛgi zu è zelii loni da ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti kpizɛ nuiti ta sooiti ti naʋalani.<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>È maayikiʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo losu è ɠakala, ɗa-yiiɠaawanai ʋa ziɛgi zu?<verse eid="PSA 76:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>È yɛni geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ, è ɗa-lukpɔɠaaleʋe vai lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">eteai ɠaaluani, é zei kpɛ,<verse eid="PSA 76:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>siɛgi zu, ee, GALA, è wuzeɠeni la, è faawogi wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">è ʋa ga kizogi naati kpein pɔ, niiti ti maawɔinɗai eteai zu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 76:10">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Anɛɛ nuɓusɛiti ta-yiiɠulagi ɠa ɗa valibo, é ɠɛ ga maamusɛ vai è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">niiti ɗa-yiiɠulagi ʋoolazu ti ʋa, naati ta fɛtii ɠula ɗɔun è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>À minazeɠegiti bo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wa-ƓALAGI ʋɛ, wo ti laazeeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">Niiti kpein ti maaɠoolii zu, naati ti ʋa ga vebɛaniiti maayiki ƓALAGI ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 76:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa kundiɠiiti ta-waso fiilɛi ɠula ti zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:13">maayikiʋɛ, etea masagiti zea.<verse eid="PSA 76:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ge valiboga ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Eɠɛʋelei Yedutun la. Azafe ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>Nà ɓainsu, gè wooɠula GALA ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">GALA ka gè wooɠulazu ma, goilogɛ pɔ̀ pelei.<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>Nà ɠɛna kidaaʋiligi zu, nà ɗa wooɠula Màliɠii ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">Kpidii laawu ɲɛgɛlɛin, zèe lɛɛʋɛ tɔun pɔ pelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">nà ɗa ɠɛlɛ gaanɛɛnɛ vai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>Nà ɠisiɛna GALA su feya, nà ɗa tɔɔzei ga kpalagi woga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">Siɛgi zu nà ɠigaiziɛna la, ìɲɔ ka ɗa leʋe.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>Ɗa gàazu ɓaazu, gè la pɛa ma mɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">Zìiɓɔlɔni, gè la ɠɛni kwɛɛ, nii nà bo.<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>Nà ɠisiɛzu wɔlɔwɔlɔi ma voloiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">ta konagiti su ti leʋegai na kaite.<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>Kìgi loo nà-guyei zu kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">gè ɠisiɛ zìimaʋɛ, zìi gaazaɠagi wo ga:<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>«Maliɠii ɠa ɠɛlɛ bà eyɛsu ɠɔ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">É la mɔ yeezeiɗa bù eyɛsu pɛ ɓaa?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>Ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɓela kana ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">Nii é bosu, naa ɠoloɠologa eyɛsu ɠɔ ɓaa?<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>GALA ge yeema gi maawɔinɠaa vai ma ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">Ná-ziiɠaawanai zu, é yiilaaɠuluga gi luɠɔ?»</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:10">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>Wɛlɛ, nii gè bosu: «Nii ɠa é ga nà-kpɔlɔi ma ungi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, é la mɔ faiti kɛɛzu ga mɔungi ɠɛʋele.»<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Nà ɠitoo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛɛ vaiti su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">Ungo, gè ɗa ɠizɛ laavɔɔ vaiti su, ti leʋegai.<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>Nà ɠisiɛzu ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">Gè ɠida ɗa-vaa wolaiti bu.<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa-vaiti ɲadegɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">Galagi ɓɛgele ɠa bɔɔlɔai ga GALA kɛʋele?<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Ɗa ɠa è ga GALAGI nii é laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">È ɗa-zobogi ɠulani kɛlɛma zii ɠiligiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>È yeelokoi ɠa è ɗa-nuɓusɛiti unmɔɔni da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">Zakɔɓe mavofodai ta Zozɛfe mavofodai.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:16">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Ee, GALA, ziɛiti ti è ɠaani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">Ziɛiti ti è ɠaani, ti zasuɓali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">Ungo, paliiti ti ɲiikpini.<verse eid="PSA 77:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Tonaɓiingiti ti tonai ʋuuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">tonai kpunɛni, tona togai ma viilɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">ɗa-mɛɛinti ti ɠɛni ɠoʋesu mini-o-mini geezuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>Ɗa-lona ɓunɛ tugi ʋɔ, tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">mainmainti ti eteai zu ɠɛɛni kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">eteai ɲiikpini, é ɓali.<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>Ɗa-ʋelei ɠɛni kpoloɗɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">ɗa-ʋele goiti ti ɠɛ ziɛ wolaiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">nu nɔpɛ ge la è-ɠɔɠɔ ʋogiti kaani.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 77:21"/>È loni ɗa-nuɓusɛiti untuɠɔ eɠɛ baala kpulugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:21">ga Moize ta Aalɔn maaʋele.<verse eid="PSA 77:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s">GALA zee ɠa fai pɛ su</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>Azafe ná-kidafaawui.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 78:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">Nà-nuɓusɛiti, à woilo nà-kala gooiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">wo ɠida dàawooiti bu!<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>Nà ɓɔɛzu faalaalii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">gè kidafaawu vaiti dɛɛ, niiti ti leʋegai wɔlɔwɔlɔi.<verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>Nii ade mɛnini, ade kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">nii ade-ɠɛwolani ti boni ade ma,<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>ade la dɔɔɠua ade-lointi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">ada bo naati kpein ma, niiti ti ʋilɛsu ade ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kɛɛwoti maayikia wolaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">ná-zobogi ta ná-laavɔɔ vaa mɔinmɔingiti.<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>É devei veeni Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">é tɔ feeni Izilayɛle nuiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">é ade-mɛmɛwolani deveni, ga ti ti-lointi kala da,<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, niiti ti wuzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">doungoiti ti ʋaazu zɔlɔɔsu, ti ɠala da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">tiya ɓalaa ti ti-lointi kala da,<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, ti la GALA da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">ti mina yeema kɛɛ vaiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">ti ná-deveiti so, ti ɗa ziɛ ga tiye,<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>ti mina ɠula ga ti-mɛmɛwolani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">niiti tɔnɔ ma ziɛgi zu, ti ɠɛni ga kololala nuiti ti ɓakagai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">yamanii zu nuiti ti ɠikpaai gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">ti-ɠigi la ga wooɠɛɠila nu GALA bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Efelayime ná-bolodama nuiti, kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai ɠɛni ti ya ga mɛɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">ti ʋoluaveni kɔɔɠɔ voloi.<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>Ti la ɠɛni GALA ná-minazeɠegi zoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">ti ɠɛlɛni, ti la ziɛni ga ná-tɔgi.<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>Ti yeemani ná-faa wolaiti ma, é ti ɠɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">ta ná-laavɔɔ vaa wolaiti é ti ɠɛɛni ti ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>É maaɓɛlɛ vai ɠɛɛni ti-mɛmɛwolani gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">Ezipete yooi zu, Soan ɓalaɠai zu.<verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>É kpoloɗɛi ʋalini su, é ti leʋeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">é ziɛi ɠaalɛɛni ba, é siɠi to.<verse eid="PSA 78:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>É ɠɛni losu ti luɠɔ foloi ga tonaɓiingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">é lo ti luɠɔ kpidii ga abu zezei.<verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>É fasaiti daaʋalini teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">é ziɛ wolai ɠulani, ti ɓɔɔle la.<verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>É ziɛ wolai ɠulani fasai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">kɔtuɗɛi zuluni eɠɛ ziɛ wola.<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>Kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni nɔ kotoi ɠɛɛzu tɔun daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, ti wuzeɠeni naa laalɔɠɔma teʋebai zu.<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>Ti GALA suɠɔɠɔni ti-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">nii nɔ é ga ti yiima laamianigi, ti naa vali ma.<verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>Ti ɓɔɛni GALA daalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">«GALA ka zoo nɛi é daamiani fe gi ya teʋebai zu ɓaa?<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>Pele ɠana é fasai loɠani la, ziɛi ɠulani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">kɔtuɗɛi zuluni, é vaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">toɠa zoo nɛi ɓalaa, é daamianigi ve gi ya ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">Ɓaa é suai ve ná-nuɓusɛiti zea?»<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI naama wooiti mɛnini, é yiiɠaawana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">ná-ziiɠaawana abui soni ná-nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">ná-ziiɠaawanai vukani Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma,<verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠɛni laani GALA da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">tɔɔzei ti la laani ná-kizo fai la.<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>É devei veeni tonaɓiingiti zea geezuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">é geeɠɔlɔgi ma ʋɛlɛlaʋɛti daalaoni,<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>é manegi ʋuuni ti ʋɛ ga ti-laamianigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">é geeɠɔlɔgi zu moloi veeni ti ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Ɛsɛ ge nɔnɔ miini nu wolaiti ta-ɓului zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">é daamianigi leʋeni ti ma, ti yiɠo.<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>GALA ge folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi yeini, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">é ɓɔini lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu viilɛi la, é lokoleʋe.<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>É suai ʋuuni ti ma, é mɔin eɠɛ fufiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">é wɔni ɓulugi ʋuuni, ti mɔin eɠɛʋelei kpoloɗɛiti koba ɲaɠaegi la.<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>É ti ʋuuni ti-zeizuʋɛ zaamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">ti-zeizuʋɛ maaɠoolii zu.<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Ti daamii woni, ti yiɠo ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">nii wɔin ɠɛni ti ma, GALA ge ʋaani ga naa ti ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>Kɛlɛ ti yiima vai laa la ɠɛni dɛ ɓeni ga zeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">suai ɠɛni dɛ ti-laaʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 78:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>siɛgi zu GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai wuzeɠeni la ti laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">é zeeɠaaɓa geleiti paani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">é zunu loungoiti too bu Izilayɛle nuiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 78:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ti kotoi ɠɛɛni ʋolu mɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">ti la ɠɛni laani ná-laavɔɔ vaiti da.<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>Ta-eteai ɓeni eɠɛ fiilɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">ta-eteai pɛ ge ɓeni maanɔɠɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>Siɛgi zu GALA ga la tanigaani paana la, ti ɓena gaiziɛ, ti ʋa pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">ti ɓena ɠale ma, ti GALA gaiziɛ gola.<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>Ti-ɠigi ɓena loo su ga GALA ka é ga ta-vasai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">ga GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ɠa é ga ti unmɔɔ nui.<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni ga sɔɓelama nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">nii ti ɠɛni bosu GALA ma, naa la ɠɛni ga gaamai.<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti-yii la ɠɛni zɔleni tɔun bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">ti la ɠɛni ga wooɠɛɠila nua ná-minazeɠegi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, tɔun ná-maawɔinɠaa wolai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">é ɠɛni ti zuvaayɛsu, a ʋa li ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">siɛ mɔinmɔin su, é ɠɛni ná-ziiɠaawanai yɛsu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">é la ɠɛni ná-ziiɠaawanai pɛ kulani kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>GALA ge ɠizɛni su ga ta ga nu vuluiti nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">fiilɛi nii é leʋesu, é la mɔ ʋa ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>Siɛ mɔinmɔin su, ti ɠɛni wuzeɠezu daalɔɠɔma teʋebai zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">Siɛ mɔinmɔin su, ti ɠɛni gaazuɠili vai ɠɛɛzu zou vɔɔi zu!<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>Ti tɔɔzeini mɔnɔ ga GALA suɠɔɠɔga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">ti ɗa Izilayɛle ná-GALA Ɲadegai laazuɠɔli.<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>Ti yeemani naa ma, nii é kɛɛni ti ʋɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">É ti unmɔɔni, é ti ɠula ti zili nui ya,<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>é laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛni Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">é maaɓɛlɛ vaiti kɛ Soan yooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>É ziɛungiti ta ziɛ wolaiti faliboni ga ɲamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">Ezipete nuiti ti la mɔ ɠɛni zoosu, ti ʋa ta ɓɔle.<verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>É dɛgiti teʋeni ti ma, ti ɗa ti wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">ta zɔlɔgiti, naati ti ɗa faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠɛ zooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>É ta-molo mɔɔiti feeni kpazinɛgiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">é ti-ɓɔlɔzuʋɛ ma lɔnɔgi ve kotogiti zea.<verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>Sakɔtui ta-ɓeleiti koloɠoloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">ta-zikɔmɔɔl guluiti ti ɠoloɠoloni ga kɔɔlɛi.<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>É ta-loganiiti feeni sakɔtui ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">é ta-logani ɓulugiti fe geeɓadɛi ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>É ná-ziiɠaawana wolai yeini ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">ta ná-ziimaleʋei, ta ná-ziiɠulagi, ta kidaaʋili fai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">eɠɛ geezuɠeela ɓulugiti, ti ʋa ti ʋɔ ga maanɔɠɔi.<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>É pelei vieni ná-ziiɠaawanai luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">é la ɠɛni saai ɓudɛni ti maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">kɛlɛ tɔun é ti lɔɔni ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi zu.<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>É doun zunu mɔungiti kpein paani Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">Same mavofodaiti ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti bu, ti-zuvikɛi ma mɔungiti.<verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>É liini ga ná-nuɓusɛiti, eɠɛ togani go nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">é loni ti luɠɔ teʋebai zu, eɠɛʋelei baala makɛ nui a ɗa lo da ná-baala kpulugiti tuɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>É loni ti luɠɔ, é ɓaa ti maazu, ti la ɠɛni ɲiikpini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">kpoloɗɛi ti zili nuiti maaɓɔleni.<verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>É liini ga tiye ná-zou ɲadegai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">gizei naa ma, nii é soni ga ná-zobogi.<verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>É zii ɠiligiti kpɛɛni ti luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">é zooi ɠaaɠwɛ ti ɠilagilagi ʋa ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">é Izilayɛle wolodamaiti seini Kanaan nuiti seizuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>Kɛlɛ ti GALA suɠɔɠɔni, nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">ti wuzeɠeni daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">ti la ɠɛni ná-deveiti soni.<verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>Ti ɠakani ga ti-mɛmɛwolani kɛʋele, ti ɠɛ ga wooʋalada nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">ti ɠakani eɠɛ kilɛgi nii suɓiligai.<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni zalaɠai ɠulazu zii ɠiligiti ta-zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">ti ziiɠaawanani ga ta-vololibaiti, ta ta-ɠala kiligiti ti ɠɛni ti ya.<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>GALA ge miná ɠaai ma, ziiɠaawanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">Izilayɛle wɔinzeɠeni ma ga gola.<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>É ɠɛlɛni seizuʋɛ ʋa naa ga Silo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">seɠe ʋɛlɛi nii é ɠɛni zeizu bu nuɓusɛiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>Ná-minazeɠe kesui, nii é ga ná-zobogi ta ná-lɛbiyai, ma ʋoogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">é naa yɛni na, é lɔ zii ɠiligiti zeezu.<verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>É yiiɠaawanani ná-nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">é ná-nuiti zɛni saai laawu.<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Abui zunu loungoiti galani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">vulu ɠɛɛ wuye la mɔ ɠɛni loozu anzalopoiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Ti ná-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti undaaʋilini ga boɠa zɔkpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">poanzaiti ti la ɠɛni saa wɔlɔi wosu fɔɔn.<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Kɛlɛ Maliɠii wuunni, eɠɛ zunui é ɠɛa ɲiizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">eɠɛ kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgi nii dɔɔi gaazulɛai.<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>É ʋilɛni sili nuiti polu, é ti zuloɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">nii a kɛ é zɔngɔi zɛlɛ ti ʋa eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>É Zozɛfe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei likpini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">é la ɠɛni yiimazeɠeni ga Efelayime mavofodai.<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>Kɛlɛ é yiimazeɠeni ga Zuda mavofodai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">Siyɔn gizei, nii é nɛɛni bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>Miná ɠa é seizu ɲadegai logai ná, é lo kpaan eɠɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">niiti é ti ɓɛtɛai, ti ná eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>É yiimazeɠeni ga ná-botiɠɛ nui Davide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">é seɠeni, é kula ná-baalagiti makɛsuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>É seɠeni baalagiti saama, é kɛ ga Izilayɛle makɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">ná-nuɓusɛiti ti ga nɔnɔi.<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>Davide ɠɛni ga ti makɛ nui, nii sɔlegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">keleɠelegi ɠɛni zea, naa ɠa é loni la ti luɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s">Yeelɛ ɠa è ʋaazu la è ɓɔ gi ʋa?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>Azafe ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 79:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">Ee, GALA, zii ɠiligiti ti ʋa ti ɗa-yooi zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">ti è zei ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠɔzɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">ti Zeluzalɛme zoga, ti naa ɠɛ ga kɔtu ziɠigiti.<verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>Ti ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti paa, ti ti-ma ʋoomaiti fe wɔniiti zea ga daamianigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">Niiti ti ga wooɠɛɠila nuiti è ʋɛ, ti naati ma zuaiti fea dɔɓɔ zuaiti zea.<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>Ti ti-ma ɲama ɓoigi ʋua Zeluzalɛme maaɠoolii zu, é lati ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">nu nɔpɛ ge la zɔlɔɔni, nii a ti-ma ʋoomaiti maaɠulu.<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Gi-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ta gi ʋoomusu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">gi ɠɛa ga ɲɛɛɠulasu ani naati zea, niiti ti gi-maaɠoolii zu, ti ɗa ɲɛɛ gi ma.<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa yɛsu ziiɠaawanai laawu yeenɔpɛ, eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Ɗa-yiiɠaawana wolai ɠa sosu, eɠɛ abui?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>Ɗa-yiiɠulagi yei zii ɠiligiti ma, niiti ti la è ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">ta masadaiti ma, niiti ti la wooɠulazu è ma!<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti Izilayɛle mia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">ti seizuʋɛ zuwoga, naa zuɲakai yɛ.<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>Mina gi-mɛmɛwolani ta-vaaɠaaza golai la gi unma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">Ɗa-maawɔinɠai ʋa gi ʋɔ fala, é mina lɛbi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">Mazɔlɔɔ gi maanɔɠɔa gola.<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>Gá-ɠizo GALAGI, ɓɔ gi ʋa, è-laaseigi ma lɛbiyai maaʋele ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">Gi unmɔɔ, è gá-ɠotoiti gba, è-laaseigi wɔɔlɔ vai zu.<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>Leeni vaa zu, zii ɠiligiti ta ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">«Mini ɠa ta-ƓALAGI ná?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">Dɛɛ ga tiye gi ɠaazu, ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ma ɲamai puai, ɗa potokulazu!<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>Kasoɠa nuiti kpala gooi zeeli è ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">È-yeelokoi ná-zɛbɛi ʋɔ, naati kizo, niiti ti saai ma vaaɓaagi laawu.<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>Ɓaaɠulamai gi-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti kɛai ga ɗe, Maliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">naa ɠɛɠalai zei ti ma, ga dɔfela!<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Gɔun gá, ɗa-nuɓusɛiti, baala kpulugi nii è ga makɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">gá è maamusɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ, gá zeze ga è maamusɛ vai, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su nuiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s">Eyɛsu yeelɛ, Maliɠii?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu é zoloo guye wooi ma, nii daa ga: «Bulɛgi ma ʋuaiti». Zeele wooi. Azafe ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 80:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>Baala kpulugi Izilayɛle makɛ nui, woilo gòoi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">ɗɛi è losu Zozɛfe mavofodaiti untuɠɔ, eɠɛ baala kpulugi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">Ɗɛi ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi zeini seeluɓɛinti unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">è-ma zezei ɠula kɛlɛma,<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>Efelayime wolodamaiti tuɠɔ, ta Ɓɛnzamɛn, ta Manasé.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">È-zɛbɛi ɠula kɛlɛma, è ʋa è gi ɠizo!<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>Ee, GALA, gi zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">yeezei gi wu ga pagɔ, gá ɠizo.<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">Ɗa yɛsu ziiɠaawanai zu, ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta-ƓALA falii laalɔɠɔma, eyɛsu yeelɛ?<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>Ɗa ti-ɠɔnɔgi ɠɛɛzu ga ziizoolɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">ɗa ti ɓɔɔle ɗɛi ɠɛɛzu ga ti-ɠaazuɗɛi, kwɛ ge la ba.<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>Ɗa gi ɠɛɛzu ga sakpe ganii gi-zeiɲɔɠɔiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">gi zili nuiti ti ɗa ɲɛɛɠula gi zu.<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>Ee, GALA, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, gi zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">yeezei gi wu ga pagɔ, gá ɠizo!<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>È leezɛn ansaɠɔgi lɔɔɠulani Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">è zii ɠiligiti kpɛɛni, è siinni ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>È zooi ɠaaɓɛtɛni tuɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">É ma zapeiti dɔɔni zooi wu, naa ʋolu é zooi zulaave.<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>Ná-niinigi ʋɛɛni gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">ma ɓekegiti ti ɠulani ga sɛdele gulu wolaiti.<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>Ma ɓekegiti ti zeelini eyɛsu kpoloɗɛi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">ma ʋɔnɔgiti ti zeelini eyɛsu ziɛ wolai Efelate ma.<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Leeni vaa zu è zeɠei wɔai ná-sasaiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">teʋe nuiti kpein ti ɗa ʋa, ti ɗa ma waai ɠula?<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>Boigi ɠa ɠulazu dɔɓɔi zu, é ʋa é ɗa koloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">dɔɓɔ zuaiti ta ʋaazu ti ɗa mi.<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>Ee, GALA, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, ʋa ʋolu kae!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">Yɛ geeɠɔlɔgi maazuʋɛ geezuʋɛ, è wɛlɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">Leezɛn ʋɔnɔgi tɛi maalobo!<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>Nii makɛ, nii ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è siingai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">zunu loin tɛi, nii ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è zobogi veeni bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>Leezɛn ʋɔnɔgi tɛi ge ɠalaa, é leʋea ga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">Ti pɛ undaaʋili ɗa-yiiɠaawanai zu!<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>È-yeei yɛ zunui naa ʋa, nii é zeini è yeezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">nii ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è zobogi veeni bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>Gi la mɔ zeɠea è ʋa eyɛsu pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">Gi vulu su ʋolu, gá wooɠula è ma.<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 80:20"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, gi zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:20">yeezei gi wu ga pagɔ, gá ɠizo!<verse eid="PSA 80:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s">Ee, ni nà-nuɓusɛiti ti woiloni gòo ma!</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu kɔnigi ɠa, nii é zeɠezu Gate taazuʋɛ. Azafe ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>À guyei loo ga koozunɛɛi GALA bɛ, tɔ ɠa é ga de-zɛbɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">À wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI ʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>À guyei loo ʋɔɔma, wo tamadegi ɠɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">wo kɔnigi ɠɛin gooloo ma, wo papai ɠɛin!<verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>À puʋugi vɛ alu toga niinɛi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">ta à zeina gize la, ada-vɛti volo wolai!<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga tɔgi Izilayɛle ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI ná-devei ʋe.<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>Tɔgi ʋe, GALA ge seini Zozɛfe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">siɛgi zu é laalɛɛni la Ezipete yooi wu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 81:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">Nà wooi ta mɛnisu, nii gè la kwɛɛ, é ɠɛɛzu ma:<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>«Gè kasɔi zeɠea wo ɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">wo-yeeiti ti viega, ti ɓe kpɔlɔgiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>Siɛgi zu wo ɠɛni la kidaaʋiligi zu, wo tòlini, gè ʋaani, gè wo unmɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">gè wo wooɠaaʋoteni tonavifigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">gè wo ʋoluɠulani Meliɓa ɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 81:8">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>«Nà-nuɓusɛiti, à woilo gòo ma, nà wo lɛnɛsu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">Ee, ni nɔ wo ɠɛni woilosu gòo ma, Izilayɛle!<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>Gala kili ge mina ɠɛ wo yeema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">à mina nɔkɔ gala kiligiti taɠila kpalaa bu!<verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI, nii é wo ɠulani Ezipete yooi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">À laalao gola, nà ti laave.<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>Kɛlɛ nà-nuɓusɛiti ti la woiloni gòo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">Izilayɛle la nɔ̀un pɔ.<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Gè ti yɛgɛ ti yiima vaiti polu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">ti ʋilɛgɛ ti ɓɔɠɔyiima vaiti nɔ ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>Ni nɔ nà-nuɓusɛiti ta woilo gòo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">ni Izilayɛle ɠa ziɛ ga pelei gè dɛɛzu la,<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>gaamago nɔ, nà ti zili nuiti da ti ɠɔɠɔwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">nà ti nimiza nuiti doɠa.<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>Niiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔinzeɠezu, naati ta lɛbiyai ve tɔun bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">naa ɠa deveai ti ma eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 81:17"/>Nà Izilayɛle ɠɔnɔkula ga molo ʋagɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:17">gè dɔɓɔ ɠɔingi ma wulɔi ve ti ya, ti yiɠo la.»<verse eid="PSA 81:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka gala kiligiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Azafe ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 82:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">GALA ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, GALA ka loni gala kiligiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">é ɗa tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>É ɠɛ ma: «Wa yɛsu tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu ga telebotalai, eyɛsu yeelɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">wo ɗa lo faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti polu?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 82:2">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>À zɛbɛsulala nuiti maalobo, podointi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">wo ɠɛ ga sɔle nu bala nuiti bɛ, ta maawɔin nuiti,<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>à zɛbɛsulala nuiti fie, ta maawɔin nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:4">à ti vie, wo ti ɠula faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti zea.<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>«Kɛlɛ ti la faa nɔpɛ gaaɠaazu, ti la faa nɔpɛ kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">ta liizu ga yeeʋɛa mɛmɛ kpidii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">eteai ma wuulaagiti ti ɲiikpiga eteai zu ná pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: ‹Wa ga galagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">wo pɛ wa ga nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda naa ná-doun zunuiti!›<verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, wa zaazu ga nuɓusɛiti kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">wa loo bu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ kundiɠiiti ta ɗa loo bu la.»<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>Ee, GALA, wuzeɠe, è eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">Mazɔlɔɔ ziiti pɛ ta ga ɗɔnɔi.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s">Mina yɛ wɛlɛzu è zili nuiti ba, <optbreak/> ti ʋa pilɛ sɔlɔɔ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>Guyei. Azafe ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Ee, GALA, mina yɛ maaɠɛkpɔgi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">Mina maaɠɛ kpɔ, mina zei kpɛ, ee, GALA!<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è zili nuiti ti ɓakaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">niiti ti è wɔinzeɠezu, ti tɔungiti buzeɠea.<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>Ta ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ɗa-nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">ti ɗa yaavai ɓɛtɛ ɗɔnɔiti daalɔɠɔma, niiti è ti makɛsu.<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>Ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ade ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe, ti-ma zii ɲɛɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">naa ɠa a kɛ, Izilayɛle laaseigi loo ya, zeemai wo ma eyɛsu ɠɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>Ta unpilɛsu, ti zoloo ma ɠi gilagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">ti minazeɠegi wo è laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 83:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>Tiya ɠa ti ga, Edɔme nuiti, ta Isemayɛle nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">ta Ɠagaal nuiti, ta Moaɓe nuiti,<verse eid="PSA 83:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>ta Geɓale nuiti, ta Amɔn nuiti, ta Amalɛke nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:8">Filisiti nuiti, ta Tiil nuiti,<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>Asiili nuiti ɓalaa ti ɓɔni ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">ti yeeveeni Lote mavofodai ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 83:9">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>Ee, GALA, ti zo, eɠɛʋelei è Madiyan nuiti soni da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">ta Sisela, ta Yaɓin, Kison kɔtuɗɛi ʋɔ bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>Ti ɠoloɠoloni En-Dɔɔl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">ti ɠɛni ga kpoɠa pɔlɔi zooi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>Ta-zeizumaanɛgiti so, eɠɛʋelei è Wolɛɓe ta Zeebeni soni da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">Ta-ɠundiɠiiti so, eɠɛʋelei è Zeɓa ta Salamunani soni da,<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>tɛiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ade GALA ná-zooiti so, ti ɠɛ ga adɔnɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Nà-GALAGI, ti ɠɛ ga tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">ti ɠɛ ga daazaɠagi, nii fiilɛi liizu la.<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>Pelei abui dɔɓɔi ɠalazu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">pelei abuzogi sosu da gizei ʋa,<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>ʋilɛ ti ʋolu ɠana ga ɗa-viilɛ wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">ɗa-viilɛ wolai ti maalua ɠana!<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, unfegi lɔ ti-ɠaazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">naa ɠa a kɛ, ti è ɠaiziɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>Unfegi lɔ ti-ɠaazuʋɛ, ti zasuɓali eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">ti undaaʋili ɓaaɠula ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 83:19"/>Ti ɠɛ kwɛɛ ga, ɗa ɠila kpe, ɗɛi è-laaseigi ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:19">ɗa ɠa è Anii-Pɛ-Unda, eteai zu ná pɛ!<verse eid="PSA 83:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s">È zei ʋɛlɛi wɔin ɠa ɓɔizu nɔ̀un da</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. É loozu kɔnigi ɠa, nii é zeɠezu Gate taazuʋɛ. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">è-zeizuʋɛ nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀ gola!<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>Nà ɓalasu, zìi ɗa zoolɛ, ɗa-ɠoi ma vaa zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">nà wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Soologi ɠa laɠagi losu zɔlɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">sɛʋɛzɛʋɛgoi laɠagi losu zɔlɔɔ, ʋɛ é ma yiʋoiti puuzu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti kobaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">nà-masagi, nà-GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti ti zeizu ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">mazɔlɔɔ ta yɛ è maamusɛzu eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 84:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti è ga ti-zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">pelei ɠa ti-yiimaʋɛ, ta ziɛ la, ti li ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>Siɛgi zu ti leʋesu da Ɓaka nɛmɛi zu (nii poluʋɛ ga «gɔlɔ nɛmɛi zu»),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">GALA ka falibo, é kɛ ga koozunɛ adaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">tona mɔungiti ta ʋu naa ma, ga tuyai.<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>Ti-zuvikɛi ɠa li ga wɔɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">ta ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga GALA Siyɔn.<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">Woilo, Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 84:9">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>Ee, GALA, ɗɛi è gi makɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">yeezei naa wu ga pagɔ, nii è gulɔi ziaai ma, è sei.<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nu folo ɠila kɛ ɗa-ɠoizuʋɛ, naa zoloogɛ é leʋe folo waagilagi (1.000) ʋa nu a kɛ ada ɠili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">Fizɔgɛ nu yɛ nà-GALAGI ná-pɛlɛlaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">é ʋa li yɛsu faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa gi ʋɛ eɠɛ foloi, ta kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa zaalai veezu ta lɛbiyai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:12">é la ɠɛlɛa undaanɛɛ veezu naati bɛ, niiti ti ziɛzu sɔledai zu.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 84:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:13">undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii é ɠalivaazu è ma!<verse eid="PSA 84:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa undaanɛɛi ve gi ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è undaanɛ vaa ɠɛɛni ɗa-yooi ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">È Zakɔɓe mavofodai zei ʋele ɓɛtɛni ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>È ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti seɠeni ti unma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">è ta-ɠotoiti kpein suvaayɛni.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 85:3">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>È ɗa-yiiɠaawana vai zeɠeni ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">è yeeɓeni ɗa-yiimaleʋei ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Gi zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu, ee, GALA, gi ɠizo nui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">Ɓe yiiɠaawanazu gi ma!<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>Ɗa yɛsu yiiɠaawanazu gi ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">Ɗa-yiiɠaawanai la ɓesu ɠɔ, eyɛsu yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su?<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>È la kɛa, è ʋa zɛnvui ve gi ya ʋolu ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">nii a kɛ ɗa-nuɓusɛiti gi ɠoozunɛ è ʋɔ?<verse eid="PSA 85:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai lɛ ga giye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">Ɗa-ɠizo fai ve gi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>Nà pɔ gè woilo naa ma, nii GALA ge bosu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ziilɛi kpɔɛi wosu ná-nuɓusɛiti ma, ta niiti ti bɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">Kɛlɛ ti mina ɠale ma mɔnɔ tooya vaiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>Ungo, nágo ʋe na, è ʋa naati kizo, niiti ti luazu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">naa ɠa a kɛ, lɛbiyai zei gá-yooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Wooɠɛɠiladai ta gaamai ta ɠomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">telebodai ta ziilɛigi ta yeezo.<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Gaamai ɠa ʋɔnɔ zooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">telebodai ɠa yei, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi ɠa undaanɛɛi ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">gá-yooi ɠa kulanumai ve.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 85:14"/>Telebogi ɠa ziɛ tɔun kakalaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:14">é pelei la tuɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s">Nà-kidaaʋiligi zu, nà wooɠulazu è ma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>Davide ná-GALA falii.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 86:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">Woilo gòoi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è gòoɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">mazɔlɔɔ màawɔinɗa, gè ɠɛ ga bala nu.<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>Ʋa è zɛ̀nvui makɛ, mazɔlɔɔ gìliʋɛ è ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">Ɗɔun ɗa ga nà-GALAGI, nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, é ɠalivaazu è ma, ʋa è kìzo.<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>Ee, Màliɠii, zaalai la mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">yeenɔpɛ nà wooɠulazu è ma.<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">mazɔlɔɔ è ʋɔ pelei ɠa, Màliɠii, gè ɠaaʋotegai ná.<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>Ungo, Màliɠii, è ʋagɛ, ɗa ɗa maavaayɛgi wo fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">è ɓɛtɛʋɛ wooɠɛɠiladai zu naati kpein tetema, niiti ti wooɠulazu è ma.<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>Woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">Woilo, siɛgi zu gè è valizu la!<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>Nà-kidaaʋili foloi zu, ɗa ɠa nà ɗa wooɠula è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa ɗa gòoɠaaʋote.<verse eid="PSA 86:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>Màliɠii, galagi tanɔpɛ ge la ga è ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">tanɔpɛ ge la zooga, é ʋa naa ɠɛ, nii è kɛa.<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>Ɗa ɠa è ziiti kpein kpɛtɛai, ta ʋa, ti nɔkɔ è ɠɔɠɔwu, Màliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">ti lɛbiyai ve è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è wɔɔlɔʋɛ, ɗa laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">ɗa ɠa è ga GALA kite ɠila kpegi.<verse eid="PSA 86:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, pelei lɛ ga ze, nii è pɔ ga gè ziɛ la!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">Nà ziɛ ɗa-ɠaamai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">Naama ɠi gila kpegi ve bɛ̀, gè ɠolo ɗa-zobogi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>Nà è maamusɛzu ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ, Màliɠii, nà-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">Nà è-laaseigi lɛbi yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ nɔ̀un tetema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">ɗa zɛ̀nvui unmɔɔsu, è kula gɔvɛalaazu ɓomaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>Ee, GALA, waso nuiti ti wuzeɠea dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">zunu ɓulugiti ta gaiziɛzu ga ti pàa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">Ti la seizu veezu è ʋɛ ta-ɠisiɛiti su.<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>Kɛlɛ, ɗɔun Màliɠii, ɗa ga maawɔinɠa ƓALAGI, nii é zaalai veezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">zii la ɠula fala, kpɛtɛai nuɓɔɠɔlai ta wooɠɛɠiladai zu.<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>Ɠaaʋote nɔ̀un ma, è zaalai la mà!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">È-zɛbɛi ve bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">Ʋa è ɗa-wotiɠɛ anzanui ná-doun zunui ɠizo.<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>Ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ma ʋoogi ta ve bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu, ti ka, ti lɔ unfegi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ɓɔsu bà, è gàanɛɛnɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s">Siyɔn ɠa é ga nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta-laai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei. Guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 87:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:1">Zeluzalɛme ɠa loni gize ɲadegaiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Siyɔn taa wolai nɛɛʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">é leʋe Zakɔɓe mavofodai zɔiti seizuʋɛti ba.<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Ee, GALA ná-taai, nii ti bosu ɗa-vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:3">naa zu vai kpein ka ga lɛbiyai.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 87:3">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>«Niiti kpein ti kwɛ̀ɛ, naati saama nà Ezipete nuiti ta-vai wo, ta Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">Gè Filisiti nuiti daaseigi zɛʋɛ, ta Tiil nuiti, ta Etiyopi nuiti, eɠɛ ta zɔlɔɔ ʋɛ nɔ.»<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>Toɠa wo Siyɔn ná-faa zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">«Nui pɛ sɔlɔɔgɛ ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">GALA, é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ɠa zee ná ʋa.»<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nuɓusɛiti kpein tɔɠɔi zɛʋɛʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">é sɛʋɛ ɛsɛ gilagilagi ná-faa zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">«Nii zɔlɔɔsuʋɛ ɓɔɔɓɔgi ɠa ga ʋɛ».</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 87:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>Niiti ti guyei loozu, ta niiti ti kuai wosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">naati ta ɠɛɛzu ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">«Nà-sɔlɔɔgi kpein ka ɗɔun è ʋɔ bɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s">Nui nii é saa yeɠei la, naa ná-GALA falii</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>Kolé mavofodaiti ta-wuyei. Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Nii é loozu koolei bu. Ezela nui Ɠeman ná-kidafaawui.<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-kizo GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">Nà kpeei loozu foloi ta kpidii è ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>Nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi lɛ, é zeeli è ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">Woilo nà-kpee wooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Ungo, maanɔɠɔi kula ɠɛa ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">gè maaɓuɠa saai ʋa gola.<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>Nɔ̀un gàalugɛ niina naati saama, niiti ti yeizu kabayeɠei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">gè ɠɛa eɠɛ zunui, nii zɛbɛ nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ba.<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>Nà niina laani gɔvɛiti saama, eɠɛ poomaiti ti laani kabayeɠei zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">È yeemaai ti ma, è-ɠi ge la mɔ ti zu, è la mɔ faa nɔpɛ kɛɛzu ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>È dɔ̀a zeɠei ɓomaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:7">saai ɓomaʋɛ ma ɓidii zu.<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>Ɗa-yiiɠulagi zeelia mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">ɗa-yiiɠaawanai zeelia mà eɠɛ ziɛ lakpatakpagiti.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 88:8">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>È màaɠooza sìɛɲɔɠɔiti ba, gè ɠɛa ti ʋɛ eɠɛ maalua ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">nà-maanɔɠɔi daaɠuluga mà, gè la zooga gè ʋa ɠula su.<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>Gàazuɠɛzɛi ɓɔiɗa su ga ziizoolɛi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 88:10"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà wooɠulazu è ma, yeenɔpɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Nà zèeiti tɛɛzu è ma.<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>Gɔvɛiti ka ɗa laavɔɔ vaiti kɛ ti ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">Gɔvɛiti ka ta wuzeɠe, ti ɗa è lɛbi?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 88:11">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>Ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠa wo nɛi kabayeɠei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">ta ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai undaaʋili zeɠezaɠai zu?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>Ɗa-laavɔɔ vaiti kwɛɛgɛ nɛi kpidii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">ta ɗa-lelebodai zooi zu, ʋɛ zeemai wogai ná ma?<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>Nɔ̀un nà, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa gè è lolisu ga è ɓɔ bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">Nà nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi laazeelizu è ma, sobu-o-sobu.<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Leeni vaa zu, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è pìlisu ya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">Leeni vaa zu è ɠaazulɔɔɠuzu ga è mina kà?<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ màawɔinʋɛ, nà niina saai ɠoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">é tɔɔzei nà-doungo ziɛgi zu ma, eyɛsu niizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">nà lɔɔzu maalua vai zu, nii è seizu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">sàsuɓalia gola.<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>Ɗa-yiiɠaawana abui soga nɔ̀un ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">gè ɠoloɠologa ga ziizoolɛi, nii é zeelizu mà, é zeɠe è ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Eɠɛ ziɛiti ti màaɓɔlesu folo-o-folo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">ta latisu mà mini-o-mini.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 88:19"/>È gàazuɠwɛɛgiti ta bɔ̀ɔlaiti maaɠooza bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:19">Kpidii ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é ga sìɛpoluɲɔɠɔi niina.<verse eid="PSA 88:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠegiti ta mini, <optbreak/> niiti ti ɠɛɛni Davide ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>Ezela nui Etan ná-kidafaawui.<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai maawuyezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">dàaʋɛ ɠa ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠula kɛlɛma yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>Nà zoo gè bo, gè ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">«Ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠa loni eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">È ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zeiʋɛ kpaan geeɠɔlɔgi zu.»<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>È boni, è ɠɛ ma: «Gè minazeɠegi woni nà-nui ʋɛ, gè yiimazeɠeai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">Davide ʋɛ, nii é ga nà-botiɠɛ nui, gè niima minazeɠegi woni ga:<verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>‹Nà yɛ è-mavofodai zeizu masadai zu eyɛsu ɠɔ, ɗa zeɠena ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">gè ɓaa ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi maazu, yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su nuiti saama.› »</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:5">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>Geeɠɔlɔgiti su aniiti kpein ta ɗa-ɠɛɛwoti maayikiaiti dɛbizu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">Ɗa-nu ɲadegaiti ta-maaɓɔgi ɠa ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maamusɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ga è ɠɛʋele, geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">Ɓɛ ɠa é ga è ɠɛʋele, geezu aniiti saama?<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>GALA maayikiʋɛ gola, nu ɲadegaiti ta-maaɓɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">maayikiʋɛ naati kpein gaazu, niiti ti maaɠoolii zu.<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">Ɓɛ ɠa zobogi bɛ ga ɗɔun è ɠɛʋele, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai è maaɠooliʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>Ungo, ɗa ɠila kpe ka ɗa ɗa kpoloɗɛi ná-wasogi ɠaayei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">Siɛgi zu é wuzeɠezu la ɲiikpigi ma, ɗa ɠa ɗa ɗa gaayei.<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>Ɗa ɠa è ziɛ wu zua ɲɔi Laɠaɓe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">89:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zua ɲɔi Laɠaɓe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tanisu daaseigi naa ɠa ɓɔɛzu é ʋilɛ Ezipete ʋa ɓaa kpoloɗɛi.</char></note> lɛɛvɛni, é za,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">è è zili nuiti suvazani ga ɗa-zɛbɛsu yeei.<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa ga ɗɔnɔ, zooi ɓalaagi ɠa ga ɗɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">ta eteai, é ɓɔ su aniiti kpein ba, ɗa ɠa è ti ɓɛtɛni.<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>Ɗa ɠa è lɛkpɛmaʋɛti kpɛtɛa, nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, ta nu yeezazu ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">Taɓɔɔl gizei ta Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn gizei, ta wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi è-laaseigi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>È-yeei maaɠiliʋɛ ga zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">è yeezuɓaaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">è-yeezai wuzeɠeʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>Ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ma wuulaagi ɠa ga telebodai ta sɔledai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">Wooɠɛɠiladai ta gaamai, ta ziɛzu è ɠakalaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Ee, undaanɛ nuɓusɛ ɠa ga naati, niiti ti zoogai è maamusɛzu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta ziɛ ɗa-wozakalagi ɠa è ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>Ta ɠoozunɛ yeenɔpɛ, tɔɔzei ɗa ga ta-ƓALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">Ɗa-lelebodai zaɓui zu ɠa ta wuzeɠe la.<verse eid="PSA 89:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ti-zɛbɛi ɠulazu kɛlɛma, é volo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">è-zaalai zu ɠa gi pilɛ sɔlɔɔsu da.<verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Gi makɛ nui ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">gá-masagi ɠa Izilayɛle ná-GALA Ɲadegai yeezu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>Mɔungi, è ɓɔɛni kulakɛlɛmai zu, è ɠɛ ɗa-wooɠɛɠila nuiti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">«Gè kpɔba veeni kɔɔɠuluɓai taɠila bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">gè zunu loungoi ta wuzeɠeni nuɓusɛiti saama,<verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>gè Davide ɠaani, gè ɠɛ é ɠɛ ga nà-botiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">gè nà-gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛni ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>Nà yeeyɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">nà iɲɔdɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>Sili nuiti ti la ɠula filiba eyɛsu pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui la zeiɗa unda.<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>Nà sili nuiti kpein dɛɛvɛ tuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">gè maayoseɠe nuiti koloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>Nà-wooɠɛɠiladai ta nà-nuɓɔɠɔlaiti ta ɠɛ tɔun ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">ná-zobogi zu ɠa wɔɔlɔ, dàaseigi ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>Nà kpoloɗɛi lɔ zeezu, é zei unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">toɠa masadai ɠɛ ziɛ wolaiti unda.<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>Toɠa wooɠula mà, é ɠɛ mà:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">‹Ɗa ɠa è ga Kɛ̀ɛ, nà-GALAGI, nà-kizo fasai!›<verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>Nɔ̀un nà, nà tɔun kɛ ga dòun zunu mɔungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">nii bɔɔlɔai é leʋe masagiti kpein ba eteai zu ná pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>Nà nà-wooɠɛɠiladai makɛ bɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">nà-minazeɠegi gè boni tɔun bɛ, naa la valiboga eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>Nà mavofodai makɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa lɛbi, eɠɛ geeɠɔlɔgi.<verse eid="PSA 89:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>«Ni tanisu mavofodaiti ta ɠɛlɛna nà-tɔgi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">ti la ziɛni ga nà-deveiti,<verse eid="PSA 89:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>ti nà-deveiti koloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">ti la ɠoloni nà-tɔgiti bɛ,<verse eid="PSA 89:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>nà tukpɔi zeɠe, gè ta-lɔ koloɠologi maaɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">nà ta-vaaɠaaza golai zale ga doɠai.<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>Kɛlɛ gè la ɓega nà-nuɓɔɠɔlai ʋa tɔun bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">Gè la zeɠea nà-wooɠɛɠiladai ʋolu, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>Gè la nà-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">gè la ɓalaa naa maavaliboga ɲɛgɛlɛin, nii kulaai dàaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>Gè ɠonani, ná ɠɛ ɠila nà-ɲadedai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">ɓa-o, gè la zɛɛ woga Davide ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>Mavofodai ɠa yɛ ná ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa yɛ gàazu eɠɛ foloi,<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>toɠa zei eyɛsu ɠɔ eɠɛ alugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">nii é ga wooɠɛɠila zeelei tonaɓiingi ʋolu.»</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:38">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, è masagi yɛni na, è ɠɛlɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">nii è gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛni ma, è yiiɠaawanani ma!<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>È ɗa-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa, nii è seɠeni ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">è ná-masa bɔɔlɔgi ɠɔzɔa, è pili zooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>È zeɠei wɔa ná-siɠigiti kpein ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">è ná-siɠigiti koloɠologa.<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Teʋe nuiti kpein ti loa su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">seiɲɔɠɔiti ti ɗa ɲɛɛɠula su.<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>È sili nuiti iɲɔdɔɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">è wɔinzeɠe nuiti daave ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>È ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi zeɠeni pelei ʋa, pilisuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">è la loni polu kɔɔɠɔ ziɛgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>Ʋelei é ɠɛa volozu la, è naa ɠaaʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">è ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋiliga ya zooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>È ná-nu niinɛlai ma voloiti suɓuɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">è maaɓɔlega ga unfegi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:46">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa yɛsu dɔɔɠui zu, eyɛsu yeelɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">ɗa-yiiɠaawanai ɗa so, eɠɛ abui?<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>Ɠizɛ su ga nà-eteai zu la ɠoozani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">è nuɓusɛiti kpɛtɛʋɛ wafuun ɓaa?<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>Nui ɓɛgele ɠa a zoo é zɛnvui wo, é la saai ɠaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">Ɓɛ ɠa a zɛnvui ɠula gɔvɛalaazu ná-zobogi ya?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:49">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>Maliɠii, mini ɠa ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ná, è ti ɠɛɛni mɔungi zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zu, è ma minazeɠegi woni è ɠona Davide ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>Maliɠii, ɠizɛ ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ta-unfegi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">ɠizɛ nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti su, ti-ma ɠasɔi laani ùnma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">89:51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maliɠii, ɠizɛ ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ta-unfegi zu, ɠizɛ nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti su, ti-ma ɠasɔi laani ùnma</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Maliɠii, unfegi ma zii ʋɛtɛ, nii nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingiti ti ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti gaazuɠilizu la, ta soolɛi ti seizu mà</char></note><verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠizɛ su ga è zili nuiti ta ɓaaɠulamai ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:52">ta ɓaaɠulazu zunui naa ma, nii è gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma!<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 89:53"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:53">Amina! Amina!<verse eid="PSA 89:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="ms1">Sɛʋɛi Naanisiɛi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 90-106">Guyeiti 90—106</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Ɠigi ve gi ʋɛ, gi gá-voloiti gaalu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>GALA nui Moize, ná-GALA falii.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 90:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">Maliɠii, è ʋɔ bɛ ɠa ná ɠɛni ga gi-zeizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:1">yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>Aisa gizeiti ti ʋa zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">è ʋa zooi ta eteai ɓɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">ɗa ga GALA, ɠɔoɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>Ɗa nui ɠaaɠalesu ma fufiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">ɗa ɠɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">«À ɠale ma náʋɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kona waagilagi (1.000) ɠa è ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">eɠɛ wogi voloi nii teʋegai na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">eɠɛ lɛlɛi tanigaani ti ɠɛai kpidii.<verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>Ɗa nuɓusɛiti zɛʋɛzu, eɠɛ ɲiimɛni goi nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">ti ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ tufa lɛnugi, nii é leʋesu.<verse eid="PSA 90:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>É ʋuazu sobui, é leʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">kpɔkɔi, é ʋoolo, é vɔ.<verse eid="PSA 90:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>Ɗa-yiiɠaawanai gi ɠalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">ɗa-yiiɠulagi ɠa gi maaluazu.<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>È gá-vaaɠaaza golaiti kpein pua ɠakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">niiti kpein gi ɠɛa ti lɔɔɠuzu, è naati pua ɗa-wozakalagi ɠa è ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gá-voloiti ta ɲɛɛlɛzu ga ɗa-yiiɠaawanai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">gá-ɠonagiti ta leʋesu fala eɠɛ nu ɓala goo ɠilagi.<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>Gá-ɠonagi liegɔi ɠa ga kona ʋuulɔfela (70),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">ni zɔi sulogai, kona ʋuulɔsaʋa (80).</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">Kɛlɛ naati ta ziɛzu kpɔlɔi zu, ta nimizai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">yeeɠɛɠalai ɠa leʋesu gaamanɔ, ta gá ɠoʋesu, gi ɗa li saai ʋɔ pelei.<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a ɗa-yiiɠaawanai zuzɔligi ɠwɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">Ɓɛ ɠa é è lɛbizu gola, é ɠizɛ ɗa-yiiɠulagi zu?<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>Gi ɠala ga gi gá-voloiti gaalu ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">naa ɠa a kɛ gi ɠimalai zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠale ma gi ʋɔ. Ɗa yɛsu nɛkɛsu, eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Gi maawɔinɠa, gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti!<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Geelaa ɠa laona nɔ feya, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai lɛ ga giye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">naazu gá guyei loo ga koozunɛɛi gi-zii ma voloi pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Koozunɛ voloiti fe gi ya, gá-ʋoluɠula voloiti potogi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">koozunɛ ɠonagiti fe gi ya, gá-maanɔɠɔ ɠonagiti potogi zu.<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>Ɗa-ɠɛɛwotii ɠula kɛlɛma gi ʋɛ, gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">gi-mavofodaiti ti è wɔɔlɔ ʋelei ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>Maliɠii gá-ƓALAGI ná-wɔinlai ɠɛ gi pɛ ba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">Kulanuma ɠɛ gá-wotiiti ba, nii a yɛ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">ungo, kulanuma ɠɛ gá-wotiiti ba, nii a yɛ ná.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s">Nu lɔɔɠuzu ʋagɔi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>Zɔi é zeini, nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-dooɠo bosuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">naa ɠa looɠosu Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-niinigi wu.<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>Gè ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ, ta nà-siɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">nà-GALAGI nii gè ɠalivaai ma!»<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>Ungo, tɔ ɠa é è unmɔɔsu, é è ɠula balii ɠa tɛai è luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">ta ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi, ta ná-faa zuɠoloɠologiti.<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>Toɠa è maalɔɔɠu koʋegiti bu, ɗa lɔɔɠu kpeɠabuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">ná-gaamai ɠa ga kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi, kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai é è makɛsu.<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>È la lua ani nɔpɛ ba, anɛɛ kpidii zu maalua vai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">ɓaa mɛɛin nii é ɠoʋesu ga foloi,<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>anɛɛ ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi, nii é ziɛzu kpidii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">ɓaa pili ma zeeɓɛi, nii é nuiti doɠazu foloi a gaalɔna.<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>Waagila ka loo è ɠobaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">waapuugɔ (10.000) è yeezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">kɛlɛ tanɔpɛ ge la zeelia è ma.<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>Ɗa ɠaazulaalao nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">è zoo è faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti salai ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>Ungo, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">Nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, è naa ɠɛa ga è-ʋoluzeigi.<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>Faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ ge la zeelia è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">maanɔɠɔ nɔpɛ ge la zeelia ɗa-ʋɛlɛi ma.<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa devei ve ná-geezuɠeelaiti zea ɗa-vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:11">ga ti ɓaa è maazu ɗa-ʋeleiti kpein su.<verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>Ta è la yeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">nii a kɛ è-ɠɔɠɔi mina ziɠa kɔtu ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>Ɗa ziɛ zalai ta pɛɛɠaalii ma, faa nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa ga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">ɗa ɠɔɠɔlo zala yiʋoi ta kaali ɲɔi ma.<verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>Maliɠii ɠɛ ma: «Tɔɔzei giliʋɛ nɔ̀un ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">nà kizosu, gè makɛ ma, mazɔlɔɔ é kwɛ̀ɛ.<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>Toɠa wooɠula mà, nà gooɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">ungo, nà ɠɛ tɔun ba, kidaaʋiligi ma ziɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">nà unmɔɔ, gè bɔɔlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>Nà sii zuɠooza, daazeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">gè dɛɛ la, ga nà ga ná-kizo nui.»<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s">Pagɛ ga nu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Guyei. Dooɠo foloi ma wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>Pagɛ ga nu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">nu è maamusɛ ga guye wooi, ɗɛi è Anii-Pɛ-Unda!<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>Pagɛ ɓalaa ga nu ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai laazeeli vai lɔɔzei sobui nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">ta ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai laazeeli kpɔkɔi,<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>gɛingɛin ganigi galu puugɔi ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">ta papai, ta kɔnigi.<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa kòozunɛɛzu naa ʋɔ, nii è kɛɛzu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">Nà wooɠulazu ga koozunɛɛi è-yeei ná-kpɛtɛaniiti faa zu.<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti bɔɔlɔʋɛ, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">Ɗa-ɠisiɛiti polu ɠoozaʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>Nui ɠi ge la ma, é la kwɛɛ tago pa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">ɠimalala nui la ma ɠeleɠele sɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>Anɛɛ ni nu ɲɔiti ta ʋɔnɔsu eɠɛ tufa lɛnugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti ɗa ɓɔvɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:8">ti undaa ɠa ʋili eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>Kɛlɛ, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">ɗa ɠa è masadai ɠɛɛzu eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è zili nuiti pɛtɛ, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">Mazɔlɔɔ è zili nuiti pɛtɛ, ti undaa ɠa ʋilisu ɲɛgɛlɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">niiti kpein ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu, ta vazasu.<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>Ɗa sɛ̀bɛi wɔɔlɔzu, eɠɛ teɠui nɔnɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛ niinɛi ɠa ziɛzu mà.<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>Gàazu logɛ zobo sɔlɔɔ fai ʋa sìli nuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">gòilogɛ nu ɲɔiti kpain gooi ma, niiti ti wuzeɠezu dàalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>Telebo nuiti ta ʋɔnɔsu eɠɛ dɔɔ wului,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">ti wuzeɠe eɠɛ Liɓan sɛdele guluiti.<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>Ti ziingɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">ti ɗa wɔɔlɔ gá-ƓALAGI ná-koizuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>Ta ɓuɠuzu ti wɔlɔzaɠa siɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">ti laavegɛ ga zɛbɛi, ti-ma wundui ɠɛ ti zu,<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 92:16"/>ta dɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɔlegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:16">tɔ ɠa é ga nà-fasai, telebotala ɠila kpalaa ge la tɔun su.<verse eid="PSA 92:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu eyɛsu ɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu, maaɠiliai ga maayikii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">maaɠiliʋɛ, é zobogi ɠɛ ga saamaɠiligi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">Naa ɠa é ba, eteai ɠa loni kpaan, é la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 93:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>Kaite ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa loni kpaan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">ɗa ná kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ!<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ziɛiti ta lɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">ziɛiti ta wooɠulazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">ti zulu gooi ɠa ɠulazu.<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>É ɓudɛ ziɛ wolaiti gooi maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">é ɓudɛ kpoloɗɛi ma lakpatakpagi maayikiaiti maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa zeini naati pɛ unda geezuʋɛ, é vizɔ ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>Ɗa-leveiti sɔlegɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">È zei ʋɛlɛi maanɛɛʋɛ, é ɲade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, eyɛsu ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ɗa telebotala vaiti potokula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>GALA nii é faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui zalazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">GALA nii é faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui zalazu, ɠula kɛlɛma!<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Ee, wuzeɠe, eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe nui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">È fe waso nuiti zea, eɠɛʋelei ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti ti la!<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta ná, eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:3">Ta pilɛ sɔlɔɔsu mɔnɔ, eyɛsu yeelɛ?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Ti ɗa kpɔɛi zuɠula, ti ɓɔɛ ga wasogi gaazumaavɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:4">tɛiti kpein ti telebotalai ɠɛɛzu, ta ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu su.<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>Ta ɗa-nuɓusɛiti nimizazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">ti naati pɛlɛʋɛlɛ, niiti ti ga ɗa-nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>Ta poanzai ta seikɔɠɔma nu ʋaazu ga kɛɛɠɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:6">ti podointi paa.<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>Ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la kaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI la ɠidaazu bu!»<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>À dama, ɠimalala nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">nuiti ta-ɠisiɛi ɓuɠaai, yeelɛ ɠa wa kisiɛ ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔ da?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>Zɔi é nu woii ɓɛtɛa, naa la faa mɛniga ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Zɔi é nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ɓɛtɛa, naa la wozaɠa ɓaa?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>Tɔungi é zii ɠiligiti maaɠolozu, é la zooga é ʋa salai wo ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">Tɔungi é nuɓusɛiti kalasu, é la zooga é ʋa keleɠelegi zɔlɔɔ ɓaa?<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠisiɛiti kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">ta nɔ ga faa ɲaka.<verse eid="PSA 94:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii è maaɠolozu, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">è kalasu ga ɗa-lɔgi,<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>è dooɠogi ve bɛ, siɛgi zu maanɔɠɔi a zeeli la ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">názu ma zeɠei wɔa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui luɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ eyɛsu pɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ná-nuɓusɛiti pilɛga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">É la ɠɛlɛa nɔnɔi ta ʋa pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tukpɔi ɠaa ɠa ʋaazu leʋezu ga niinɛ, ga telebodai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">niiti kpein ti-yii zɔlegai, naati tosu ɠa ɓɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é wuzeɠeni bɛ̀ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti daalɔɠɔma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Ɓɛ ɠa é loni bɛ̀ naati daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti telebotala vai ɠɛɛzu?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>Ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɠɛni ɓɔni bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">é ga gè lia gaalɛi adaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu la ma: «Kɔ̀ɠɔi ɠa na ɓunɛ bù,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ɠɛni ga pòluzeigi.<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>Siɛgi zu ziizoolɛ mɔinmɔingi wuzeɠezu la zìimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">è gàanɛɛnɛni, è kòozunɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>Kpɔfaama ɠa nɛi wo yɔɠɔzu, wa tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti, niiti ti la leleboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">ti maanɔɠɔi ɓɛtɛzu tɔgi ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛ vai zu?<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>Ta ɓɔsu su, ti wuzeɠe telebo nui yɛnvui laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">ti sɔbalala nui ʋeelala, ti ɠɛ é za.<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é nɔ̀un ma ga siɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">nà-GALAGI ɠa é ga fasai, nii gè lɔɔɠuzu bu.<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>Toɠa ta-ɠotoiti kula ti zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">toɠa ti ɠoloɠolo ta-zuɲɔi ɓɔɠɔi nɔ zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Ungo, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ada-ƓALAGI ɠa ti pɛ koloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s">Eteai ɠa zeini GALA zeezaamaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Ade li, de guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">Ade wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi ade ɠizo fasai ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>Ade li, de lo gaazu, de mama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">de dɛbi ga guyeiti.<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠa ga GALAGI bɔɔlɔai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">toɠa ga masa golai, nii é zeini galagiti unga.<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>Eteai ma yeɠe ɓomaʋɛ pɛ ka zoni zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">gizeiti sokpaiti ta ga nɔnɔ.<verse eid="PSA 95:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>Kpoloɗɛi ɠa ga nɔnɔ, tɔ ɠa é kpɛtɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">zooi ɓalaagi, zeei ɠa é kpɛtɛni.<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>À ʋa, ade nɔkɔ bu, ade maayei tɔun bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">ade ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii é ade ɓɛtɛa.<verse eid="PSA 95:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa ga da-ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">da ga ná-baalagiti é ti ɠɔnɔkulazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">baala kpulugi nii é losu tuɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Ni wa gooi mɛnina za,<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>à mina wo-ɠigiti kpa, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛɛni la Meliɓa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">95:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛti: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Ɛgz 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">GlS 20:2-13</ref></char>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">eɠɛʋelei naama voloi é ɠɛɛni Masa, teʋebai zu,<verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>ʋɛ wo-mɛmɛwolani ti tɛ̀ɛni ga ná, ti sùɠɔɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">anɛɛ ni ti nà-kɛɛwotiiti kaani.<verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>Kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu, niima yamanii wɔinzeɠeni mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">eyɛsu gè ɠɛ ma: «Nuɓusɛa ʋe, ti ɠakagɛ ti-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">ti la nà-peleiti kwɛɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, nà-ziiɠaawanai zu, gè ɠonani ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">«Ti la lɔa nà-dooɠogi zu!»<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s">Eteai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi, <optbreak/> nii é ga ná-masagi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>À guye niinɛi loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">Eteai zu nuɓusɛiti kpein, à guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>À guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">folo-o-folo, à ná-kizo fai ma woo niinɛ ʋagɔi laazeeli!<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>À ná-lɛbiyai ɠula kɛlɛma ziiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">ta kɛɛwoti maayikiaiti nuɓusɛiti saama!<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔɔlɔʋɛ, tɔ ɠa maamusɛi kpein soloogai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">maayikiʋɛ é leʋe gala kiligiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠalagiti pɛ ta ga zɛɛ ɠalagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛni.<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>Toɠa volozu ná-bɔɔlɔi ta ná-maayikii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">zobogi ta padai ta seizu ɲadegai.<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>Nuɓusɛiti kpein zooi ɠa, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">wo ná-lɛbiyai ta ná-zɛbɛi ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>À lɛbiyai ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laasei golai ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">À ʋa ga vebɛaniiti, wo lɛ ná-koizuʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>À ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa, wo nɔkɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wu, ná-ɲadedai ma voloi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">Eteai zu nuɓusɛiti kpein, à ɓali gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>À dɛɛ ga zii ɠiligiti pɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Eteai ɠa loni kpaan, é la ɲiikpiga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">GALA ka etea nuɓusɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu ga sɔledai.<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Geeɠɔlɔgiti ti ɠoozunɛ, eteai ɠɛ koozunɛ wolai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">kpoloɗɛi zikɔ, ta bu aniiti kpein.<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>Dɔɓɔi ɠoozunɛ, ta su aniiti kpein!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">Dɔɓɔzu wuluiti kpein ti wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi <verse eid="PSA 96:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ʋaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">toɠa ʋaazu é eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Toɠa eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe ga telebodai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">toɠa nuɓusɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe ga gaamai.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s">GALAGI nii é eteai pɛ unda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu! Eteai ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">ziɛ zaama yooiti ti ɠoozunɛ!<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>Tonaɓiingiti ta kpidii ti ɠooliʋɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">Telebodai ta sɔledaiti ka ti ga ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋoluzeigi.<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Abui ɠa ziɛzu kakalaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">naa ɠa é sili nuiti galazu maaɠoolii zu.<verse eid="PSA 97:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>Ná-mainmainti ta eteai zuɠalasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">eteai kaani, é ɓali ga duai.<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Gizeiti gaa ɠa wuunsu eɠɛ kedoi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">eteai kpein Maliɠii ɠakala.<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Geeɠɔlɔgiti ta ná-telebodai lɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta ná-lɛbiyai ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>Ta ɠɛ unfegi zu, niiti kpein ti nɔkɔsu vololibaiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">niiti ti wasosu zɛɛ ɠalagiti ta-vaa zu, ti ti ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">Wɔiti wo ga gala kiligiti kpein, à nɔkɔ Maliɠii wu!<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Ma wooi ɠa mɛni Siyɔn, ti ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">Zuda laaiti kpein ta ɠɛ koozunɛɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">tɔɔzei ɗa-lukpɔɠaaleʋeiti ba, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è Anii-Pɛ-Unda eteai kpein maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">è-yee ɠa gala kiligiti kpein maazu.<verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Wɔiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɛai wo ʋɛ, à faa ɲɔi wɔinzeɠe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">Toɠa naati zɛnvui makɛsu, niiti ti ga wooɠɛɠila nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">toɠa ti unmɔɔ, é ti ɠula faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti zea.<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>Wozakalagi vazagɛ telebo nui ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">ta koozunɛɛi naati bɛ, niiti ti-yii zɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Telebo nuiti, à ɠoozunɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">wo daasei ɲadegai maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ʋaazu é eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>Guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 98:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">À guye niinɛi loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">mazɔlɔɔ é laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">É kizogi woni ga ná-zobogi, ta ná-gaaɓaa ɲadegai.<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ná-kizo fai lɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">é ná-telebodai lɛ ga zii ɠiligiti.<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>É ɠizɛni ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai zu, ta ná-wooɠɛɠiladai Izilayɛle ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">Eteai ɠwɛgi kpein ge ada-ƓALAGI ná-kizo fai ɠaani.<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Eteai zu nuɓusɛiti kpein à wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">wa-ɠoozunɛɛi zu, à guyei loo.<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ga papai wooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:5">à naa ɠɛ papai wooi ʋɔ, ta guye wooiti.<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>À maamusɛ ga puʋu gooi, ta baala minɛ ʋuʋugi wooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">à ɠoozunɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, nii é ga Masagi!<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Kpoloɗɛi zikɔ, ta bu aniiti kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">eteai ta su aniiti kpein ɓalaa.<verse eid="PSA 98:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Ziɛ wolaiti ti yealoɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">gizeiti ti ɓɔsu, ti guyei loo ga koozunɛɛi<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ʋaazu é eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">Toɠa eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe ga telebodai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">ta nuɓusɛiti ga sɔledai.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s">À nɔkɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wu, <optbreak/> mazɔlɔɔ ɲadegɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">nuɓusɛiti sasu ɠa ɓalizu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">Toɠa ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi zeini seeluɓɛinti unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">zooi ɠa ɲiikpisu.<verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔɔlɔʋɛ Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">buzeɠeʋɛ gola, é zei nuɓusɛiti kpein unda.<verse eid="PSA 99:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti maamusɛ, tɔ ɠa é ga GALA golai, maayikiai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">mazɔlɔɔ ɲadegɛ!<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Ti è-zɛbɛi maamusɛ, masagi nii telebodai nɛai bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">Ungo, ɗa ɠa è sɔle faiti seiɗai kpasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">è telebogi ta faa zɔlegai zei Izilayɛle zaama.<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>À ada-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-bɔɔlɔlai ɠula kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">à nɔkɔ bu, ná-kɔɠɔloma anii ɠakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">mazɔlɔɔ ɲadegɛ!<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Moize ta Aalɔn, ti ɠɛni ga ná-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Samiyɛle ɠɛni naati saama, niiti ti ɠɛni wooɠulazu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">ti wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, é ti wooɠaaʋoteni.<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>É yɛni tonaɓiingi zu, é ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">ti ná-tɔgiti soni ta ná-deveiti, niiti é ti veeni ti ya.<verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gá-ƓALAGI, ɗa ɠa è ti wooɠaaʋoteni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">è ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga maavaayɛ bo GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">kɛlɛ è ti loɠani ta-vaa ɲɔiti faa zu.<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-bɔɔlɔlai ɠula kɛlɛma, ada-ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">à nɔkɔ bu, ná-gize ɲadegai ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">Mazɔlɔɔ ɲadegɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, da-ƓALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti ti maamusɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛ guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 100:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:1">À wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, eteai kpein!<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi ga koozunɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">à ʋa pɔ bɛ ga koozunɛ wuyeiti toa!<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>À suɠwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠila ka é ga GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">Tɔ ɠa é de ɓɛtɛa, da ga nɔnɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">da ga ná-nuɓusɛiti, ná-baala kpulugi é kɔnɔkulazu.<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>À lɛ ná-siɠidaʋɛti ga faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛgaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">à lɛ ná-koizuʋɛti ga maamusɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">À dɛbi, wo mamagi ve bɛ!<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋagɛ, ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠa ná eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">ta ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɓela ge la ba, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠegi é lo faa ɲɔi zakpe fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">Nà wooɠɛɠiladai ta telebodai ma wuyei loozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">nà naa ɠɛɛzu è lɛbi vai ma ga guyei, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>Nà ʋilɛ sɔle nuiti ta-ʋelei ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Yeelɛ ɠa è ʋaazu la pɔ̀ bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Nà ziɛ ga zii ʋagɔlai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">nà-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>Gè la ʋɔɔpɛa faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛ vaa nɔpɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">Kidaaleʋelala luʋai maayo ge la nɔ̀un bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">gè la yeezeiɗa naa tanɔpɛ bu.<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>Yaava ɠisiɛi maaɠooza nɔ̀un ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">gè la faa ɲɔu ɠwɛɛga.<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>Nui é vaazu seiɲɔɠɔi ma dɔɔɠuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">nà daaɠulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">nui nii gaazulɛai, ziimaʋɛ laavegai ga wasogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">gè la yeezeiɗa naa wu.<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>Nà ɠaazulo sɔle nuiti ba, ti zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">gè ti zei ɠoba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">Niiti ti ziɛzu ga sɔle nuiti kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">naati ta ɠɛ nà-botii zu.<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>Yaava nu la zeizu zɔlɔɔga nà-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">zɔi é ga zɛɛ wo nui, naa la losu zɔlɔɔga gàazu.<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Sobu-o-sobu, nà faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti daaɠulu ti zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">naa ɠa a kɛ, gè ti ɓeteʋe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-taai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">tɛiti kpein ti telebotala vai ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s">Maawɔin nui ná-GALA falii</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>Maawɔin nui ná-GALA falii, siɛgi zu suvikɛi ɓegai la, é ɗa ná-kpalai lɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">nà-kpee wooiti ti zeeli è ma!<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>Mina ɠaazulɔɔɠu bà, nà-kidaaʋili foloi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">Woilo gòoi ma, voloi nà kpee loo la!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">Suvilɛ ga gòoɠaaʋotega!<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà-eteai ɠa ɲɛɛlɛzu eɠɛ duului,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">abui ɠa mà ɠaeiti ba, eɠɛ abulekai.<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ tufai teʋeai ga, é la foloi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">zekana zìi vɔai la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">Nà yeemazu nà-daami wo fai ma.<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Gè yɛga kpalagi wosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:6">kɔ̀lɔgi ɠataga mà ɠaeiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>Gè ɠɛa eɠɛ teʋebai zu ɠoɠɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">gè ɠɛ eɠɛ buungi, nii é zeini ada zuɠoloɠologaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>Nà ɠaazuɓaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">eɠɛ wɔni goi, nii tɔ ɠila ge zeini pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>Foloi pɛ daawu, sìli nuiti ta ɓaaɠulazu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">ti ɗa ɲɛɛɠula nɔ̀un su, ti ɗa zɔiti foovo ga ti maanɔɠɔ ga kɛ̀ʋele.<verse eid="PSA 102:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>Zuʋui ɠa é ga dàamianigi, ɓului ʋotogi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">Nà nà-kpɔɔle ɗɛi zupuzu ga gàazuɗɛi,<verse eid="PSA 102:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>ɗa-yiimaleʋei maaʋele ma, ta ɗa-yiiɠulagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">mazɔlɔɔ è sòga, è pìli ya.<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>Sìi ma voloiti maa ɠa yeizu eɠɛ kpɔkɔmaʋɛ niinigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">gè ɠɛa eɠɛ tufai é vɔɔzu.<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa masadai ɠɛɛzu eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">è-lɔɠɔi ɠa yɛsu ná, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>Ɗa wuzeɠe, è Siyɔn maawɔinɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">mazɔlɔɔ yeeɠɛɠalai soloogai ga è zaalai la ma la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">yeeɠɛɠalai teʋeai ba, naa zeelia.<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti, ná-kɔtuiti nɛɛʋɛ gi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">ma vufiligi maawɔin ɠa gi zosu.<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Zii ɠiligiti ta Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">eteai zu masagiti kpein ta ná-lɛbiyai ɠwɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Siyɔn losu da ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɛ náʋɛ ná-lɛbiyai zu.<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>Niiti ti maawɔinɗai, é la naati ta-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ʋɛlɛʋiliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">é la ɠɛlɛa ta-ƓALA falii ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>Naama vaiti ti zɛʋɛ, é makɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ma nuiti tuɠɔ ti ʋaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">nuɓusɛiti ti ʋaazu ɓɛtɛzu, naati ta Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛni zeini seizu ɲadegai ungaʋɛ, é wɛlɛ buu ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">é yɛni geezuʋɛ, é ɠaazulo eteai ʋa,<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>é kasoɠa nuiti kpala gooiti mɛnini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">é ʋa é ti undaaʋili galui vie ti ma, ti mina za,<verse eid="PSA 102:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maawoo ziɛ Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">ta ná-maamusɛ wooi wo Zeluzalɛme,<verse eid="PSA 102:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>siɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti ti ɠaalɛɛzu ba la náʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:23">ta masadaiti ta nɔkɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wu ná.<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>É sɛ̀bɛi zuɠoloɠologa pele zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">é sìi leʋea kpasu.<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gè kpeei loozu la, gè ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">«Nà-GALAGI, mina pàa, nà-eteai zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">ɗɛi è ná, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su!<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>Kaite è eteai lɔɔɓadɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa ga è-yeei ná-kpɛtɛanii.<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>Ta ɲɛɛlɛ, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa ná eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">Ti pɛ ta wɔlɔzaɠa eɠɛ seɠei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">è ti maavalibo, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɗa seɠei maavalibo da, ta ɲɛɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ɗa yɛsu ɠɛʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">ɗa-ɠonagiti ti la ɓega ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 102:29"/>Ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ti-lointi ta zeizu zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:29">ɗa ɠaazuyɛ ti-mavofodaiti ba, ti zei kpaan.»<verse eid="PSA 102:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s">Nà-nuɓusɛlai pɛ <optbreak/> ge Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 103:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">Nà-nuɓusɛlai pɛ ge Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">Kɛ̀ʋelei pɛ ge daasei ɲadegai mama!<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>Nà-nuɓusɛlai pɛ ge Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">gè la yeemaa ná-faanɛɛi gila kpalaa ma.<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é nà-faaɠaaza golaiti kpein suvaayɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">tɔ ɠa é nà-seeɓɛiti kpein kɛdɛsu,<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>é kìzoga kabayeɠei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">é ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ta ná-maawɔinɠai ɠɛ ùnba ga bɔɔlɔgi,<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>toɠa nà-eteai laave ga undaanɛɛiti kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">é nìinɛ eɠɛ koɠɛi.<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa faaɠaaza faiti sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">é sɔle fai ɠɛ naati bɛ, niiti nuiti ti ti nimizazu.<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>É ná-peleiti dɛɛni ga Moize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">é ná-faa wolaiti dɛɛni ga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti.<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é zaalai veezu, é ɠɛ ga maawɔinɠaa ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">zii la ɠula fala, kpɛtɛai wooɠɛɠiladai zu.<verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>É la ɗa ga zelii loga yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">é la ɗa ga faawana makɛga ziimaʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>É la de zosu ga da-ɠotoiti kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">é la de zalazu ga da-vaaɠaaza golaiti kɛʋele.<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>Ʋele geeɠɔlɔgi maaɠooza la zooi ʋa, é zɛlɛni maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">zekana ná-wooɠɛɠiladai wɔɔlɔai la naati bɛ, niiti ti luazu ba.<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>Ʋelei folo ɠulazu maaɠoozaai la folo liizuʋɛ ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">pele ɠana é da-lɔ koloɠologiti maaɠoozazu la de ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>Ʋelei doun kɛɛɠɛi ná-dointi nɛai la bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI naati nɛɛʋɛ ʋɛ ɠana nɔ, niiti ti luazu ba.<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é kwɛɛ, nii de ɓɛtɛai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">ki ka su ga da ga fufiligi.<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>Nui! Ná-eteai ʋokɔɠɔgɛ tufai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">nii é ʋuazu dɔɓɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>Siɛgi zu fiilɛi ʋuuzu la ma, é ɲɛɛlɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">adaʋɛ é ɠɛni ná, miná la mɔ faa ɠwɛɛ ná-fai zu.<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-wooɠɛɠiladai la valiboga ɠɔoɠɔ, naati bɛ, niiti ti luazu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">ná-telebodai ɠa ná, naati ti-lounlointi bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>Toɠa ga naati tɔnɔ, niiti ti ziɛzu ga ná-minazeɠe gooiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">ti ɠizɛ ná-deveiti su, ti ziɛ ga tiye.<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa zeini geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">toɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu anii pɛ unda.<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama, wɔi wo ga ná-geezuɠeelaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">wɔi wo zulogai zobogi zu, wo ɠolozu daawooi ʋɛ, nii é bosu wo ɗa kɛ!<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama, wɔi wo ga geezu ɠɔɔɓɔgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">wɔi wo ná-botii ma, wo ziima vaiti kɛɛzu!<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama, ná-kpɛtɛaniiti kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">ʋɛ kpein nɔ é masadai ɠɛɛzu ná!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 103:22"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">Nà-nuɓusɛlai pɛ ge Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s">Mamagi ɠa anii kpein kpɛtɛ ƓALAGI ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>Nà-nuɓusɛlai pɛ ge Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, è wɔɔlɔʋɛ kwɛ ge la ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">È maaɠiliʋɛ, è ɗa volo ga maayikii.<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>È ɓɔɠɔ maaɠiliʋɛ ga wozakalagi eɠɛ seɠei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">È geeɠɔlɔgi zuvie eɠɛ seɠe ʋɛlɛi.<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>È è-zeizuʋɛ loni geezuʋɛ ziɛiti maazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">ɗa ɗa tonaɓiingiti kɛ ga ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">è fiilɛi ɠɔma, é ɗa li ga ɗe.<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>È fiilɛi ɠɛ ga ɗa-ɠeelai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">è abuzogiti kɛ ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ aniiti.<verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>È eteai loni ma wuulaagiti maazu kpaan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">nii a kɛ é mina ɲiikpi eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>È maaɓɔleni ga kpoloɗɛi, eɠɛ seɠei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">ziɛiti ti gizeiti maaɓɔleni.<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Siɛgi zu è zelii loni da ziɛiti ma, ti ʋelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">ti ɓizɛni è-wooi ʋa, nii é ɠɛni eɠɛ tona ɓunɛ tugi,<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>ti lɛɛni gizeiti ma, ti yei nɛmɛiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">eyɛsu ti zeeli adaʋɛ, ʋɛ è ná leʋeni ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>È ziɛiti kwɛgi laaʋɛ, nii ti la ɓudɛa maazu eyɛsu pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">naa ɠa a kɛ, ti mina ʋa, ti ʋa eteai maaɓɔle mɔnɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>Ɗa ɠa è ziɛungiti ma ɗɛiti zeizu pɛtugiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">ti ɗa yei gizeiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛti.<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>Miná ɠa dɔɓɔ zuaiti kpein ta ɗa ʋa, ti ɓɔɔle ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">ná ɠa dɔɓɔzu zoovalegiti ta ɗa ʋa, ti ɓɔɔle ná.<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Wɔniiti ti laɠagiti to ná ɠobaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:12">ti ɗa guyeiti too, ti ʋuuni guluiti su.<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>È-zeizuʋɛ geezuʋɛ, miná ɠa è tonai zeɠezu ná, é ʋu gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">è eteai laave ga ɗa-ɠulanumai, nii é ga è-yeei ná-botii.<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>Ɗa ɠa è tufai ʋɔnɔsu toganiiti bɛ, ta siinziin ganigiti nuiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu ga tiye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">Zekana ti-laamianigi zɔlɔɔsu da zooi ʋa,<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>ga dɔɔi nii é nuiti koozunɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">ta gulɔi nii é ti-ɠaazuʋɛ volozu ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">ta ɓului nii é ti-zuvikɛi niinɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-guluiti ta ziɛi zɔlɔɔsu ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">Liɓan sɛdele guluiti é ti ziinni.<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Wɔni goiti ta ʋaazu ti laɠagi lo ti zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">wɔni é ga sigɔɲegi, naa zeizuʋɛ ɠa ga gului naati su, niiti ti ga sipɛlɛgiti.<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Dɔɓɔ woliiti ta ɗa ɠɛ gize ɠaaɠoozagiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">fasaiti ti ɠɛ ga foevoegoiti dɔɔɠuzuʋɛti.<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>Ɗa ɠa è alugi ɓɛtɛa, é ɗa yeeɠɛɠalaiti dɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">foloi daa yeeɠɛɠalai ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>Ɗa ʋaazu ga kpidii, wɛlɛ kuai ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">dɔɓɔzu aniiti kpein ta ɗa botii ɠɛɛ la,<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>zala ɓokpagiti ta ɗa zikɔ niina ta-laamianigiti polu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">ti ɗa ti-laamianigi ɠaiziɛ GALA zea.<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Siɛgi zu foloi ɠulazu la, ta ɗa ɠaaɠale ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">ti li ti la ta-yeɠeiti su.<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Nui ɠa ɗa ɠula, é li ná-tii ɠɛɛzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">é yɛ ná-botii ma, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli.<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti wola mɔinʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">È ti pɛ kpɛtɛʋɛ ga ɠimalai, eteai zulaavegɛ ga ɗa-ɓɛtɛanii.<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Kpoloɗɛ wolai ʋɛtɛ, nu la kpela kaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">fuluaniiti ti bu, nu la ti-lie kwɛɛga, ma wolaiti ta ma goiti,<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>ɓatoiti ti ɗa ziɛ ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">ta ziɛ wu zua maayikiai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">nii è kpɛtɛai ga é ɗa ɠaɠo ná.<verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>Fuluanii naati kpein kitogɛ ɗa nɔ è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:27">ga è ti-laamianigi ve ti ya, ma yeeɠɛɠalai ma.<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>Ɗa feena ti ya, ta ɗa seɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">ɗa yeaviena, ta ɗa yiɠo ga ani ʋagɔi naati.<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa ʋoluavena ti ʋa, ti zasu ɠa ɗa ɓali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">ɗa fiilɛi ɠulana ti ya, ta za,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">ti ɠale ma, ti ɠɛ ga fufiligi.<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Ɗa ɗa-viilɛi leʋena, ta ɓɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">è zooi ɠaaʋɛ niinɛ ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai yɛ ná ɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">É ɠoozunɛ ná-kɛɛwotiiti saama!<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>A ɠaazulona eteai ʋa, zooi ɠa ɓali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">a vɔɔɠuna gizeiti ba, ta ɠala.<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Nà pɔ gè ɗa guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nà-eteai pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">nà guyei loo nà-GALAGI ʋɛ, sìi ma voloi pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>Nà-kidafaawu wuyei nɛ tɔun bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">Nɔ̀un nà, nà ɠoozunɛɛzu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Kotoba nuiti ti ɠula eteai ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu mina mɔ ɠɛ ná!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">Nà-nuɓusɛlai pɛ ge Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-wooɠɛɠiladai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, wo wooɠula, wo dɛɛ ga toɠa ga GALA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">wo kɛɛ vaa wolaiti dɛɛ ziiti saama!<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>À guyei loo tɔun bɛ, wo maamusɛ ga gɛingɛin ganigiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">À kɛɛwoti maayikiaiti kpein dɛɛ!<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>À ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ ga GALA daasei ɲadegai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">Niiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaiziɛzu, naati ti ɠoozunɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaiziɛ ta ná-zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">wɔin ɠɛ wo ma ga wo ɠɛ gaazu yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5"/>À ɠizɛ kɛɛwoti maayikiaiti su, é ti ɠɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">maaɓɛlɛ vaiti, ta ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋeiti,<verse eid="PSA 105:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6"/>wɔiti wo ga ná-botiɠɛ nui Abalaame mavofodaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">wɔi wo ga Zakɔɓe ná-dointi, wɔi é yiimazeɠeai ga woye!<verse eid="PSA 105:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>Ada-ƓALAGI ɠa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">toɠa deve eteai pɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>Ki ka ná-minazeɠegi zu yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">wooi nii é fea yamani waagila (1.000) su nuɓusɛiti zea,<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>minazeɠegi é boni Abalaame ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:9">ta ná-kona wooi ɠɛ de Izaake ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>É kɛ ga devei Zakɔɓe ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">é ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ minazeɠegi Izilayɛle ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>É ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:11">«Nà Kanaan yooi veezu è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:11">toɠa ɠɛ ga wɔnɔi wo sɔlɔɔsu.»<verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>Ti lɔini gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">ti goa nɔ ɠɛni de, ti ná ga wɛɛinti ti seikɔɠɔmai zu,<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>ti ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu, ziiti pɔ bɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">ta masadaiti pɔ bɛti.<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge la ɠɛni ti yɛni na nu nɔpɛ ge ʋa ti maanɔɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">ti makɛ vai ɠa é masagiti doɠani la.<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>É ɠɛni ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">«À mina naati sopele ɲɔu, niiti gè yiimazeɠeai ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">à mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ga dàawoo laazeeli nuiti.»<verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>É pului looni zooi zu ná pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">é daamiani fai ɠaaʋalani ba ti ya.<verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>É zunu ɠila teʋeni ti luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">Zozɛfe, nii é ʋɔdini, é ɠɛ ga duɔi.<verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>Ti daani kpeɠɔi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">ti kɔlu yɔlɔɠɔi ʋili kɔgi ʋa,<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>eyɛsu naama voloi zeeli, Zozɛfe wooi laazeeli, nii é boni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">Názu ɠa wooi nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni, naa dɛɛni la ga gaamai ɠɛni tɔun zea.<verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>Masagi, nii é ga nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">naa devei veeni ga ti fie, ti yeeɓeni ba.<verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>É seini ga ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ma ɠundiɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">ta é kɛ ga kundiɠii naati kpein unda, niiti ti ɠɛni zeezu,<verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>ga é ɗa masagi ná-kundiɠi wolaiti kala, ʋelei nɛai la bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">é ɗa ná-nu wolaiti kala ga ɠimalai.<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>Naa ʋoluma, Izilayɛle liini Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">Zakɔɓe ɠɛni ga seikɔɠɔma nu Same ná-zooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>GALA ge ná-nuɓusɛiti maamɔinni gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">é ti-zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔ, é leʋe ti zili nuiti tɔnɔi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>É ti-ɠigi valiboni, wɔinzeɠemai lɔ ti-yiimaʋɛ ná-nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">ti ɗa ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti yaava.<verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>Názu ɠa é ná-botiɠɛ nui Moize leʋeni da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">ta Aalɔn, nii é yiimazeɠeni la.<verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>GALA sɛbɛi zu, ti laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">ta maaɓɛlɛ vaa wolaiti, Ezipete nuiti saama, Same ná-zooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>GALA ge kpidii leʋeni, kpidii ʋɛɛni zooi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni daawooi zakpe.<verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>É ta-ɗɛiti faliboni ga ɲamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">é kaleiti paa.<verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>É zɔlɔgiti puuni zooi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">eyɛsu ti ʋu ta-masagi laa ʋɛlɛiti bu.<verse eid="PSA 105:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>GALA ge ɓɔɛni, dɛgiti ti ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">ti ʋu ta-yooi kpein ga, ta sosoligiti.<verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>É sakɔtui ʋuuni ti ma, tonai ʋotogi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">ta geeɓadɛi nii é abui yeini ti ma zooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>É leezɛn ɓeleiti koloɠoloni, ta kooleɠoole guluiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">é ta-yooi ɠaa wuluiti galeɠaleni.<verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>GALA ge ɓɔɛni, kotogiti ti ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">ta koto ziʋoiti, niiti nu la ti-liegɔ ɠwɛɛga.<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>Ti ta-yooi ɠaa lufaiti kpein miini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">ti zooi ɠaa lɔnɔgiti kpein miini.<verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>Naa ʋolu, é Ezipete nuɓusɛiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti kpein paani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">ti-zuvikɛi ma lɔnɔ mɔungiti.<verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>É ná-nuɓusɛiti kulani ná ʋa, walii ta zanugi yɛni ti ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">Bolodamaiti saama, tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ɲiikpini.<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Ti lii vai ɠɛni ga koozunɛ Ezipete nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛni luazu Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>Maliɠii tonaɓiingi zuvieni ga é ti maalɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">é abui ve ga naa kpidii zu ɠɛ kala.<verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>Tɔɔzei ti falini, é kakalogiti feeni ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">ti yiɠoni ga ɓului, nii é zeɠeni geezuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>É fasai laaʋalini, ziɛi ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">é vazani ada vɔɔiti, eɠɛ ziɛ wola.<verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>É ɠizɛni ná-minazeɠe ɲadegai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">nii é boni ná-botiɠɛ nui Abalaame ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>É ná-nuɓusɛiti kulani Ezipete yooi ʋa ga koozunɛ wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">ná-nuiti é yiimazeɠeni ga tiye, ti ɠulani ga guyeiti toa.<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>É zii ɠiligiti ta-yooiti feeni ti ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">ti nuɓusɛ ɠiligiti ta-wotii ma lɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ,<verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>nii a kɛ ti ɠolo ná-deveiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">ti ná-tɔgiti so.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s">De ɠɛ ʋa ga wooʋalada nuiti, <optbreak/> GALA ka ga wooɠɛɠila nui</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi, mazɔlɔɔ pagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛɛ vaa wolaiti bo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é maamusɛ vaiti kpein bo?<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti ti sɔle fai ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">ti naa ɠɛɛzu yeenɔpɛ, nii é ga telebodai.<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu è nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠɛɛzu la ɗa-nuɓusɛiti bɛ, mina yeema mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">siɛgi zu è ti ɠizosu da, ɓɔ bà,<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>nii a kɛ, gè ɠaazula ɗa-nuiti ta-undaanɛɛi ma, niiti è yiimazeɠeai ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">gè ɠoozunɛ ga ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠoozunɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">ta gi è maamusɛ ʋɔɔma gá ɗɔnɔiti!<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>Gi kotoi ɠɛa ga gi-mɛmɛwolani kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">gi faa ɲɔu ɠɛ, gi ɠɛ ga sɔba nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, gi-mɛmɛwolani ti la ɠɛni ɗa-laavɔɔ vaiti gaaɠaani Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">ti yeemani ɗa-wooɠɛɠila faa wolaiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">ti ɓakani kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ, Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>Kɛlɛ, GALA ge ti ɠizoni, daaseigi wɔɔlɔ vai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">é ná-zobogi ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>É zelii loni Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ma, naa vɔɔni su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">ti ziɛni ma yeɠezaɠai zu, eɠɛ teʋebai zu.<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>É ti ɠizoni ti wɔinzeɠe nuiti ta-ɠɛʋeleiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">é ti unmɔɔni ti zili nuiti ta-zobogi ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>Ziɛiti ti ti maayoseɠe nuiti maaɓɔleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">gila kpalaa ge la ɠɛni ɠulani.<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>Názu ɠa ná-nuɓusɛiti ti laani la daawooi la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">ti maamusɛ wuyeiti too bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Kɛlɛ ti yeemani gaamanɔ ná-kɛɛwotiiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">ti la ná-faazeikpasuiti kɛ vai maaɓɔunni.<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>Teʋebai zu, ti-yiimaʋɛ laaveni ga gaazuɠulapɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">ti GALA suɠɔɠɔ fai ɠɛɛni zou vɔɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>Nii ti falini ma, é naa veeni ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">kɛlɛ é seeɓɛi ʋilini ti zaama.<verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>Ti toloi ɠulani ga Moize ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">ta Aalɔn, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nu ɲadegai.<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Zooi laalaoni, é Datan ɓɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">é Aɓilame ná-nu ɓulugiti maalɔɔɠuni.<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>Abui ta-nu ɓulugiti galani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">abui soni faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>Ti nikɛ yiʋoi ɓɛtɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ Wolɛɓe gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">ti nɔkɔni kɔlu ɠaawuungai naa wu.<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>Ti GALA maavaliboni, nii é ɠɛni ga ta-lɛbiyai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">ga suai ʋaaɠulabai, nii é tufai miizu!<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>Ti yeemani GALA ma, ti ɠizo nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">nii é faa wolaiti kɛɛni Ezipete yooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 106:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>É laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛni Same ná-zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">ta kɛɛwoti maayikiaiti Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>GALA ge deveni ga é ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">Kɛlɛ Moize, nii é yiimazeɠeni la, naa loni kakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">é pee ve bɛ, é zeɠe ná-ziiɠaawanai ʋolu, é mina ti ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>Zou ʋagɔi maawooi woni ti ma, ti naa ʋɛlɛʋilini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">ti la ɠɛni laani GALA daawooi la.<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>Ti ɓɔɛni unsu ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">ti la ɠɛni ɠoloni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Názu ɠa naa yeei wuzeɠeni la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">é ɠona ga toɠa ti undaaʋilisu teʋebai zu,<verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>é ti-mavofodaiti faza zooi kpein su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">ti za zii ɠiligiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>Ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠilini Ɓaale-Peyɔɔl ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">ti zalaɠa zuaiti miini, niiti ti ɠɛni ga gɔvɛiti tɔnɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani ga ti-ziɛ ʋele ɲɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛ ɲɔi ʋɛɛni ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Fineyase wuzeɠeni, é ná laazale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛ ɲɔi ɓeni gaamago nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>Naa leveni tɔun bɛ ga telebo faa ɠa é kɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">eyɛsu yeeɠɛɠalaiti ta yeeɠɛɠalaiti su eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>Ti GALA ziiɠaawana vai ɠɛɛni Meliɓa ɗɛi ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">Moize lɔɔni maanɔɠɔi zu ti maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>Ti wola ɓɔini da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:33">é ɓɔɛ, é la ɠisiɛni su.<verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>Ti la ɠɛni Kanaan nuiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>Ti zupuni ta zii ɠiligiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">ti naati siɛ ʋele maalɛlɛni.<verse eid="PSA 106:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>Ti ɠɛni naati ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti dɛbizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">naati ti ɠɛni ti ʋɛ ga balii.<verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>Anɛɛ ti-loun zunuiti, ta ti-loun anzanuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:37">ti naati kulani ga zalaɠaiti inɛgiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>Ti sɔbalala ɲamai ʋuuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">ti-loun zunuiti ma ɲamai, ta ti-loun anzanuiti ma ɲamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">ti ti ɠulani ga zalaɠaiti Kanaan yooi zu ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">Zooi ɠɔzɔni ga naama nu ʋaa vai.<verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>Ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni ga ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">ti koloɠologi ɠɛ ti-ziɛ ʋelei ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani, ziiɠula ná-nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">ná-nuɓusɛiti maayo ge zeɠeni bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>É ti lɔɔni zii ɠiligiti zeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">niiti ti maayo ge la ɠɛni ʋɛ, naati ti zeini ti unda.<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>Ti zili nuiti ti ti nimizani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">ti unmaayeini naati zeewu.<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>Anɛɛ ni siɛ mɔinmɔin su, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ti unmɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">kɛlɛ ta-ɠisiɛi ɠɛni nɔ ga ti ɗa ɓaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">ti ɠata ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, Maliɠii a la ti ɓain gooi mɛnina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">é ɓena ɠida ta-ɠidaaʋili faiti bu.<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>É ɠizɛni ná-minazeɠegi zu ti letema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">ti maawɔin soni, eɠɛʋelei ná-wooɠɛɠiladai wɔɔlɔai la.<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>É ta-maawɔinɠaa ɠigi lɔ naati ziima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:46">niiti ti ɠɛni ti zosu ga duɔiti.<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gá-ƓALAGI, gi ɠizo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">Gi ɠaalɛ ba, è gi ɠula zii ɠiligiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">naa ɠa a kɛ gi è maamusɛ, ɗɛigi è ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">gá-ɠoozunɛɛi ɠɛ ga gi ɗa è lɛbi!<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, ɠɔoɠɔ ta ɠɔoɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ɠɛ ma: «Amina!»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="ms1">Sɛʋɛi Lɔɔlusiɛi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 107-150">Guyeiti 107—150</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Unmɔɔ GALAGI, è mama</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ pagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nu unmɔɔgaiti ti naa wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">niiti é ti unmɔɔgai, é ti ɠula ti wɔinzeɠe nuiti zeezu,<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>é ti ɠaalɛ ba, é ti ɠula zooiti kpein su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">folo ɠulazu, folo liizu, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Tanigaani ti ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">ti la pele ɠaani, é ʋa lo ada ʋa, ná ga nu zeizu.<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Pului ta kpɔɔle wɔin ɠɛni ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">ti ʋalani ti-zuvikɛi ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Ta-ɠidaaʋiligi zu, ti ɓainni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">é ti ɠulani ta-yiiɓɔlɔ vaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>É loni ti luɠɔ, é li ga tiye ga pele zɔlegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">eyɛsu ti zeeli taa ma, nuiti seizuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">ta ná-laavɔɔ vaiti é ti ɠɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é kpɔɔle ɗɛi veeni naati zea, niiti kpɔɔle wɔin ɠɛni ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">é ani ʋagɔiti feeni naati zea, niiti pului ɠɛni ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>Tanigaa ti ɠɛni zeini kpidi ɓɔii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">maanɔɠɔi ti ʋa ga yɔlɔɠɔi ta kɔlui, ti ga kasoɠa nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 107:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>Tɔɔzei ti wuzeɠeni GALA ná-deveiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, ti naa ná-tɛnɛ gooiti bɛlɛʋilini.<verse eid="PSA 107:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>É ti lɔɔni kpɔlɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">ti ɓunɛni, nu nɔpɛ ge la ʋaani, é ʋa ɓɔ ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Ta-ɠidaaʋiligi zu, ti kpeei looni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">é ti ɠizoni ta-yiiɓɔlɔ vaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>É ti ɠulani kpidi ɓɔii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">é ta-yɔlɔɠɔiti teʋeleʋeni ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">ta ná-laavɔɔ vaiti é ti ɠɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é kɔlu ɓɔi kpogiti galeɠaleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">é kɔlu zɔɠɔgiti kpezeɠele.<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Ɠimalala nuiti, ti ta-eteai ziɛzu kotoi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛni ga maawɔin nuiti, ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti faa zu.<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>Daamianigiti kpein ti ɲɔuni ti-laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">ti maaɓuɠani saai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Ta-ɠidaaʋiligi zu, ti kpeei looni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">é ti ɠizoni ta-yiiɓɔlɔ vaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>É daawooi leʋeni, é ti ɠɛdɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">é ti ɠulani saai ya.<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">ta ná-laavɔɔ vaiti é ti ɠɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>Ti faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛ zalaɠaiti kula bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">ta ná-kɛɛwotiiti dɛɛzu ga koozunɛ wuyeiti.<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Tanigaa ti ɠɛni siɛi wosu ɓatoiti su kpoloɗɛi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">ti ɗa yaaɠolai ɠɛ ziɛ wolaiti ga,<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>naati ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kɛɛwotiiti kaani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">ta ná-laavɔɔ vaiti, kpoloɗɛ wolai ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>É ɓɔɛni nɔ, fiilɛ wolai lokoleʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">é kpoloɗɛi ma lakpatakpagiti buzeɠe.<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Ta-ɓatoi ɠɛni ti lɛɛzu geezuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">ná tago a kɛɛna, é ti yei zeɠei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">dualuagi ɠɛni ti ma, ti yiiɓɔlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>Gaazulatigi ti zoni, ti ɗa ziɛ eɠɛ dɔɔzo nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">ta-ɠimalai kpein gaaʋalani ba.<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Ta-ɠidaaʋiligi zu, ti ɓainni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">é ti ɠulani ta-yiiɓɔlɔ vaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>É zelii loni fiilɛi ma, naa lɛi tɔɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">ziɛ lakpatakpagiti ti laani kpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Naa ɠɛni ga koozunɛ vaa ti ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI loni ti luɠɔ, ti zeeli kein tosuʋɛ, ʋɛ ti ɓɛdɛi ɠɛni ná ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">ta ná-laavɔɔ vaiti é ti ɠɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>Ti maamusɛ nuɓusɛiti ta-maaɓɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">ti dɛbi kɛwolaiti ta-ɠaalɛbai zu.<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>Toɠa ɗa ziɛ wolaiti fɔ su, ná ɠɛ ga teʋebai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">é ziɛungiti fɔ su, naati ti ɠɛ ga zou vɔɔi,<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>é zou ʋagɔi valibo, é ɠɛ ga zooi kpoloi wanaai ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">nuiti ti zeini ga naati ta-ɠotoi maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>Kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa teʋebai valibo, é ɠɛ ga ziɛ wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">é zou vɔɔi ɓalaa valibo, é ɠɛ ga ziɛungiti.<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>É ná ɠɛ ga naati seizu, niiti pului ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">naati ti taai lo ná, ti zei ná,<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>ti molo zuwui vaza kpalagiti su, ti ɗa leezɛn ɓeleiti da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">niiti ta ɠɛ gwaai wosu ga bɔɔlɔa.<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>GALA ka tuya loo ti ʋɛ, é ti ɠaawɔɔlɔ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">é la ta-loganiiti maaʋɛlɛa.<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>Siɛgi zu ti maaʋɛlɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">ti zuɓili nimiza ɠasɔi wu, maanɔɠɔi ta kidaaʋiligi zu,<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>GALA ka zobobɛ nuiti pɛlɛʋɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">é ti ɠɛ ga teʋeteʋe nuiti teʋebai zu, ʋɛ pele la ná.<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>Kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa bala nuiti kula maanɔɠɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">é ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti gaawɔɔlɔ, eɠɛ togani goiti.<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Sɔle nuiti ta miná ɠa, ti ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">kɛlɛ telebotala laaʋɛ kpein daa ɠa ɠulu.<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é ga ɠima nu, é dama ga niima vaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">é ɠida Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-wooɠɛɠila kɛɛwotiiti bu.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s">Nà pilɛ sɔlɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>Davide ná-guyei. Guyei.<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Ladalai ɠa zìimaʋɛ, ee, GALA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">Nà guyei loo, gè è maamusɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>À wuzeɠe, wa ʋe, nà-kɔnigi ta nà-papai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">Nà geelaalaosuʋɛ maaloɠa.<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Nà è maamusɛ ziiti pɛ saama, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">Nà guyei loo è ʋɛ zii ɠiligiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai ɓudɛʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">ta ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai tonaɓiingiti maazu.<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Ee, GALA, è wɔɔlɔ ʋelei lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi maazuʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">Ɗa-lɛbiyai volo eteai zu ná pɛ,<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, niiti è ti nɛai ʋɛ, naati ti unmɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">Kizogi wo ga è-yeezai, gòoɠaaʋote.<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>GALA ge ɓɔɛni seizu ɲadegai, é ɠɛ ma: «Pilɛ sɔlɔɔ nui ɠa é ga ze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">Nà Sikɛme ɠaaɠwɛ su, gè Sukɔte nɛmɛi ɠaaɠwɛ.<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>Galaade ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ, Manasé ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">Efelayime ɠa ga kɔɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔgi ùnba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">Zuda ɠa ga nà-masa tukpɔi.<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>Moaɓe ɠa ga kokoi, nii gè maagbazu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">nà-saʋala pilisuʋɛ ɠa ga Edɔme yooi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">Nà pilɛ sɔlɔɔ kpeei loozu Filisiti nuiti ta-yooi laalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a li ga ze taa wolai zu, nii siɠigi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Ɓɛ ɠa a li ga ze Edɔme?<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa laade ɓaa, è ɠɛa ɠɛlɛni gi ʋa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">Ee, GALA, siɛgi zu gá-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠulazu la, è la mɔ ɠɛni ʋilɛsu ti ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>Ɓɔ gi ʋa gi zili nuiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛiti ta-ɓɔbai ɠa nɔ ga wafuun faa.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 108:14"/>Ni GALA ka ade ʋa, ada pilɛ sɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:14">mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é ade zili nuiti dɛɛvɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 108:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s">Nui nii ti zɛɛi ʋɛɛzu ma, <optbreak/> é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maalobosu ɠaiziɛ GALA pɔ bɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋɛ. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 109:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:1">GALA, ɗɛi gè è maamusɛzu, mina maaɠɛ kpɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nu ɲɔiti ti laalaoga dàalɔɠɔma, ti ɗa tɔ̀ɠɔi ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">ti ɗa sùɠula ga zɛɛ nɛgiti.<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>Ti màaɠoolia ga wɔinzeɠema ɓɔɛiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">Ti ɗa laalɛ bù wafuun.<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>Ta nà-nɛɛbɛi zuloozu ga ti ɗa màalɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">tama nɔ̀un nà GALA falizu nɔ,<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>ti ɗa nà-faa ʋagɔi zuloo ga faa ɲɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">ti ɗa nà-bɔɔlalai zuloo ga wɔinzeɠemai.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>Wɛlɛ, nii ɠa ti bosu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">«Ade yeelo nu ɲɔu ɠila ba daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">maalɔɔ nu ɠila ge lo zeezazuʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>Siɛgi zu ta ɠɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋezu la, ti peelala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">ná-GALA falii ɠɛ ga kotoi!<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>Sii ma voloi zu mina mɔ ɠooza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">taɠili ge zei potogi zu!<verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>Ná-dointi ti ɠɛ ga podointi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:9">anzai ɠɛ ga poanzai!<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>Ná-dointi ti ɠɛ ga teʋeteʋe nuiti, ti ɗa falii wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">ta-vali wosuʋɛ maaɠooza ta-ʋɛlɛi ʋa koloɠologai!<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Kuye nuiti ti yeeʋɛɛ kɔligiti kpein ma mɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">ná-botii zulɔnɔgi pɛ ge ɠɛ ga toosu nuiti tɔnɔ!<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge mina nuɓɔɠɔla ɠɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">ta nu mina ná-podointi maawɔinɠa!<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Mavofodai zuwuɠaaleʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">ti-laaseigi ɠaaʋa yeeɠɛɠalai zu, nii é ʋaazu!<verse eid="PSA 109:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mina ɠi kula mɛmɛwolani ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">dee ná-kotoi mina gba é ʋa ɓe!<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuyɛ nɔ ɠɔ ta-ɠotoiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">é ti-laaseigi ɓale eteai zu.<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Tɔɔzei, zunui nii la nuɓɔɠɔla nɔpɛ kɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">é maawɔin nui wɔinzeɠeni, nii é ga bala nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">eyɛsu é nui naa ʋaa, nii ziiɠoloɠologai.<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>Nu voovoo vai ɠa é nɛɛni bɛ, foovooi tɔ ɓalaa so!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">É la ɠɛni kɛɛzu, é ʋa tuya loo nu ʋɛ, tuyai ʋela, é maaɠooza tɔ ɓalaa ba!<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>É foovooi loo ɠɔba, eɠɛʋelei ná-seɠei la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">naa lɔ koozuʋɛ ga ziɛi ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">é lɔ ma ɠaeiti su ga gulɔi ɠɛʋele.<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>É ɠɛ eɠɛ seɠei, nii é felevelesu ɓɔɠɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">ta saamaɠiligi é saamaʋɛ yeenɔpɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>Tɔun, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mu ge màalɔɔ nuiti sala ɠana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">niiti ti tɔ̀ɠɔi ɠoloɠolosu.<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>Ee, Màliɠii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, màalobo, è-laaseigi wɔɔlɔ vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ʋagɛ, ùnmɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Maawɔin nu ɠa ga ze, gè ɠɛ ga bala nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">zìi ɠoloɠologɛ kòozu.<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>Nà ɲɛɛlɛzu vaa, eɠɛ niinigi é zeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">ta nɔ̀un foɓesu eɠɛ kotogi.<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>Zu so faa wolai ɠa ɲìibiiti suɓalizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">gè ɗa vɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>Gè ɠɛa ti ya ga ɓaaɠulama anii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">ta kàana nɔ, ti ɗa ungi ɲiikpi.<verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>Ɓɔ bà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">Kìzo ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma.<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>Sìli nuiti ti ɠɛ kwɛɛ ga ɗa ɠa, è naa ɠɛai ga è-yeei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">ga ɗa ɠila kpe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è naa ɠɛai.<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>Ta zoo ti foovooi wo, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa, ɗa tuyai loozu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">Ta wuzeɠena dàalɔɠɔma, ta unfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà, ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, dàa ɠa ve ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Niiti ti nɔ̀un maalɔɔzu, zɔngɔi zɛlɛ ti pɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">unfegi loo ti ɠɔba eɠɛ seɠei.<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ ga woo wola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">nà dɛbi bɛbɛ wolai zaama.<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɗa maawɔin nui maalobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">é unmɔɔ, é kula naati zea, niiti ti peelalazu.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s">Masagi zalaɠa ɠula nui</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 110:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi é boni màliɠii ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">«Zei zèezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">eyɛsu gè è zili nuiti kɛ ga ɗa-ɠɔɠɔloma anii.»<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa-masadai ma zɛbɛi zuwɔɔlɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">é zo Siyɔn GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">Ɗa masadai ɠɛ è zili nuiti saama.<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>Voloi ɗa ɠɛ kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">ɗa-nuɓusɛiti daa ɠa ve ga ziilɔɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">ti ɗa ʋa è ʋɔ ga kpizɛi, maaɠili ɲadegai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">sobuzobui, ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ zunu loungoiti ta suvilɛ ga ʋaa è ʋɔ bɛ, eɠɛʋelei nɔɗagi a ɗa ʋuu la.<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠonani, tama é la zeɠea woo ʋolu, é ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">«Ɗa ga zalaɠa ɠula nui eyɛsu ɠɔ, eɠɛʋelei Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛni la.»<verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>È-Maliɠii ɠa è ɠobaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">ná-ziiɠaawana voloi, toɠa masagiti dɛɛvɛ.<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>Toɠa ná-tukpɔi laalɛ zii ɠiligiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">nu ʋoomai ma ɓulugiti gaa ɠa lɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">toɠa kundiɠiiti dɛɛvɛ eteai zu naa kpein.<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Toɠa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">110:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Toɠa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Masagi ɠa ti vaazu ma.</char></note> ɓɔɔle pelei zu kɔtuɗɛi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">naa ʋoluma toɠa nɔungi wuzeɠe.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ge faa maayikiaiti kɛɛʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">111:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti.</char>
    </note>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">maaɓɔgi zu, telebo nuiti ta-ɠaalɛbai zu.<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kɛɛwotiiti bɔɔlɔʋɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">niiti kpein ti wɔinɗai la, naati ta ɗa ɠida ti wu gola.<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>Ná-kɛɛwotiiti ta ná-lɛbiyai ta ná-maanɛɛi ɠulazu kɛlɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">Ná-telebodai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>Toɠa pɔ ga nu ɠizɛ ná-faa maayikiaiti su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nuɓɔɠɔʋɛ, é ɠɛ ga maawɔinɠaa ƓALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>Niiti ti luazu ba, toɠa ɗa naati maavaiti kpein kɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">Toɠa ɗa ɠizɛ ná-minazeɠegi zu yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>É ná-zobogi lɛɛni ga ná-nuɓusɛiti ga kɛɛ vaiti maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">siɛgi zu é zii ɠiligiti ta-yooi veeni la ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>Nii kpein é kɛɛzu, naa ɠa é ga gaamai ta sɔlegi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">Nu maanɛɛʋɛ, è la ná-deveiti kpein da.<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>É ti zei ʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">kɛai gaamai ta sɔlegi maazu.<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>É unmɔɔ fai leʋeni ná-nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">é minazeɠegi wo ti ʋɛ, nii é ga ɠɔoɠɔ kelei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">GALAGI ʋe, nii ɲadegai, maayiki.<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuluabai ɠa é ga ɠimalai lɔɔzeizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">niiti kpein ti ziɛzu ga naa, naati ka ɠi pagɔi ti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Ná-maamusɛi ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s">Wooɠɛɠila nuiti ta-undaanɛɛi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">112:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti.</char>
    </note>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii é luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">ta nɛɛbɛ vai ɠa é ga, é naa ná-deveiti so, é ziɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>Mavofodai ɠa ɠɛ ga zɛbɛsu nu eteai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">Tuya ɠa ɠɛ telebo nui mavofodai ma.<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>Toɠa ɓɔɠɔ zɔlɔɔ, naavoloi ɠɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">ná-telebodai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>Siɛgi zu fai pɛ suɓidizu la, wozakalagi ɠa ɗa ɠula sɔle nui ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">Telebogɛ, nuɓɔɠɔai, é ga maawɔinɠaa nu.<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>Pagɛ ga nui nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠɛ, é kuyei ʋɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">é ɓɔɠɔ vaiti gaaɠula ba ga sɔledai.<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ faa nɔpɛ ge la telebo nui ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">nuiti ta ɠizɛ su eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>É la luaa ziiɠoloɠolo kpɔɛ ɲɔiti ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">Ziilɛiʋɛ, tɔɔzei poluzeiʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>Zii la ɓalia, dualua ge la ziimaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">Gaaɓelagi, toɠa sili nuiti koloɠolo pelei ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>Toɠa ɗa faanɛɛi ɠɛ ga bɔɔlɔa maanɔɠɔ nuiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">Ná-telebodai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">tanɔ ɠa a ɗa la ná-zɛbɛi ta ná-lɛbiyai ma.<verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui a kaana, ziiɠaa ɠa ɗa wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">é ɗa ɲiigai ziɛ ga, é ʋala ná-zobogi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ziimai ɠa ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s">GALAGI nii kɛɠala la ná</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">À maamusɛ, wɔi wo ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">é zo niizu ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>É zo folo ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é li folo liizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Toɠa zeini ziiti kpein unga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">ná-lɛbiyai ɠa geeɠɔlɔgi maazu.<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ada-ƓALAGI ɠɛʋele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">Toɠa zeini anii kpein unga geezuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 113:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>Kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa ungi ʋilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:6">é geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa ta zooi.<verse eid="PSA 113:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>Toɠa ɗa maawɔin nui ɠula fufiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">toɠa ɗa maanɔɠɔ nui wuzeɠe, é kula kpoɠagi zu,<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>é sei seizumaanɛgiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:8">ná-nuɓusɛiti ta-zeizumaanɛgiti.<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>Toɠa pɛlɛyeɠei ve doun zɔlɔɔtala anzanui ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">é koozunɛɛi zɔlɔɔ, tɔɔzei é ɠɛa ga dounɠa ti-lee.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s">Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠulani la <optbreak/> Ezipete yooi ʋa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti ɠulani la Ezipete yooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">siɛgi zu Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti ti ɠulani wɛɛn nuɓusɛiti saama,<verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Zuda yooi ɠɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeizu ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Izilayɛle ɠɛ ga ná-zooi.<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>Kpoloɗɛi naa ɠaani, é ɓizɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">Zuludɛn ɠaaɠaleni ma ga ʋoluʋelei.<verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Gizeiti ti ɠɛni ʋilisu ga baala sinɛ wolaiti kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">gize goiti ti ɗa ʋili ga baala ziʋoiti kɛʋele.<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>Toɠa ɠale, kpoloɗɛi, è ʋelani ɠana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Ɗa ma, Zuludɛn, toɠa ɠale è ɠaleni ma ga ʋoluʋelei?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>Wa ma, gizeiti, toɠa ɠale wo ʋilini eɠɛ baala sinɛ wolaiti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">Wa ma, gize goiti, toɠa ɠale wo ʋilini eɠɛ baala ziʋoiti?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>Ee, eteai, ɓali Maliɠii ɠakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI ɠakala,<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>nii a ɗa fasai valibo, é kɛ ga kpoigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">é kɔtui ɠɛ ga ziɛungi.<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s">GALA gila kpe ka lɛbiyai bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, é la ga gɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">giya laade gɔnɔ ʋa ɠɛ ga lɛbiyai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">kɛni ɗa ɠila kpe, ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai maaʋele ma, ta ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai.<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Leeni vaa zu, zii ɠiligiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠasu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">«Mini ɠa ta-ƓALAGI ná?»<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>Ada-ƓALAGI ɠa geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">é ɗa naa kpein kɛ, nii nɛai bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>Kɛlɛ ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ta ga walii ta zanugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">niiti nuɓusɛiti ti ti ɓɛtɛai.<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>Daaʋɛ ɠa ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la ɓɔɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">gaazuʋɛ ɠa ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la wozaɠaazu la,<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>goiyeɠei ɠa ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la faa mɛnisu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">sokpai ɠa ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la ani maku mɛnisu da.<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>Ti-yeeiti ta ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la vɔɔɠuzu ani ʋa ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">ti-ɠɔɠɔiti ta ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la ziɛzu ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">woo la zooga ɠulazu ti-ɠɔdayeɠei zu.<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Ti ɓɛtɛ nuiti kulaʋɛ ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">ta niiti kpein ti ɠitosu ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>Izilayɛle, ɠaliva Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">Tɔ ɠa é è ʋɛ ga kpɔba nui, ta kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛgi.<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>Wɔi wo ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Aalɔn mavofodaiti, à ɠaliva Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">Tɔ ɠa é è ʋɛ ga kpɔba nui, ta kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛgi.<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>Wɔiti wo luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, à ɠaliva ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">Tɔ ɠa é wo ʋɛ ga kpɔba nui, ta kɔɔɠɔ ɠɔlu zɛpɛgi.<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɠisiɛzu ade zu, toɠa tuya loo ade ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">toɠa tuya loo Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">toɠa tuya loo Aalɔn ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo naati bɛ, niiti ti luazu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">ɓolomadɔɠɔiti ta seizumaanɛgiti.<verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wo ɠaawɔɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:14">wa-o, wo-lointi-yo.<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo wo ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:15">nii é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛa, ta zooi.<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">kɛlɛ é zooi veeʋɛ nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>Gɔvɛiti taade ta ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">anɛɛ naati taɠila kpalaa, niiti ti gaalɛi yooi zu.<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Kɛlɛ adɔun, ada Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛzu, é zo niizu ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s">Màliɠii ɠa ɗa gòoi mɛni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɗa gòoi mɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">siɛgi zu gè maanɛɛnɛzu la.<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>Tɔɔzei goilogɛ gòoi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">nà yɛ wooɠulazu ma yeenɔpɛ, sìi ma voloi pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>Saai ma ɠaluiti ti ɠɛa veleveleni mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">gɔvɛalaazu vaiti ma yiizoolɛiti ti ɠɛni mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">gè zeelini kidaaʋiligi ta ziizoolɛi ɠwɛgi ma.<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>Kɛlɛ gè wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, gè ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">«Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zɛ̀nvui ɠizo!»<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠɛ, sɔlegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">ada-ƓALAGI ɠa ga maawɔinɠa ƓALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa naati makɛ, niiti ti la dɛ faa mɔinmɔin kwɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">tɔ ɠa é kìzoni, siɛgi zu màawɔinni la.<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>Zìi, ɠaaɠale ma ɗa-yiilɛigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI faanɛɛ ɠɛɛʋɛ è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>Ungo, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ùnmɔɔni, è kùla saai ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">è gàazuɗɛiti kpale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">è kɔ̀ɠɔiti seɠe too ʋelei ma.<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>Nà yɛ ziɛzu fulu nuiti ta-eteai tɛi su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:9">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>Ìɲɔ ge la ɠɛni leʋeni, anɛɛ siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma la:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">«Màawɔinɗa gola!»<verse eid="PSA 116:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>Nà-ziiɓɔlɔi zu, gè ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">«Nui kpein ka ga zɛɛ nu!»<verse eid="PSA 116:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>Leeni ɠa nà zoo gè kɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">ná-faanɛɛi kpein faa zu nɔ̀un tetema?<verse eid="PSA 116:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>Nà pilɛ sɔlɔɔ ziawɔi lɛ geezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">gè wooɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma.<verse eid="PSA 116:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>Nà nà-minazeɠegiti daazeeli, niiti gè ti ɠɛa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">nà naa ɠɛ ná-nuɓusɛiti pɛ gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 116:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti saa vai ɠa ɗa ɠɛ gaazu ga faa ɓaa gola.<verse eid="PSA 116:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ zunui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">nii ɗa-wotiɠɛ anzanui sɔlɔɔgai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">È bà wɔinzeɠema ɠaluiti teʋea bà.<verse eid="PSA 116:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>Nà faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛ zalaɠaiti kula è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">gè wooɠula è ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 116:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>Nà nà-minazeɠegiti daazeeli, niiti gè ti ɠɛa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">nà naa ɠɛ ná-nuɓusɛiti pɛ gaazu,<verse eid="PSA 116:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-koizuʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Zeluzalɛme laaʋeaiti saama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s">Etea maamusɛi kpein</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>Ziiti kpein, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">À dɛbi, nuɓusɛiti kpein!<verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ gola ade ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s">È yɛ vulua, è ɗa naa wo, <optbreak/> nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kɛa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ pagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti bo, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">«Ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Aalɔn mavofodaiti ti bo, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">«Ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Niiti ti luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, naati ti bo, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">«Ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!»<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>Nà-kidaaʋiligi zu, gè wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">é gòoɠaaʋoteni, é fìeni.<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa bà, gè la lua ani nɔpɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">leeni ɠa nui a zoo é kɛ ga ze?<verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa bɛ̀ ga nà-kpɔba nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">nà wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti koloɠolosuʋɛ ɠa ga gàazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>Fizɔgɛ nu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ga lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">aisa nu ʋa li ɠalivaazu nui ma.<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>Fizɔgɛ nu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ga lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">aisa nu ʋa li ɠalivaazu seizumaanɛgiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Zii ɠiligiti pɛ ti màalatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu, gè ti ɓulukpuluni.<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>Ti màalatini, ti màavelevele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu, gè ti ɓulukpuluni.<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>Ti màalatini eɠɛ sɛlɛ kɔingiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">kɛlɛ ti zaani eɠɛ abui é zosu dɔɔ laa fɔɔi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu, gè ti ɓulukpuluni.<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>Ti dàaʋili gola, gè ʋa loo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔni bà.<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga nà-zobogi, ta nà-maamusɛ wuyeiti ma ungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">tɔ ɠa é ga nà-kizogi.<verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Koozunɛɛi ta unmɔɔgi ma ɓee wooiti ta telebo nuiti ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti buulaave.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezai ɠa botii ɠɛɛzu ga zɛbɛi!<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezai wuzeɠeʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezai ɠa botii ɠɛɛzu ga zɛbɛi!<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Gè la zaazu, nà yɛsu vulua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">gè ɗa naa zuɠula, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kɛa ga kɛɛwotiiti.<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI màaɠoloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">kɛlɛ é la dɔ̀ɔni saai zu.<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>À pɛlɛi laalao bɛ̀, nii makɛgai sɔle nuiti ta-vaa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">miná ɠa gè lɛɛzu ná, gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Wɛlɛ siɠidaʋɛ ʋa, nii é liizu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">miná ʋele ɠa sɔle nuiti ti leʋesu da.<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>Nà è maamusɛzu, tɔɔzei è gòoɠaaʋoteni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">è ʋaani è ɠɛ ga nà-kizo nui.<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>Kɔtui nii pɛlɛ lo nuiti ti ɠɛlɛni ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">naa ɠa kɛai ga sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai.<verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>Naama vai ʋaaʋɛ é zeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">toɠa ga laavɔɔ vaa ade ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Za ɠa ga foloi nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kulaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">ade siɛ ga koozunɛɛi, de ɲaɠai ɠula, de ɠoozunɛɛ!<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kizo fai ve!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, undaanɛɛi ve!<verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo naama nui ʋɛ, nii é ʋaazu daaseigi zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">Gá tuya loozu wo ʋɛ, é ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu!<verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠila kpe ka é ga GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">tɔ ɠa é wozakalagi veezu de ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">À dɔɔ laaiti so ya, wo lɔ polu ʋɛbɛi zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">eyɛsu wo zeeli zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>Ɗa ga nà-GALAGI, nà è musɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">ee, nà-GALAGI, nà è maamusɛzu!<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ pagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi maayikiʋɛ, daazeeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">119:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. (Kɛlɛ guyei nii zu, ti ɲɛkpɛʋɛ ga puuzu lɔsaʋa lɔsaʋa.) Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti.</char>
    </note>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti ti-ziɛ ʋelei zɔlegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei zoloosu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti ti ná-kala gooiti sosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">ti ɠolozu bɛ ga ti-yiimaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>Naati ti la faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">kɛlɛ ta ta-eteai ziɛzu, é zoloo GALA ná-pelei ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>È ɗa-leveiti kulani kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">nii a kɛ nu ɠolo ti ʋɛ ga pagɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>Ziilɔɔi ɠɛ zèa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">nii a kɛ, gè ɗa-leveiti so!<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>Naazu gè la unfega tago ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">siɛgi zu gè ɗa-leveiti pɛ pɛtɛsu da.<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>Nà è maamusɛ ga sɔledai, é zìimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">nà ɗa-lelebodai ma leveiti kalana.<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>Nà ɗa-leveiti so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">mina ɠɛlɛ bà ɲɛgɛlɛin.<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Zunu loungoi ɠa zoo ɠale, é ziɛ ɲadedai zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Kɛni é è-laawooi zo, é ziɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>Nà è ɠaiziɛzu ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">mina ɓe bà, gè ʋa zeɠe ɗa-leveiti polu.<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>Gè è-laawooi makɛgɛ zìimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">naa ɠa a kɛ, gè mina koto ɠɛ è laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>Mamagi ɠa è ʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">kàla ga ɗa-leveiti!<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>Dàkɔlɔgiti ta ɗa-leveiti kpein suɠulazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">niiti è ti woni.<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>Gè ʋilɛ ɗa-ɠala gooiti polu, naa ɠa ɗa kòozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">eɠɛ ni nà naavolo wola zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>Nà ɠisiɛ ɗa-leveiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">gàazu logɛ ɗa-ʋeleiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>Nii è sɛʋɛai, naa ɠa nɛ̀ɛbɛ vaa wolai su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">gè la yeemaa è-laawooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Faa ʋagɔ ɠɛ bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">gè zɛnvui wo, nà ɠolo è-laawooi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>Gàazuʋɛ zeɠe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">naa ɠa a kɛ, gè ɗa-lɔgi maayikizuʋɛ ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Nà ga seikɔɠɔma nu eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">mina ɗa-leveiti dɔɔɠu bà.<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su, ɗa-leveiti kwɛɛ fai ɠa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">gè gaiziɛzu ga sɛ̀bɛi pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>Ɗa zelii losu waso nuiti ma, foovoo nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">ti zeɠezu ɗa-leveiti polu.<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Ɓaaɠulamai ta bɛlɛlala vai ma ɠasɔi zeɠe ùnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">mazɔlɔɔ nà ɗa-ɠala gooiti sosu.<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Anɛɛ ni kundiɠiiti ta yaavai ɠilizu dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, nà yɛ ɠisiɛzu ɗa-lɔgiti su.<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>Ɗa-ɠala gooiti ti ga zìima vaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">ta ga tɛ̀nɛ nu ʋagɔiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>Nà laani fufiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">zɛnvui ve bɛ̀, eɠɛʋelei è-laawooi bogai la.<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>Gè sɔ̀giti kpein dɛa ga ɗe, è gòoɠaaʋoteni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">kàla ga ɗa-leveiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>Ɗa-leveiti gaaɠa ʋelei lɛ ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">nii a kɛ gè ɠisiɛ ɗa-vaa maayikiaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>Ziizoolɛi ɠa gàazuɗɛi ʋuuzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">Bùzeɠe, eɠɛʋelei è-laawooi la.<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Màaɠooza zɛɛ ʋelei ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">È-zaalai zu, ɓɔ bà, gè ziɛ ga ɗa-lɔgi.<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>Gè yiimazeɠea ga gè yɛ è ʋɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">nà ɠolozu ɗa-leveiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>Nà ɠilizu ɗa-ɠala gooiti ba, niiti è ti veeni zèa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mina va bu, gè ʋa unfe.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>Nà ɓizɛzu ɗa-leveiti ma ʋelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">mazɔlɔɔ è zìi laalaoga.<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kàla ga ɗa-leveiti ma ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">nà yɛ ziɛzu la eyɛsu gaaɓela.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Faaɠaaɠaa ɠigi ve bɛ̀, gè ɗa-lɔgi zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">gè ɠolo bɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>Lo tùɠɔ ɗa-leveiti ma ʋelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">mazɔlɔɔ naa ɠa ga zìima vai.<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>Zìi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ɗa-ɠala gooiti tuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">gè mina ʋilɛ kpɔ̀ɠɔ lɔnɔgi ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>Gàazuʋɛ zeɠe wafuun faiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">zɛnvui ve bɛ̀ ɗa-ʋelei ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>Naa ɠɛ bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">nii è ma minazeɠea naati bɛ, niiti ti luazu è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>Ɓaaɠulama vai maaɠooza bà, nii é màaluazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-leveiti pagɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>Wɔ̀in ma vaa wolai ɠa ga ɗa-leveiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">Zɛnvui ve bɛ̀ ɗa-lelebodai ʋɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠula kɛlɛma bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">kìzo, eɠɛʋelei è mìnazeɠeni la!<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>Nà zoo gè naati gooɠaaʋote, niiti ti ɓaaɠulazu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">mazɔlɔɔ gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠaliva è-laawooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Dàaʋɛ mina zeɠe gaama ɓɔɛi ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠitosu ɗa-leveiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>Nà ɗa-lɔgi zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:44">yeenɔpɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>Nà ziɛ ɓɔɠɔyeemai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-leveiti ka gè ti ɠaiziɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>Nà ɓɔɛ masagiti gaazu ga ɗa-ɠala gooiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">gè la unfega da.<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>Ɗa-leveiti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:47">kòozunɛɛʋɛ ga gè ɠolo ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>Nà yeemaalesu ɗa-leveiti ma, mazɔlɔɔ ti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">Nà ɠisiɛ ɗa-lɔgiti su.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>Ɠizɛ è-laawooi zu, nii è boni mà, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">nii è kitogi veeni bɛ̀ su.<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>Nà-maanɔɠɔi zu, nà-ziilɛigi ɠa ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">ɗa-minazeɠegi ɠa é zɛ̀su vulua.<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Waso nuiti ti ɲɛɛɠulani nɔ̀un su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">kɛlɛ gè la zeɠezu ɗa-lɔgi ʋolu.<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kìgi ɠa ɗa-leveiti su, è ti woni kaite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">naa ɠa é zìilɛizu.<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>Zìi ɠa ɗa ɠoloɠolo, nà faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti kaana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">ti ɠɛlɛai ɗa-lɔgi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>Nà ɗa ɗa-leveiti maawuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">zooi nii zu, ʋɛ gè ná ga wɛɛn.<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɗa ɠisiɛ è zu kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">nà ɗa-lɔgi zo.<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>Nii é ga nɔ̀un tosuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:56">naa ɠa é ga, gè ɗa-leveiti makɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà bosu ʋolu, tòsuʋɛ ɠa é ga, gè ɠolo è-laawooi ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>Gè ɠaaɓa ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ, ga gè nɛɛ è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">zaalai la mà, eɠɛʋelei ɗa-minazeɠegi la.<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>Gè ɠisiɛni sìɛ ʋeleiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">nà ɠalesu ma ɗa-ɠala gooiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>Nà zuvilɛzu, gè la ná laazu ɠoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">ga gè ɗa-leveiti so.<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Anɛɛ ni faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti sòni ga ta-ʋalii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">gè la yeemazu ɗa-lɔgi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>Kua zaamai, nà ɗa wuzeɠe ga gè è maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">tɔɔzei ɗa-leveiti sɔle fai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>Nà ga naati ti-wɔɔlai, niiti ti luazu è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">ta niiti ti ɠolozu ɗa-leveiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai eteai kpein daavegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">kàla ga ɗa-leveiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è faanɛɛ ɠɛa bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">é zoloo è-laawooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>Kàla ga ɠimala ʋagɔi ta keleɠelegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">mazɔlɔɔ dàaʋɛ ɗa-leveiti da.<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>Aisa ùnmaa ʋa yei, gè ɠakani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">kɛlɛ niizu, gè è-laawooi zoga.<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>È ʋagɛ, è ɠɛ ga faanɛɛ ɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">kàla ga ɗa-leveiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Waso nuiti ta zɛɛ mɔinmɔin pɛɛzu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">kɛlɛ nà ɠolozu ɗa-leveiti bɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>Ti yiilaaɠulugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, kòozunɛ vai ɠa ga ɗa-lɔgi zo vai.<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>É kpɛ̀tɛni, ùnmaayeini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">nii a kɛ gè ɗa-leveiti kala.<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>Tɔgi kulaai è-la, naa vizɔgɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">é leʋe zanu kae waagila (1.000) ba, ta wali ɠaei.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>È-yeeiti ti kɛ̀ʋele ɓɛtɛa, ti sùzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">ɠimalai ve bɛ̀, nii a kɛ gè ɗa-leveiti kala.<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>Niiti ti luazu è ʋa, ta kà, ti ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">mazɔlɔɔ kìtogɛ è-laawooi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè kwɛɛ ga ɗa-leveiti sɔlegɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">È sɔledai ɠɛɛni ùnmaayei vai zu.<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛ ga gàanɛɛnɛ zaɓui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">eɠɛʋelei ɗa-minazeɠegi la bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui.<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Ɗa-maawɔinɠai yei mà, nii a kɛ gè zɛnvui wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-lɔgi ɠa é ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ vai.<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Unfegi yei waso nuiti ma, tɛiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu wafuun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">Nɔ̀un nà, nà ɠigaiziɛzu ɗa-leveiti su.<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>È ɠaazuluaba nuiti ti ʋa ʋolu pɔ̀ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">nii a kɛ ti ɗa-ɠala gooiti kwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>Nà pɔ zìi zɔle ɲɛgɛlɛin, ɗa-leveiti so fai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">naa ɠa a kɛ gè la unfega.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Zìi ɠa zoolɛzu ga ɗa-ɠizogi ma vai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">kìgi logɛ è-laawooi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>Gàazuʋɛ ɓɔiɗa su ga ɗa-minazeɠegi ɠaiziɛ vai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">Gè ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa gàanɛɛnɛ yeelɛ?»<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>Gè ɠɛa eɠɛ kɔlɔ woolei é ɠoloɠolosu abu luului zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">anɛɛ naa ʋe, gè la yeemazu ɗa-leveiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>Folo lielegɔ ɠa ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui kɛɛzu dɛ, kɛʋelei niizu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">Yeelɛ ɠa è naati tukpɔɠaaleʋezu la, niiti ti nìmizazu?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Waso nuiti ta zeɠei wɔɔzu tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">naa la zolooni ɗa-lɔgi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>Ɗa-leveiti kpein sɔlegɛ ga nu la ti la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">Ta wɔ̀inzeɠezu wafuun, ʋa è ɓɔ bà.<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>Ná tago ɠɛa de, ti ʋa ùndaaʋili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">kɛlɛ gè la ɠɛlɛzu ɗa-lɔgiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>Zɛnvui ve bɛ̀ ga ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">naa ɠa a kɛ gè deveiti so, è ti woni.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è-laawooi ɠa ná eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">seizuʋɛ ɠa ná eyɛsu ɠɔ, geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛ ná, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">È eteai ɓɛtɛni, toɠa loni kpaan losuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Aniiti pɛ ta ná za, ɗa-levei zaɓui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">mazɔlɔɔ eteai kpein ka è yeema.<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Ni ɗa-lɔgi la ɠɛni zìimani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">nà la za kaite nà-maanɔɠɔi zu.<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>Eyɛsu pɛ gè la yeemaa ɗa-leveiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">naati ka è vaazu bu, gè zɛnvui wo ti zaɓui zu.<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Nà ga ɗɔnɔ, kìzo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">Mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠaaɓaazu, gè ʋilɛ ɗa-leveiti polu.<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta pàa ɠeleɠelegi ɠaiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, gòilogɛ ɗa-ɠala gooiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>Gè pɛtɛgɛ ga kwɛ ka ani ʋapagi kpein ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">kɛlɛ ɗa-leveiti, kwɛ ge la ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>Ee, ɗa-lɔgi nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">Nà ɗa ɠisiɛ su yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>Ɗa-levei ɠa kɛ̀ɛzu ga ɠima nu, gè leʋe sìli nuiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">mazɔlɔɔ toɠa zèa yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>Gè ɠimalai zɔlɔɔga, gè leʋe nà-kalamɔinti kpein ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠisiɛzu ɗa-ɠala gooiti su.<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>Ɠigi ɠa mà, é leʋe kɛwola wɔlɔiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">tɔɔzei nà ɠolozu ɗa-leveiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>Gè la kɛɛni, kɔ̀ɠɔi ʋa ʋilɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ʋele nɔpɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">nii a kɛ gè è-laawooi zo.<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>Gè la maaɠoozani ɗa-leveiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è kàlasu.<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>Ɗa-minazeɠegi nɛɛʋɛ dàa ɠoozuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:103">é leʋe kɔin gulɔi ʋa dàaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>Ɗa-leveiti ti kɛ̀a ga ɠima nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">naa ɠa é kɛa gè zɛɛ ʋeleiti kpein wɔinzeɠea.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>È-laawooi ɠa ga lanboi kɔ̀ɠɔ wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">ta wozakalagi é volozu nà-pelei zu.<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>Gè minazeɠeni, nà ma, nà nà-minazeɠegi zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">gè ɠolo ɗa-leveiti bɛ, tɔɔzei ti zɔlegɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>Ti gòla maanɔɠɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zɛnvui ve bɛ̀, eɠɛʋelei è-laawooi bogai la.<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, yeezei nà-maamusɛ wooi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">è kàla ga ɗa-leveiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>Zɛ̀nvui ɠa faaɓaagi laawu yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">kɛlɛ gè la yeemazu ɗa-lɔgi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta balii zeizu tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">kɛlɛ gè la zeɠezu ɗa-leveiti polu.<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>Ɗa-ɠala gooiti ta nɔ̀un bɛ ɠɔ, ga ani ɓii gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">tiya ɠa ti kòozunɛɛzu zìimaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>Gè devea zìimaʋɛ ga gè ɠolo ɗa-lɔgiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">yeenɔpɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Gè woovele nuiti wɔinzeɠea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">kɛlɛ ɗa-lɔgi nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>Ɗa ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ ta nà-kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">kìtogɛ è-laawooi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>À maaɠooza bà, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">naa ɠa a kɛ gè nà-GALAGI ná-deveiti so!<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>Yeezei bù eɠɛʋelei ɗa-minazeɠegi la, naa ɠa a kɛ gè zɛnvui wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">mina kìteʋe.<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Ɠɛ ga pòluzeigi, naa ɠa a kɛ gè ɠizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">gè la ɠaazuzeɠea ɗa-leveiti ba eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Ɗa naati daaʋilisu, niiti ti zeɠezu ɗa-leveiti polu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">mazɔlɔɔ ta-ɠisiɛi ɠa nɔ ga zɛɛ vai.<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>Ɗa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti pilisu ya, niiti ti eteai zu, eɠɛ kaʋai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">naa ɠa é ba, ɗa-ɠala gooiti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>Kpùsɛi ɠa ɓalizu ga dualuagi, è seizu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">nà luazu ɗa-leveiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>Nà ziɛzu ga sɔledai ta telebodai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">mina ɠɛlɛ bà, è ʋa dɔ̀ nìmiza nuiti zeezu.<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>Ɠɛ ga pòluzeigi, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, nà-undaanɛɛi vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">mina yeeɓe bà, waso nuiti ti ʋa nìmiza.<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>Gàazu ɓɔiɗa su ga ɗa-ɓɔbai maaɓɔun fai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">ta ɗa-ɠizogi, nii è ma minazeɠeni.<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>Faa ɠɛ bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, eɠɛʋelei ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">è kàla ga ɗa-leveiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, ɠigi ve bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">ga gè ɗa-ɠala gooiti kwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, yeeɠɛɠalai ɠa è wuzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">ti ɗa-lɔgiti koloɠologa.<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Nɔ̀un nà, ɗa-leveiti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:127">é ɓudɛ zanugi maazu, anɛɛ zanu kitei.<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>Gè ɗa-lɔgiti kpein pɛtɛgɛ ga ti zɔlegɛ, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu nɔpɛ ge la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">gè zɛɛ ʋelei kpein wɔinzeɠea.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Ɗa-ɠala gooiti pagɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">naa ɠa é ba, nà makɛsu ti ma ga pagɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>È-laawooiti ma ɠulakɛlɛmai ɠa ɗa wozakalagi ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">toɠa ɗa ɠigi ve naati bɛ, niiti ti la dɛ faa mɔinmɔin kwɛni.<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>Ɗa-leveiti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">nà ti magalasu ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>Ɠaaʋote mà, è zaalai la mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">eɠɛʋelei è deveai la naati bɛ, niiti ti è nɛai ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>Sɛ̀bɛlɔ, eɠɛʋelei ɗa-minazeɠegi la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">mina va bu, faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ ge ʋa zobo sɔlɔɔ mà.<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>Fìe, è kùla nìmiza nuiti zeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">naa ɠa a kɛ gè ɗa-lɔgiti so.<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>Yeezei bù ga pagɔ, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">kàla ga ɗa-leveiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>Gàazuɗɛi ɠa yeizu eɠɛ kɔtuɗɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">tɔɔzei nuiti ti la ɗa-lɔgi zosu.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è zɔlegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">è lelebogɛ ɗa-leveiti su.<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>Ɗa-ɠala gooiti è ti veezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:138">ta ga gaamai, ti zɔlegɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>Zìi ɠa ɠalazu kòozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">tɔɔzei sìli nuiti ti yeema è-laawooiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>Ɗa-minazeɠegi ma ladalai ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">naa ɠa é ba, ti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui.<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>Nà ga nui tosu wola la ba, ti bɛ̀lɛʋiligai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">kɛlɛ gè la yeemazu ɗa-leveiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>Ɗa-lelebodai ɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ kelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">ɗa-lɔgi ɠa ga gaamai.<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Kidaaʋiligi zeelia mà, nà koozuʋiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">kɛlɛ ɗa-leveiti ka ti ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ vaiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>Ɗa-ɠala gooiti sɔlegɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">Ɠigi ve bɛ̀, nii a kɛ gè zɛnvui wo.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà wooɠulazu è ma ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ, gòoɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">nà ɠolo ɗa-leveiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>Nà wooɠulazu è ma, ʋa, è kìzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">naa ɠa a kɛ, gè ɗa-ɠala gooiti so.<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>Nà wuzeɠezu aisa geelaa ʋa lao, gè wooɠula è ma ga è ɓɔ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">kìtogɛ è-laawooi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>Nà ɲiizu ɠaazu ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">nii a kɛ gè ɗa ɠigaiziɛ ɗa-minazeɠegi zu.<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo gòoi ma, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">è zɛ̀ vulua, eɠɛʋelei ɗa-leveiti ti la.<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>Niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu, naati ta maaɓuɠaʋɛ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">ti maaɠoozaʋɛ ɗa-lɔgi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>Kɛlɛ, ɗa ɠa è kòba, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">ɗa-leveiti kpein ta ga gaamai.<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>Gè suɠwɛɛ kaite ga è ɗa-ɠala gooiti seini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">ta yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Nà-maanɔɠɔi ʋɛtɛ, è ùnmɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">mazɔlɔɔ gè la yeemazu ɗa-lɔgi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>Màalogi wo, è ùnmɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">zɛnvui ve bɛ̀, eɠɛʋelei ɗa-minazeɠegi la.<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Kizo fai maaɠoozaʋɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠolozu ɗa-leveiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-maawɔinɠai zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">Zɛnvui ve bɛ̀, eɠɛʋelei è deveai la.<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>Sìli nuiti ta wɔ̀inzeɠe nuiti mɔinʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">kɛlɛ gè la ʋoluavega ɗa-ɠala gooiti ba pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>Nà wooʋalada nuiti kaana, nà ɗa ti wɔinzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">ti la ɠolozu ɗa-leveiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠizɛ su ga ɗa-leveiti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma, zɛnvui ve bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>È-laawooi ma ungi ɠa é ga gaamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">ta ɗa-leveiti kpein ti zɔlegɛ, ta yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Zobobɛ nuiti ta wɔ̀inzeɠezu wafuun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">kɛlɛ sàsu la ɓalia, kɛni è-laawooi nɔ luɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>Kòozunɛɛʋɛ è-laawooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">eɠɛ nui nii é naavolo wola zɔlɔɔgai.<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Zɛɛi maayo ge la bɛ̀, gè wɔinzeɠeʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">kɛlɛ ɗa-lɔgi ɠa nɛai bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>Nà ɗa è maamusɛ ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela foloi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">ɗa-leveiti faa zu, ti zɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>Ziilɛi gola ɠa naati bɛ, niiti ɗa-lɔgi nɛai ti ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">ani nɔpɛ ge la ti ɠɔɠɔziɠaa, ti ʋa loo.<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>Kìtogɛ è ʋa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ga ɗa kìzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">nà ziɛzu ga ɗa-leveiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>Nà ɗa-ɠala gooiti sosu ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">tɔɔzei ti wola nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>Nà ɗa-lɔgiti ta ɗa-ɠala gooiti sosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">mazɔlɔɔ è sìɛ ʋelei kpein kwɛɛ fai pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-kpee wooi zeeli è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">faaɠaaɠaa ɠigi ve bɛ̀, é zoloo è-laawooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>Nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi zeeli è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">ùnmɔɔ, eɠɛʋelei è minazeɠeni la.<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>Dàkɔlɔgiti ti è maamusɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa kàlasu ga ɗa-lɔgiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>Nɛ̀gi è-laawooi maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-leveiti kpein sɔlegɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>È-yeei ʋa é ɓɔ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">mazɔlɔɔ gè yiimazeɠea ga ɗa-lɔgiti.<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wɔ̀inma vaa wolai ɠa ga è kìzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">ɗa-lɔgi ɠa é ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ vai.<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>Gè yɛ vulua, gè ɗa è lɛbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">ɗa-leveiti ti ɓɔ bà.<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>Nà leʋeteʋesu eɠɛ baalagi nii toai ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">Ʋa, è gàiziɛ, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">mazɔlɔɔ gè la yeemazu ɗa-leveiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s">Nui ti zɛɛi ʋɛɛzu ma, naa ná-GALA falii</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">120:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Tɛɛ wo guyei</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: É zo guyei ungila puufelegɔ é li ungila puusaʋagɔ maazu naanigɔi ʋɔ (120-134), naati ti ɠɛni ga guyeiti ti ɠɛni ti loozu, siɛgi zu ta la ɠɛna siɛi woga la, ti ɗa li Zeluzalɛme kona gilagila fɛtiiti su, ta la ɠɛna lɛa taa ɲadegai zu, nii é gizei unmaʋɛ.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 120:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">Nà-kidaaʋiligi zu, gè ɓainni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">é gòoɠaaʋoteni.<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: «Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ùnmɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">è kùla naati zea, niiti ti zɛɛi ʋɛɛzu mà, ti ɗa màayaava.»<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Leeni ɠa GALA ge ʋaazu kɛɛzu ga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">ɗɛi è zɛɛi wosu ga è-nɛgi?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>Toɠa ʋaazu kɔɔɠɔ mɛɛn ɠaazoɓagi ʋilisu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">naa ʋɛɛ abulekai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Toɠa bɛ̀ ga maanɔɠɔ vaa, sèi vai zii ɠiligiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">gè ʋa yɛ zeini wɛɛinti ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti saama!<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>Kaite nà zeini naati saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">niiti ziilɛigi wɔin la ti ma.<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>Ziilɛigi ɠa gè pɔ, kɛlɛ siɛgi zu gè ɓɔɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">tiya mu, kɔɔɠɔ vai ɠa ti pɔ.<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s">Mini ɠa nà-kpɔbai a zeɠe ná?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 121:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">Gè ɠaazulɛa ga gizeiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">mini ɠa nà-kpɔbai a zeɠe ná?<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>Nà-kpɔbai ɠa ʋaazu é zeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">nii é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛa ta zooi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>É la vaa bu, è-ɠɔɠɔi ʋa ziɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">zɔi é è makɛsu, é la ɲia.<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>Wɛlɛ, zɔi é Izilayɛle makɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">é la lia siingisiingi, é la ɲia.<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga naa, nii é è makɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga niinigi è-maaɠoolii zu,<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>foloi la è ɠalaa foloi ɲɛgɛlɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">alugi la faa ɠɛa ga ɗe kpidii.<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa faa ɲɔi kpein kpudɛ è maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">toɠa è-yɛnvui makɛ.<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɓaa è maazu, é zo è ɠula yeei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">é li è ɠalema voloi ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">é zo niizu ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s">À ziilɛigi vali Zeluzalɛme ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 122:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">Kòozunɛɛni gola, siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni mà la:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">«Ade li Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>Wɛlɛ, gi-ɠɔɠɔiti ti loga ɗa-ziɠidaʋɛti, ee, Zeluzalɛme!<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Zeluzalɛme, taa wolai togai ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">ná-siɠigiti kakugai ma, é ɠɛ ga ani ɠila kpe.<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>Miná ɠa bolodamaiti ta ɗa ʋa ná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-bolodaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">ti ʋa, ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ náʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">naa ɠa ga tɔgi Izilayɛle ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Náʋɛ ɠa masa kpɔkpɔgiti ti ná, Davide mavofodai ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">ʋɛ é zeizu ná, é ɗa tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>À GALA fali ga Zeluzalɛme ziilɛigi zɔlɔɔ, wo ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">«Zeluzalɛme, niiti ti è nɛai ʋɛ, naati ti eteai ziɛ ziilɛigi zu.<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Ziilɛigi masadai ɠɛ ɗa-ziɠigiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">ta ɗa-masa pɛlɛiti ziilɛi ɓɔɠɔ ma tɔɔn.»<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti ta bɔ̀ɔlaiti maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">zìimai ɠa ga: «Ziilɛigi ɠɛ è ʋɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ada-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ná-fai maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">nà undaanɛɛi ɠaiziɛzu è ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s">Zaalai maaɓɔun fai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 123:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">Nà ɠaazulosu è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">ɗɛi è zeini geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>Eɠɛʋelei botiɠɛ nuiti ti ɠaazulosu da ti-maliɠiiti zeeiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">ta botiɠɛ anzanui, é ɠaazulosu da maliɠi anzanui yeei ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">ʋele ɠana gi ɠaazulosu da Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gá-ƓALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">eyɛsu é gi maawɔinɠa.<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>Gi maawɔinɠa, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gi maawɔinɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">Mazɔlɔɔ ɓaaɠulamai kula ɠɛa ga giye.<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Kpɛtɛ nuiti ta-ɲɛɛɠulasui kula ɠɛa ga giye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">ta waso nuiti ta-wɔinzeɠemai.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s">Ada-ɓɔbai ɠa zɔlɔɔsu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 124:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɠɛni loni ade ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">Izilayɛle lɛ naa ma ʋolu, é bo,<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɠɛni loni ade ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">siɛgi zu nuiti ti ʋaani la, ti laalɛ ade wu,<verse eid="PSA 124:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>naazu ta la ade-ma vului ɓɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:3">siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ziiɠaawana wolai zu ade laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="PSA 124:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>Ziɛ veinfeingi a la li ga adeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">kɔtuɗɛi ɠɛni ade maaɓɔlesu.<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>Naazu ziɛ veinfein golaiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:5">ti ɠɛni yeizu ga adeye.<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii é la vaani bu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">ga ti-ɲiigaiti ti ʋa ade ʋaliʋali.<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Ade ɠulani ti ya, eɠɛ wɔnii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">pelaai é ɠula wɔni ɓɛɛ nui ná-tumɔi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">Tumɔi ʋalini ga, ade ʋela.<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>Ada-ɓɔbai ɠa ɗa zeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:8">nii é geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ɓɛtɛa.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s">Niiti ti ɠitogai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">Niiti ti ɠitosu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">naati kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ Siyɔn gizei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">é la ɲiikpiga, toɠa loni ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>Eɠɛʋelei Zeluzalɛme maaɠooliai la ga gizeiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">zekana Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti maaɠooliai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">é zo niizu ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Telebotala masadai la yɛga ma ɠɔ telebo nuiti ta-yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">nii a kɛ telebo nuiti ɓalaa ti mina yeelɔ yaava vaiti su.<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠɛ ga nu ʋagɔ naati bɛ, niiti ti ga nu ʋagɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">ta naati bɛ, niiti ti-yii zɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Kɛlɛ niiti ti zeɠezu pele ʋagɔi ʋa, ti ʋilɛ ma ɲɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti yɛʋɛ ɠɔɠɔzu, ta naati niiti ti telebotalai ɠɛɛzu!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Ziilɛigi ɠɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s">Gɔlɔiti ti valibogai ga koozunɛɛi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 126:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">Siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Siyɔn zei ʋele ɓɛtɛni la ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">é ɠɛni gi-ɠi su ga se su vaa nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>Naazu, gi la ɠɛni ɓesu ɲɛɛ wo fai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">gi ɗa koozunɛ wuyei loo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">Naazu, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma zii ɠiligiti saama:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">«Ungo, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI faa wolaiti kɛa ti ʋɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI faa wolaiti kɛɛʋɛ gi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">gá koozunɛɛi zu.<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ʋa, è gi zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">eɠɛʋelei ɗa ɗa ziɛi laa la, ziɛ yeizuʋɛti teʋebai zu.<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Niiti ti ani zuwui vazasu gaazuɗɛʋui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">ta ɠɛna teʋea, ta teʋe ga koozunɛ wuyei.<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Zɔi é liizu ga wɔlɔa ná-molo zuwui unma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">naa ɠa ɠale ma ga koozunɛ wuyei, ná-molo ɠiliiti ti zea.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s">Fai pɛ ka Maliɠii yeezu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei. Salomɔn ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 127:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la pɛlɛi loni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">to nuiti ta botii ɠɛɛzu nɔ wafuun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">Ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la taai makɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">zɔi é makɛsu, naa ɠa ɲiizu ɠaazu ɠa fuun.<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>Toɠa ga wafuun faa, wo wuzeɠe fala, wo ɗa ɠaazuɓa, wo la laa fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">wo ɗa ziizoolɛ vaiti kɛ, wo-laamianigi ɠaiziɛ vai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa nɛɛbɛ nuiti kpɛdɛma anii ve ti ya, anɛɛ siɛgi zu ti ɲiizu la.<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Wɛlɛ, dointi ta ga tuyai, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">dointi ti zɔlɔɔsu, ta ga kulanumai.<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Eɠɛʋelei mɛɛinti ti la, ti kɔɔɠuluɓai yeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">zekana doun zunuiti ti la, zunui ti zɔlɔɔsu ná-zunu loungoyai zu.<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama zunui, nii ná-ɓɔlɔi laavegai ga tiye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">É la unfega, siɛgi zu é ɓɔɛzu la sili nuiti daalɔɠɔma taai ma ziɠidaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s">Undaanɛɛi wooɠɛɠila nui sɔlɔɔsu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naa, nu-o-nu nii é luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">é ɗa ziɛ ga naa yiima ʋeleiti!<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>Botii è kɛɛzu ga è-yeei, ɗa naama lɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">è undaa ɠa nɛ, è kulanuma zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>È-anzai ɠa ɠɛ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, eɠɛ leezɛn ɓelei gaawaai mɔinɗai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">è-loun zunuiti ta ɠooli ɗa-laɓalii ma, eɠɛ wolive wului ma ʋɔnɔgiti.<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Ʋele ɠana nui a tuyai zɔlɔɔ da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:4">nii é luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa yɛ Siyɔn, é tuya loo è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">ɗa Zeluzalɛme ná-undaanɛɛi ɠa, è-zii ma voloi pɛ su,<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>ta ɗa è-lounlointi ka.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Ziilɛigi ɠɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s">Ti faa ɲɔu mɔinmɔin kɛɛni ga ze</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 129:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Kaite mà loungo ziɛgi zu ti laalɛɛni bù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Izilayɛle lɛ naa ma ʋolu, é bo,<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>kaite mà loungo ziɛgi zu ti laalɛɛni bù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">kɛlɛ ti la zobo sɔlɔɔni mà.<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>Ti kuɠui wolini pòluʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">eɠɛ nu a ɠɛ kpalagi wolizu.<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɔlegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">é faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-ɠaluiti suleʋeleʋeni mà.<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Ti unfe, ti ɠula ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">niiti kpein ti Siyɔn wɔinzeɠezu.<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>Ti ɠɛ eɠɛ pɛlɛ ɠɔma lufai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">é vɔɔzu, aisa é ʋa wɔɔlɔ,<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>nii molo leʋe nui la yeelaavega su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">ta molo ɠili nui la gilia ba ga ma ɠili.<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>Teʋe nuiti ti mina ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tuyai mɔɔ wo ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">Gá tuya loozu wo ʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu!»<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s">Kidaaʋiligi zu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 130:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:1">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kidaaʋiligi zu nà wooɠulazu è ma, è ɓɔ bà.<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>Màliɠii, woilo gòo ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">Woilo, nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooiti ma ga pagɔ!<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ni ɗa gi zona ga gá-vaaɠaaza golaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">Màliɠii, ɓɛ ɠa a yɛ vulua?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>Kɛlɛ è-ʋo ka ga maavaayɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">naa ɠa a kɛ, nu lua è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maaɓɔunsu ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">ta kìtogɛ daawooi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>Nà Maliɠii maaɓɔunsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">é leʋe maaɓɔungi ʋa nii salaʋusuiti ta ɗa bo, é lo sobui zeeli vai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">ungo, é leʋe maaɓɔungi ʋa, nii salaʋusuiti ta ɗa bo, é lo sobui zeeli vai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>Ee, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, à ɠito Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ga wooɠɛɠila GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">unmɔɔgi ma zobogi kpein ka tɔun zea.<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>Toɠa a Izilayɛle unmɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:8">é kula ná-faaɠaaza golaiti kpein su.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s">Ziilɛi ma ungi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 131:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI! Gè la wasoni zìimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">gè la ga gaazulɛɛ nu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">Gè la ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔzu faa wolaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">ɓaa niiti ti wɔɔlɔai nɔ̀un ba.<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Naa li poun, kɛlɛ gè maaɠɛgɛ kpɔ, gè ɠaalɛi kpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">zìilɛiʋɛ, eɠɛ doin daaɠulaai ɲiimii ʋa, é dee ɠoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">zìilɛiʋɛ, eɠɛ doungoi naa.<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>Izilayɛle, ɠito Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">é zo niizu ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s">Siyɔn, Masagi zeizuʋɛ, <optbreak/> ta Davide ná-taa wolai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 132:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠigaiziɛ Davide zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">ta ná-kpɔlɔiti pɛ é ti woni.<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>É niima minazeɠegi woni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">é niima minazeɠegi woni Zakɔɓe ná-Zɛbɛ-Su-ƓALAGI ʋɛ ga:<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3"/>«Gè la lɛa nà-pɛlɛi wu, nii gè bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:3">gè la lɛa nà-betei zu, ʋɛ gè laazu ná,<verse eid="PSA 132:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4"/>gè la vaa bu, ɲiimɛnii ʋa lɔ gàazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:4">gàazu ɠɔlɔgi la pɛa ma mɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 132:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5"/>eyɛsu gè ada zɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga seizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">Zakɔɓe ná-Zɛbɛ-Su-ƓALAGI ʋɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 132:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>Wɛlɛ, gi yɛni Efelata, gi minazeɠe kesui maawoo mɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">gi kaani Yaal lugi zu.<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>Ade li Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">ade nɔkɔ ná-kɔɠɔloma anii ɠakalaʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ʋa ɗa-looɠo bosuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">wa ɗa-minazeɠe kesui, nii è-zɛbɛi ɠulazu kɛlɛma.<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Telebodai ɠa ɠɛ ɗa-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti kɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">eɠɛʋelei ta ɗa seɠei loo la ɠɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">ɗa-wooɠɛɠila nuiti ti wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>Ɗa-nɛɛbɛi maaʋele ma, é lo ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui Davide ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">mina ʋoluave masagi ʋa, nii è gulɔi ziaai ma.<verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI minazeɠeni Davide ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">é la zeɠea minazeɠegi naa ʋolu, é ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">«È-mavofodai ta ɠa gè seizu ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, è-ʋotogi zu.<verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Ni è-loun zunuiti ta ziɛna ga nà-minazeɠegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">ta nà-deveiti gè ti ɠalasu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">ti-loun zunuiti ɓalaa ta zei ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa yeenɔpɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ.»<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Ungo, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeeloni Siyɔn ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">é yiimazeɠe ga ná seizu vai zu.<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>É ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">«Nà-dooɠo bosuʋɛ ɠa eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">Nà zei ná, mazɔlɔɔ wɔ̀inʋɛ ga ná.<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>Ungo, nà tuya loo bɛ, gè ani ʋagɔiti pɛ fe zea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">Nà daamianigi kpein fe bala nuiti zea, ti pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>Nà kizo fai loo ná-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti kɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti ta wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>Nà Davide ná-zobogi wɔɔlɔ Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">masagi gè gulɔi ziaai ma, nà naa ʋotogi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, eɠɛ lanboi é sosu.<verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>Nà sili nuiti maaɠili ga unfegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">kɛlɛ tɔun, ná-masa bɔɔlɔgi ɠa volo unmaʋɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s">Soloogɛ ɠɛɛɠɛlointi ma, ti ɠili ʋa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 133:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">Wɛlɛ, pagɛ, é vizɔ ɠɛɛɠɛlointi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">ga ti ɠili ʋa, ti zei ada ɠila!<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">puai Aalɔn nɔungi zu, é ɗa yei kpɛlɛiti ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">ta ná-seɠe ɠɔgi zu.<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ nɔɗagi, é ʋuuni Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">é ɗa yei Siyɔn gizei ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">Miná ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tuyai veezu ná, nii é ga zɛnvui, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s">À Maliɠii mama, ná-botiɠɛ nuiti wo pɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Tɛɛ wo guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 134:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">Ee, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama, wɔiti wo botii ɠɛɛzu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">wɔiti wo losu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, kpidii laawu!<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>À yeeiti buzeɠe, wo tete seizu ɲadegai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">wo mamagi ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛ Siyɔn, é tuya loo wo ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">tɔungi é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛa ta zooi.<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ʋagɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">À maamusɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nuiti,<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>wɔi wo losu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:2">ada-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛti.<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋagɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">À daaseigi lɛbi ga guyeiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">mazɔlɔɔ fizɔgɛ nu nɛɛ ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiimazeɠeni ga Zakɔɓe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">é ɠɛ Izilayɛle ɠɛ ga kpɔɠɔ gele.<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>Ungo, gè kwɛɛ gè ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔɔlɔʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">ade-Maliɠii ɓudɛʋɛ gala kiligiti pɛ maazu.<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>Nii nɔpɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI pɔ, naa ɠa a ɗa kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ta zooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">kpoloɗɛi ɠaaʋɛ, ta kpomaʋɛti.<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>Toɠa ɗa tonaɓiingi wuzeɠe zou ɓela ga ná pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">é mainmain zaɠa tonai zaamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">é fiilɛi ɠula ná-ani makɛsuʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>Toɠa ɓalaa é doun zunu mɔungiti pɛ paani Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">é zo nuɓusɛiti tɔnɔiti ma, é li suaiti tɔnɔiti pɔ.<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>É poogiti dɛɛni, ta maaɓɛlɛ vaiti Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">Falaɠɔn laalɔɠɔma ta ná-botiɠɛ nuiti pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>É zii ɠiligiti ma mɔinmɔin koloɠoloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">é zobobɛ masa golaiti paani:<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>naa ɠɛni ga Siɠon, Amool nuiti ta-masagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">ta Wɔge, Ɓasan nuiti ta-masagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">ta Kanaan yooi zu masagiti kpein.<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>É ta-yooi ɠɛɛni ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">é naa veeni ná-nuɓusɛiti zea, Izilayɛle nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è-lɔɠɔi ɠa ná eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zeema la woga è ma, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>Ungo, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa sɔle fai ɠɛ ná-nuɓusɛiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">toɠa maawɔinɠai ɠɛ ná-botiɠɛ nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>Zii ɠiligiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ta ga walii ta zanugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">niiti nuɓusɛiti ti ti ɓɛtɛai.<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>Daaʋɛ ɠa ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la ɓɔɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">gaazuʋɛ ɠa ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la wozaɠaazu la,<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>goiyeɠei ɠa ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la faa mɛnisu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">fiilɛ go ɠila kpalaa ge la ti-laaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Ti ɓɛtɛ nuiti kulaʋɛ ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">ta niiti kpein ti ɠitosu ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Izilayɛle mavofodaiti, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Aalɔn mavofodaiti, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama.<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Levi mavofodaiti, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">Wɔiti wo luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama.<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é tɔɔzei Siyɔn gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi zeini Zeluzalɛme.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s">Ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠwɛ ge la ba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ pagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>À galagiti ta-ƓALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>À maliɠiiti ti-Maliɠii maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>Tɔ ɠila kpe ka é maaɓɛlɛ vaa wolaiti kɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>Tɔ ɠa é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛni ga keleɠelegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>Tɔ ɠa é zooi zuvieni, é pɛɛ ziɛ wolai ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>Tɔ ɠa é wozakala golaiti kpɛtɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>É folo ɠaei ɓɛtɛni, é ɗa zei foloi unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>É alugi ta somideɠaiti kpɛtɛni, ti ɗa zei kpidii unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>É Ezipete nuiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti paani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>É Izilayɛle nuiti kulani ti zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ,<verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>ga ná-zeezuɓaai ta zobogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>Tɔ ɠa é Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ʋalini su fele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>É Izilayɛle nuiti teʋeni saamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>É Falaɠɔn ta ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti tooni bu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>É loni ná-nuɓusɛiti tuɠɔ teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>É masa golaiti koloɠoloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>É masagiti undaaʋilini, zobobɛ nu wolaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>É Siɠon undaaʋilini, Amool nuiti ta-masagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>É Wɔge undaaʋilini, Ɓasan nuiti ta-masagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>É ta-yooi veeni ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>É fe ná-botiɠɛ nui Izilayɛle ʋɛ ga nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>É ɠizɛni ade zu, siɛgi zu ade ɠɛni la maanɔɠɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>É ade ɠulani de wɔinzeɠe nuiti kpein zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>Toɠa daamianigi veezu kpɛtɛaniiti pɛ zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>À GALAGI maamusɛ, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s">Gi ɠɛni zeini Ɓaɓilɔne ziɛ wolaiti daaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>Gi ɠɛni zeini Ɓaɓilɔne ziɛ wolaiti daaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">gi ɠɛni wɔlɔzu, gi ɗa ɠigaiziɛ Siyɔn zu.<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>Gi gá-ɠɔnigiti sɛlɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">ziɛlaʋɛ wulu wolaiti ba.<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Niiti ti vɔnini gi ma, ti li ga giye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">naati ti ɠɛni gi guyeiti toona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">gi zili nuiti ti ɠɛ gi ɠoozunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">ti ɠɛ ma: «À Siyɔn wuyei tanigaa loo gi ʋɛ!»<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>Gá la zoo ɠale gi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-guyei ta loo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:4">zooi naa zu, gi ná ga wɛɛin?<verse eid="PSA 137:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>Ni nà yeemana è ma, Zeluzalɛme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">zɛbɛi ɠula zèezai ʋa!<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>Nɛ̀gi ɠata dàa ɠoozuʋɛ ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">ni gè la mɔ ɠisiɛzu è zu, Zeluzalɛme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">ni gè la è ɠɛɛni ga nà-koozunɛɛi ma un golai.<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɠizɛ naa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">nii Edɔme nuiti ti kɛɛni Zeluzalɛme zo foloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «À taa wolai zuvoo, à suvoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">eyɛsu é zeeli ma wuulaagiti ma!»<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>Ee, Ɓaɓilɔne, ɗa ʋaazu ɠoloɠolosu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti ti naa zalazu è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">nii è kɛɛni ga giye!<verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti ta è-lointi so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">ti ti lɛɛvɛ fasai ma!<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s">Nà pɔ gè è maamusɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 138:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà è maamusɛzu ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">Nà è lɛbizu ga guyeiti zɛɛ ɠalagiti gaazu.<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>Nà nɔkɔsu, gè ɠaaʋote è zei ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">gè è-laaseigi maamusɛ, ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai maaʋele ma ta ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">mazɔlɔɔ è ɗa-minazeɠegi laazeeliʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">é ɓudɛ naa maazu, nii gi-ɠigi ɠɛni ba, é lo è ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>Voloi gè wooɠulani la è ma, è gòoɠaaʋoteni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">è ìɲɔdɔɔni ʋolu, è zɛbɛi ve bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Eteai zu masagiti kpein ti è maamusɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">ta woilona è-laawooiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Ta ɠɛna guyei loa, ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kɛɛwotiiti maamusɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai wɔɔlɔʋɛ.»<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maaɠoozaʋɛ geezuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">kɛlɛ toɠa ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti kaazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">Toɠa yɛsu ɠoozama, é waso nuiti kwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>Ni nà ɠɛna ziaa kidaaʋiligi zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">ɗa zobogi veezu bɛ̀, gè zɛnvui wo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">Ɗa pele ɓesasu sìli nuiti ta-yiiɠulagi luɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">Ɗa kìzosu ga è-zɛbɛi.<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa faiti pɛ unseizu bɛ̀ ga pagɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Mina ɠɛlɛ naati ba, niiti è ti ɓɛtɛai ga è ɓɔɠɔ yeeiti.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è nà-faiti pɛ kwɛɛ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 139:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è fɛ̀ɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛga, è kwɛ̀ɛ!<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>Siɛgi zu gè zeizu la, ta siɛgi zu gè wuzeɠezu la, è ti pɛ kwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">Ɗa yɛsu ɠoozama, è nà-kisiɛi ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>Siɛgi zu gè ziɛzu la, ta siɛgi zu gè laazu la, è ti pɛ kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">è nà-peleiti pɛ kwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>Woo nɔpɛ ge ʋa ɠɛ é lɛ dà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa kwɛɛsu ɲɛgɛlɛin, nii gè ʋaazu bosu.<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>È màalatigɛ, pòluʋelei ta kàkala ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">è-yeei ɠa ʋɛɛni mà mɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>È nɔ̀un kwɛɛ fai ɠana, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ gàazu gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">kpudɛʋɛ nà-faaɠaaɠaiti pɛ maazu.<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>Mini ɠa nà li ná, màaɠooza ɗa-yɛnvui ʋa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">Mini ɠa nà ʋela, gè li ná, màaɠooza è ʋa?<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Ni nà lɛɛna geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ɗa miná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">ni nà yeina gɔvɛalaazu, ɗa miná ɓalaa.<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Ni nà ɠoʋena, gè li folo ɠulazu ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">ɓaa ni nà liina, gè zei kpoloɗɛi ʋoluʋelei,<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>miná ɓalaa, è-yeei ɠa losu tùɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">è-yeezai la ɓega bà.<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>Ni nà ɠɛna ma: «Kpidii ɠa màalɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">wozakalagi ɠa ɠɛ màaɠoolii zu ga kpidii,»<verse eid="PSA 139:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>kpidii zu la ɓidini è ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">kuai zu ɠalagɛ è ɠaazu, eɠɛʋelei wozakalagi la.<verse eid="PSA 139:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>Kɛʋelei gè su, ɗa ɠa è kpɛ̀tɛai ɠana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">ɗa ɠa è fɛ̀lɛni dèe ɠoozu.<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>È mama kɛ̀ɛzu ga kpɛtɛanii gola vizɔgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">ɗa laavɔɔ vaa wolaiti kɛɛzu, gè naa zuɠwɛɛ ga pagɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>Dɔɔɠuzu ada la ɠɛni kpùsɛi ʋa è ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">siɛgi zu è ɠɛni kpɛ̀tɛzu la dɔɔɠuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">è ɠɛai ma fɛ̀lɛzu zooi ɓomaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni la dɛ dèe ɠoozu, è ɠɛni kàazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">foloi liegɔi è kpɛtɛni bɛ̀, naa zɛʋɛʋɛ ɗa-zɛʋɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">naazu ti tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni dɛ tɔɔzeini.<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>Ɗa-ɠisiɛiti, ee, GALA, gè la zooga gè ʋa ti ɠaaɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">Ti zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ gola!<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Ni gè ti ɠaaluni, ta la mɔin, ti leʋe ɲaɠaegi ʋa, nii é kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">Wɛlɛ, nà wuunsu, gè ɠɛ è ʋa dɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>Ee, GALA, soma è nu ɲɔi ʋaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">Nu ʋaa nuiti, à maaɠooza bà!<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>Ta è-laaseigi wosu, ga tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo fai nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">ta bosu wafuun nɔ, tɛiti ti ga è zili nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, naati wɔinzeɠeʋɛ ma, niiti ti è wɔinzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">niiti è zakpesu, naati bɛlɛ la bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>Nà ti wɔinzeɠezu, ga wɔinzeɠemai ɓela ge la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">nà ti levezu ga nà ɓɔɠɔi sìli nuiti.<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>Ee, GALA, fɛ̀ɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ, è ɠɛ zìimaʋɛ ɠwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">Pòluɠula, è ɠɛ nà-ziizoolɛ vaiti kwɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>Pɛ̀tɛ, ni nà pele ɲɔu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">è lo tùɠɔ, è pìlɛ ɠɔoɠɔ pele ʋagɔi ma.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s">Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla nu ɲɔiti zea</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>Guye loo ɠundiɠii nɔnɔi ʋe. Davide ná-guyei.<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, kùla nu ɲɔiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">kìzo toosu nuiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>Ta-ɠisiɛi ɠa ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛ vai nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">folo-o-folo, kpɔɛi nɔ ɠa ti gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>Ta ti-nɛgi ɠaalizu eɠɛ kaalii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">kaali wanai ɠa é ɠulazu ti-lakɔlɔgiti bu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:4">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, màkɛ, gè mina lɔ nu ɲɔiti zeezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">Makɛ mà, è kìzo toosu nuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">niiti ti ɠisiɛzu ga ti tòo bu.<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Waso nuiti ti baliiti daa kɔ̀ɠɔ wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">nii a kɛ ti sò, ti galui ta tumɔiti daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">ti ti zei tùɠɔ pelei zu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>Gè ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma: «Ɗa ga nà-GALAGI!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooiti ma!<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Màliɠii, ɗa ga nà-zobogi, ta nà-kizogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">ɗa nɔ̀ungi makɛ kɔɔɠɔ voloi.<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mina va naa wu, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti bɛ, nii wɔin ti ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">Mina va bu, ta-vaazeikpasui ʋa zoloo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">mazɔlɔɔ ta pilɛ sɔlɔɔ naazu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:9">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>Niiti ti màaɠooliai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">maanɔɠɔi nii ti wɔinɗai ga é zeeli nɔ̀un ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">naama maanɔɠɔi zei tiya ɓɔɠɔi ti ma!<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Abuleka ɠɛzɛi ʋu ti ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">Ti voɓe abui zu, zeɠezaɠai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">ʋɛ ti la mɔ zooga ti ʋa wuzeɠe ná ɠɔ!<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nɛgiti ti ɠula eteai ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">Maanɔɠɔi ʋilɛ toosu nui ʋolu, dooɠo ge mina ɠɛ ba!<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>Gè suɠwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa telebodai ɠɛ bala nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">é sɔledai ɠɛ maanɔɠɔ nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 140:14"/>Naazu, telebo nuiti ta è-laaseigi maamusɛ wuyeiti too.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:14">Sɔle nuiti ta zei è ɠoba.<verse eid="PSA 140:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s">Màliɠii, makɛ dàawooiti ma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 141:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà wooɠulazu è ma, ʋa fala, è ɓɔ bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">Woilo gòoi ma, siɛgi zu gè wooɠulazu la è ma.<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>Nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi zɔle é lɛ è ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">eɠɛ ansanse gala luului,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">zèeiti ti maale è ma, eɠɛ kpɔkɔ zalaɠai.<verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wɛlɛ dàaʋɛ ma, è ɠaaɓa mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">dàkɔlɔgiti ma ʋɛlɛlaʋɛti makɛ.<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>Mina ɓe bà, gè ʋa li ga faa ɲɔi ʋɔ pelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">naa ɠa a kɛ, gè mina yaava ɠɛɛwotii ta ɠɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">nui naati saama, niiti ti telebotalai ɠɛɛzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">Màkɛ, gè mina naama laamii ta wo ti zaama.<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>Nà va bu telebo nui dòɠa, toɠa ná-nɛɛbɛi lɛɛzu ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">ɓaa é zeliiti to mà, naa ɠa ga gulɔ ʋagɔi nɔ̀ungi zu, nii gè la ɠɛlɛa ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Kɛlɛ nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ɠa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-vaa ɲɔi laalɔɠɔma ʋolu yee ná nɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>Ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti ʋili ya fasaiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">nu ɲɔiti ta gaaɠa niina, ga kpɔ̀ɛ wooiti pagɛ.<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Eɠɛ nu a ɠɛ wozawolizu, é ɗa zooi laaʋali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:7">ti-ma ɠaeiti ta vazasu gɔvɛalaazu ɠakalaʋɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">141:5-7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛi zu, puuzui niiti ti la wola ɠoleni.</char></note><verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Màliɠii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">è ʋɔ pelei ɠa gè ɠaaʋotegai ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">nà lɔɔɠuzu ɠaiziɛzu è ʋɔ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">Mina yee zeɠe zɛ̀nvui maazu.<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>Makɛ mà, è kìzo telebotala nuiti ta-ʋaliiti ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">ti ti laai tùɠɔ, ta ta-yaavaiti.<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti loo ti ɓɔɠɔ ʋaliiti ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">ti ʋoola bà naama ziɛgi nɔ zu.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s">Ɗa ɠa è ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzu ɠila kpegi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>Davide ná-kidafaawui. GALA falii é boni, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni pugi zu la.<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>Nà wooɠulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma ga kpee wooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">kpee wooi ɠa gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛzu la.<verse eid="PSA 142:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>Nà kpàla vai lɛɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">gè nà-kidaaʋili fai lɛɛ la.<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>Nà ʋalana zɛbɛi ma, ɗa ɠa è kwɛɛ ʋɛ gè liizu ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">Ti balii laa nà-pelei zu ga kɛɛɠɛɛi.<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>Wɛlɛ ga zèezazu ʋelei:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">Nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ná, nii é kwɛ̀ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">Gè la kwɛɛ ʋɛ nà lɔɔɠu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">nu nɔpɛ ge la yiizoolɛzu ga zɛ̀nvui ma vaa.<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa gè kpee loozu è woizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">Gè ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">ɗa ga zìima anii, fizɔgai bɛ̀, eteai nii zu ʋɛ gi zɛnvui wosu ná.»<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>Woilo nà-kpee wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">mazɔlɔɔ fikɛ nɔpɛ ge la mɔ sù.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Ùnmɔɔ, è kùla naati zea, niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">Ti zuɓaaʋɛ, ta-zobogi wɔɔlɔ nɔ̀nɔi ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 142:8"/>Fìe, è kùla kasoi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">nii a kɛ gè è-laaseigi maamusɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">Telebo nuiti ta ʋa, ti màaɠooli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:8">siɛgi zu è faanɛɛi naa ɠɛɛzu la bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 142:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s">Màliɠii, mina tukpɔ ʋɛɛ bà</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 143:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">woilo nà-fali wooiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">Gòoɠaaʋote deɠɛmu ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai zu ta ɗa-lelebodai.<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>Nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, mina tùkpɔɠaaleʋea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">mazɔlɔɔ fulu nu ɠila kpalaa ge la leleboni è ɠaazu.<verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>Sìli nui ɠa pòlu, é la ɓɔlɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">é dà zooi ma, ga é ɠɔɠɔlo mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">é sèi kpidii zu ga naati kɛʋele niiti ti zaai kaite.<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Zɛ̀nvui ɲiikpiga kòozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">zìi ɠa loɠazu ga duai.<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>Nà ɠisiɛzu siɛgiti su ti leʋegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">gè ɠisiɛ naati kpein su, niiti è ti ɠɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">gè ɠida è-yeei ná-botii ɠɛ ʋeleiti bu.<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>Gè zèeiti maalega è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">nà ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu è ɠakala, eɠɛ zooi fɔai.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 143:6">Lo!<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ʋa fala, è gòoɠaaʋote!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Zɛ̀nvui zeelia ɠwɛgi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">Mina ʋoluave bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">gè ʋa ɠɛ ga naati kɛʋele, niiti ti ti-zaa ɠizei lɛɛzu niina.<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>Geelaa ɠa laona nɔ feya, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai lɛ ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa dàai è la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">Pelei lɛ ga ze, nii maanɛai gè ziɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">mazɔlɔɔ gè ɠaaʋotega è ma.<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ùnmɔɔ, è kùla sìli nuiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">nà lɔɔɠuzu è ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>Kàla ga è-yiimai ɠɛɛ vai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa è ga nà-GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">Ɗa-Yɛnvu ʋagɔi lo tùɠɔ zooi zu, ʋɛ faaɓa la ná.<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zɛ̀nvui makɛ, è-laaseigi wɔɔlɔ vai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">Ɗa-lelebodai maaʋele ma, ùnmɔɔ, è kùla kidaaʋiligi zu.<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>Ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ʋɔ, sìli nuiti daaɠulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">È naati undaaʋili, niiti ti wɔ̀inzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">mazɔlɔɔ nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s">Masagi ná-GALA falii</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 144:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nà-fasai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">nii é kàlasu ga kɔɔɠɔ vai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">é kɛ̀ʋele ɓɛtɛzu kɔɔɠɔ vai ma.<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>Nà-wooɠɛɠila ƓALAGI ʋe, é mà ga siɠigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">Toɠa ga dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ, ta ùnmɔɔ nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">Toɠa ga nà-kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi, nii gè lɔɔɠuzu poluʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">Tɔ ɠa é nà-nuɓusɛiti kolozu bɛ̀.<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nui ɠa ga leeni, è ʋa li daazɔbosu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">Nuɓusɛi ɠa ga leeni, è ʋa li ɠisiɛzu ná-faa zu?<verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>Nuɓusɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ fiilɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">ná-eteai ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ niinigi, é leʋesu.<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-ɠeeɠɔlɔgi ziɛ su, è yei ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">Yeeɓeɠai vɔɔɠu lɛɛ gizeiti ba, duului ɠula ti ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Mainmainti saɠa lɛɛ, è sìli nuiti suvaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">Ɗa-mɛɛinti pili, è ti zuvaza.<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>Yɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ, è yeemaale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">ùnmɔɔ, kùla ziɛ wolaiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">zii ɠiligiti ta-zobogi ya.<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>Ti-laaʋɛti ta ga zɛɛ wo daaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">ta-ɠonaiti kpein ta ga kona nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>Ee, GALA! Nà guye niinɛ loo è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">nà guyei loo è maamusɛ vai ma, kɔnigi ɠa nii galu puugɔi ga.<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>GALA ka é kpɔbai ɠɛɛzu masagiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">é ná-botiɠɛ nui Davide ɠula boɠa zɔkpɔ ɲɔi laawu.<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>Ʋa è kìzo, è kùla zii ɠiligiti ta-zobogi ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">ti-laaʋɛti ta ga zɛɛ wo daaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">ta-ɠonaiti kpein ta ga kona zɔmaiti nɔ.<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>Gi-loun zunuiti, ta-loungo ziɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">ti wuzeɠe eɠɛ siinziin ganigiti ti zuɓaai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">Gi-loun anzanuiti ti pagi wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">eɠɛ kpɛdɛgiti ti maaʋɔnɛai, ti masa pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>Gá-molo ɠotaiti daave, é ʋooʋa ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">ga daamianigi ma zii pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">Gá-logani goiti ti ɓalaɠaiti su, ti mɔin gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">ti ɠɛ ga waawaagiti, ta waaʋuupuugiti.<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>Gá-nikɛiti ti ɠaawɔɔlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">Gi ɠizo toosui ma ta duɔlai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">ta kidaaʋili kpeei taa zaamaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga nuɓusɛi naati, niiti naa ɠɛɛzu ti ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga nuɓusɛi naati, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ga ta-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s">Ɗa-masadai ɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ masadai</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Maamusɛ wuyei. Davide ná-guyei.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 145:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">145:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Guyei tanigaa zu, guyei laaɠulazuʋɛti tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Eɓulu zɛʋɛ ɠae puufelegɔ maazu felegɔi gila, é zoloo ti-ɲɛkpɛ ʋelei ma. Ti laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">sɛʋɛ ɠae wuyeiti.</char>
    </note>Nà è mamasu gola, nà-GALAGI, nà-Masagi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">Nà yɛ è-laaseigi lɛbizu, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Nà yɛ è lɛbizu folo nɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">nà yɛ è maamusɛzu eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔɔlɔʋɛ, toɠa maamusɛi kpein soloogai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">nu la zooga é ʋa ná-bɔɔlɔi ɠaaɠa.<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai ma nuɓusɛi ɠilagilagi pɛ ge ɗa-ɠɛɛwotiiti maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">faa wolaiti è ti ɠɛai, ti naati suɠula,<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>ta ɗa-lɛbiyai é volozu, naama maayikii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">Nɔ̀un, nà ɠigaiziɛzu ɗa-vaa maanɛɛnɛgiti su.<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>Ti ɗa-zobogi maayiki vai wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">nɔ̀un nà, ɗa-vaa wolaiti ka gè ti zula.<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>Ta ɠizɛ ɗa-nuɓɔɠɔlai wɔɔlɔ ʋelei zu, ti ɗa dɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">ta guyei loo ɗa-zɔledai ʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é zaalai veezu, é ɠɛ ga maawɔinɠaa ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">zii la ɠula fala, kpɛtɛai wooɠɛɠiladai zu.<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋagɛ nu pɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">toɠa ga maawɔinɠaa ƓALAGI ná-kpɛtɛanii pɛ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Ɗa-ɓɛtɛaniiti kpein ti è lɛbi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">ɗa-wooɠɛɠila nuiti ti è maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>Ta ɗa-masadai ma lɛbiyai ma vai wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">ti zeze ga ɗa-zobodai ma vai.<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>Ɗa-vaa wolaiti è ti ɠɛai, ta nuɓusɛiti kala ga naati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">naa ʋɛɛ ɗa-masadai ma lɛbiyai ʋa, é volozu.<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>Ɗa-masadai ɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ masadai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">ɗa-ɠundiɠilai ɠa yɛsu ná, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 145:13"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ga wooɠɛɠila nu ná-minazeɠegiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">daavegɛ ga nuɓɔɠɔlai fai kpein su é kɛɛzu.<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa naati suzo, niiti ti loozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">é naati sɔle, niiti ti ɓiligai.<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Fuluaniiti pɛ gaazulogɛ è ʋa kitogi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">Ɗa ɠa è ti ɠɔnɔgi veezu ti ya, ma yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔi ma.<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>Ɗa ɗa yeavie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">è naati maavai kpein kɛ, niiti ti yɛnvuzu.<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɔlegɛ ná-fai pɛ su nii é kɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">nuɓɔɠɔʋɛ ná-kɛɛwotiiti pɛ su.<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa naati kobaʋɛ, niiti ti wooɠulazu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">niiti dɔin ti wooɠulazu ma ga gaamai.<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>Toɠa gaazuluaba nuiti ziima vaiti kpein kɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">a ta-ɓee wooi mɛnina, é ti ɠizo.<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa naati pɛ makɛ, niiti ti nɛai ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">kɛlɛ toɠa nu ɲɔiti kpein koloɠolo.<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>Nà zeze ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-maamusɛ vai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">Kpɛtɛanii kpein ge dɛbi, tɛigi é ga GALAGI, ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">ta naa ɠɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s">Màliɠii ɠa ɗa faa zɔlegai ɠɛ <optbreak/> zobobɛlala nuiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">Nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbizu ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ!<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Nà yɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbizu sìi ma voloi pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">nà nà-GALAGI lɛbi ga guye wooi, ni nà dɛ nɔ vulua.<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>À mina ɠaliva eteai zu zobobɛ nuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">ta nɔ ga nuɓusɛiti, zobo ge la ti ʋɛ, ti ʋa nu ɠizo.<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>Siɛgi zu ti yii loozu la, ta ɠalesu ma zooi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">gaamanɔ, ti ɠisu vai pɛ gaa ɠa ʋala ba.<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naa, nii ná-kpɔba nui ga Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">nii é ɠitosu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, ná-GALAGI.<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛa, ta zooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">ta kpoloɗɛi, ta ti zu aniiti kpein.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">Toɠa ga wooɠɛɠila nu yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>Toɠa ɗa sɔle fai ɠɛ naati bɛ, niiti ti ti nimizazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">é daamianigi ve naati zea, niiti pului ti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa naati pilɛ, niiti ti kasoi ɠa.<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa gaazuɠole nuiti gaazuʋɛ zeɠe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa naati gaalɔ, niiti ti ɓiligai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa naati nɛɛ ʋɛ, niiti ti zɔlegai.<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa seikɔɠɔma nuiti makɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">Toɠa ɗa podoin zuzo, ta poanzai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa nu ɲɔi ɠisu vaiti gaaʋala ba.<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">ee, Siyɔn, ɗa-ƓALAGI ɠa yɛ ná, yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-zobogi kpɛtɛaniiti unda <optbreak/> ta faa wɔlɔmaiti su</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">Mazɔlɔɔ soloogɛ nu guyei loo ada-ƓALAGI lɛbi vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">mazɔlɔɔ faa ʋagɔ ʋe ta fizɔgɛ ga nu maamusɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa Zeluzalɛme losu ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">Izilayɛle nui niiti ti liini ga tiye duɔlai zu, toɠa naati gaalɛ ba náʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>Toɠa naati balo, niiti ti yiiɠoloɠologai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">é ta-ʋalaiti gaaɠili.<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>Toɠa a ɗa somideɠaiti tiegi leve ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">é ti ɠilagilagi laaseigi ʋɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>Ade-Maliɠii wɔɔlɔʋɛ, ná-zobogi maayiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">ná-keleɠelegi ɠwɛ ge la ba.<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti suzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa nu ɲɔiti toka, é ti la mɛɛn zooi ma.<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>À guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">À guyei loo ada-ƓALAGI lɛbi vai ma ga kɔnigi.<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>Toɠa ɗa geeɠɔlɔgi maalɔɔɠu ga tonaɓiingiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">é tonai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ eteai ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">é tufaiti pɔnɔ gizeiti ma.<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>Toɠa ɗa togani ɓulugiti daamianigi ve ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">è kalawɔni yiʋoiti kɔnɔgi ve ti ya, siɛgi zu ti ɓainsu da ga pului.<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>Sooi ná-suɓaai la gaazu ga faa nɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">kɔɔɠɔ nui ná-zɛbɛi laade, a ɗa ziilɛi.<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔinʋɛ ga naati, niiti ti luazu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">niiti ti ɠitosu ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ʋa.<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>Zeluzalɛme, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Siyɔn, ɗa-ƓALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é ta ɓɔgɛ è makɛ vai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">toɠa tuya loozu è-lointi pɛ bɛ è ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>Toɠa ɓaazu ɗa-you ɠwɛgiti ma, ɗa zoo è zei ziilɛigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">toɠa molo ʋagɔi ɠɛɛzu ga wo-laamianigi.<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>Toɠa ná-devei leʋesu eteai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">Daawooi ɠa ɓizɛzu fala.<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>Toɠa kɔɔlɛ vukɔi vazasu eɠɛ baala deɠai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">é ɓumugi vaza eɠɛ zuʋui.<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>Toɠa sakɔtui ʋilisu eɠɛ kɔtui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">Ɓɛ ɠa a ziɛ ná-dɛii wu?<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>Kɛlɛ a devei veena feya, ti ɠaa ɠa ɗa wuun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">a ná-fiilɛi ʋuuna ti ma, ti-ma ɗɛi ɠa ɗa yei.<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>Toɠa daawooi wosu Zakɔɓe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">é ná-deveiti ta ná-tɔgiti fe Izilayɛle ya.<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>É la ɠɛni naa ɠɛɠala ɠɛɛni zii taɠili nɔpɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">tanɔpɛ ge la ná-tɔgi ta ɠwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s">GALA maamusɛ vai geeɠɔlɔgi zu ta eteai zu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">À maamusɛ, wɔiti wo geezuʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>À maamusɛ, wo pɛ ná-geezuɠeelaiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">À maamusɛ, wo pɛ geezu ɠɔɔɓɔgiti!<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>À maamusɛ, foloi ta alugi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">À maamusɛ, wo pɛ somideɠaiti, wɔiti wo volozu!<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>À maamusɛ, ee, geeɠɔlɔgiti ti maaɠoozaai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">Wa ɓalaagi, ziɛiti wo maazuʋɛ geezuʋɛ!<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Naama aniiti kpein ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">Mazɔlɔɔ é devei veeni, ti pɛ ti ɓɛtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>É ti zeini ga ti yɛ ɠɛʋele ma eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">é ɠɛ ga tɔgi é la valiboga eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, wɔi pɛ wo eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">wɔi wo ga kpoloɗɛ wu zua wolaiti, kpoloɗɛ wu yeɠezaɠaiti wo pɛ,<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>mainmain, sakɔtui, kɔɔlɛ vukɔi, ɓumugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">fiilɛ wolai nii é ɠolozu daawooi ʋɛ,<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>gizeiti ta gize goiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">gwaa wuluiti ta sɛdele guluiti kpein,<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>dɔɓɔ zuaiti ta toganiiti kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">niiti kpein ti ɓokposu ɓaa ti ɠoʋesu,<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>eteai zu masagiti ta nuɓusɛiti kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">kundiɠiiti ta eteai leve nuiti,<verse eid="PSA 148:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>zunu loungoiti ta anzanu loungoiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:12">kɛwola wɔlɔiti ta doungoiti!<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">Mazɔlɔɔ daaseigi ɠa bɔɔlɔai ti pɛ unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">ná-maayikii zooi ta geeɠɔlɔgi laaɠulaʋɛ.<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>É zobogi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ ná-nuɓusɛiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Naa ɠa ga ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ vaa ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Izilayɛle nuiti, nuɓusɛiti ti maaɓuɠaai tɔun ba.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti nɛɛʋɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">À guye niinɛi loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">À maamusɛ ga guye wooiti ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti ta-ɠaalɛbai zu!<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Izilayɛle, ɠoozunɛ è Ɓɛtɛ Nui ʋɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">Siyɔn nuiti, à ɠɛ koozunɛɛi zu wa-masagi ná-faa zu!<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>Ti maamusɛ ga kua wo fai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">ti guyei loo dɛbi vai ma ga tamadegi ta kɔnigi.<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti ti ziimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">toɠa ɗa kizo fai ve ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti bɛ eɠɛ kɔbu anii.<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>Ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti ti ɠoozunɛ, ti ɲaɠai ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">ti wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi, ta ɠɛna laani ta-ʋeteiti su.<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>GALA maamusɛ vai ɠɛ ti-laaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">boɠa zɔkpɔi gaaʋɛ fele, naa ɠɛ zoni ti ya,<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>ga ti potokulai ɠɛ la zii ɠiligiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">ti nuɓusɛiti maaɠolo la.<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>Ti ta-masagiti gili ga yɔlɔɠɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">ti ta-nu wolaiti gili ga kɔluiti.<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>Tukpɔi nii ma vai zɛʋɛai, ti naa la ti unma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Naa ɠa ga unbuzeɠe vaa wola ná-wooɠɛɠila nuiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s">À GALA maamusɛ ga gɛingɛin ganigiti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">À GALA maamusɛ seizu ɲadegai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">À maamusɛ geezuʋɛ, ʋɛ ná-zobogi ná!<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>À maamusɛ ná-faa wolaiti faa zu, é kɛɛzu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">À maamusɛ, é zoloo bɔɔlɔ ʋelei ma, nii kpela ge la ba!<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>À maamusɛ ga baala minɛ ʋuʋugi wooi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">À maamusɛ ga kɔnigi ta papai!<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>À maamusɛ ga tamadegi wooi ta kuai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">À maamusɛ ga kɔnigiti ta koolei wooi!<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>À maamusɛ ga kɔtɛgi ɠɛin gooi goo ɠulazu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">À maamusɛ ga kɔtɛgi ɠɛin gooi gaaɓaingai!<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>Nii kpein é yɛnvuzu, naa pɛ ge Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6"/>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ!<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
